window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2401,"title":"Chapter 2401 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Tongque had occasionally heard people tease the sacred lady with the crown prince together over the years. Zuo Qingluan would chide those people, but afterward, she would always smile.","“Now!” Zuo Qingluan prompted.","“Yes!” Tongque happily went to run the errand for her.","She was thrilled to know that their sacred lady had a relationship with the famous crown prince.","Because she knew that when a noble lady married, their maid usually became the new husband’s concubine. Tongque was from a good family herself, so the prospect of becoming a concubine didn’t excite her much. However, becoming Jun Linyuan’s concubine was a completely different story!","The crown prince had two residences, which was unprecedented.","He said he needed the freedom, or he would stop being the crown prince. What could Emperor Wu do? In the end, he had to build another house for Jun Linyuan outside the palace.","Jun Linyuan never stayed at his residence in the palace.","Instead, he usually lived in the other one.","Tongque was confident that she would be warmly welcomed by the crown prince’s residence.","After all, she was from Firmament Palace!","THE Firmament Palace!","However...","She was received by the doorman first.","The old man didn’t react to the name of Firmament Palace, but he almost jumped when he heard Zuo Qingluan’s name.","Zuo Qingluan?!","Didn’t she and Feng Wu used to be called the two genius girls of the imperial capital? That was big news!","He immediately sent a young servant to deliver the message to Feng.","Feng was hard to locate, so he found Granny Gong in the end.","Granny Gong frowned when she saw the letter. “Zuo Qingluan? As in that young lady of the Zuo family?”","The young servant said, “Yes, her. The maid is so arrogant. Granny Gong, what should we do?”","It seemed that someone had upset the crown prince recently, and he was very grumpy. The entire residence was on edge.","The servant said, “Doesn’t everyone say that His Royal Highness is fond of Miss Zuo? Will he be less angry if we invite the lady here?”","Granny Gong found the suggestion idiotic. Who said that His Royal Highness was fond of Zuo Qingluan? She had to get rid of that rumor!","She opened the letter to see that it had been written on top-quality paper, and the handwriting was beautiful as well.","Before Granny Gong could make up her mind, Tongque came in with someone else.","That person was Zhen Xia, one of the head maids in the crown prince’s residence.","She showed Tongque in.","Zhen Xia smiled. “I saw that Tongque came to see His Royal Highness when I returned, so I showed her in. She represents Firmament Palace, so we have to be polite. Don’t you agree, Granny Gong?”","Granny Gong narrowed her eyes.","Zhen Xia only smiled innocently.","Granny Gong said indifferently, “His Royal Highness isn’t in. If Miss Zuo wants to visit, please find another day.”","Tongque’s face darkened.","She had never thought that a maid would stop her."]},{"number":2402,"title":"Chapter 2402 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","People of Firmament Palace felt that they were better than everyone else, especially when that person was the maid of the sacred lady. Tongque immediately put on a long face and said harshly, “Please tell His Royal Highness that I’m here. My sacred lady is waiting for a reply.”","Granny Gong remained unperturbed. “I have your letter here, but His Royal Highness is busy. He won’t be seeing you today. Please leave.”","Tongque was genuinely angry now.","She was used to getting things her way in Firmament Palace. All the pupils used to fawn on her to get close to the sacred lady.","At that thought, she smirked and said in a threatening tone, “There will be consequences if His Royal Highness is upset!”","She believed that her sacred lady was the most promising cultivator of her generation!","Granny Gong was obviously displeased. She glanced at Xiangcao and turned around.","“See her out!” Granny Gong was angry as well.","Xiangcao smiled at Tongque. “Miss whatever-you’re-called, please leave.”","Tongque said, “I’m Tongque, Miss Qingluan’s maid.”","Miss Qingluan the sacred lady? As impressive as that sounded, the title was nothing compared to that of a crown prince. A servant of the crown prince’s residence wouldn’t be threatened.","Xiangcao said indifferently, “In that case, Miss Tongque, please leave.”","Tongque stomped her foot in frustration.","These people!","She decided that she was going to complain to the sacred lady.","In Phoenix Yard.","When Tongque complained to Zuo Qingluan about how arrogant the servants of the crown prince’s residence were...","“Smack!”","Zuo Qingluan slapped her.","“My lady, why?” Tongque looked at her in disbelief.","Zuo Qingluan’s face was livid.","Tongque didn’t understand.","“My lady, His Royal Highness is so fond of you. If he knows how rude his servants are, he’ll definitely punish them!” The slap calmed Tongque down, and she tried to comfort her mistress.","Zuo Qingluan didn’t know what to say.","Even she had to show Granny Gong some respect, but Tongque had... How dare she?!","Tongque had no idea that the rumor that Jun Linyuan was fond of Zuo Qingluan came from people whom Zuo Qingluan had hired.","But she couldn’t tell Tongque that since it would be so humiliating.","“The person that told you off was Granny Gong. From now on, when you deal with her...” Zuo Qingluan took a deep breath.","“What? Do we have to deal with that fierce woman again?” Tongque thought in frustration.","Zuo Qingluan kept her gaze on her. “From now on, show her some respect!” At least until she married Jun Linyuan.","She could tell that Tongque was still unconvinced, so she smirked. “If I see that you’re doing things behind my back, I have more than enough replacements for you!”","Those words made Tongque go pale.","She dropped to her knees and swore that she would respect Granny Gong from now on.","After that, Zuo Qingluan remained in a bad mood.","Tongque stumbled back in fear.","She knew that it was the silence before a storm, and she wanted to run away.","Just then, they heard footsteps. It was Mrs.. Zuo."]},{"number":2403,"title":"Chapter 2403 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Mrs. Zuo came with Granny Tao and Xiu, her young maid.","She was thrilled to see Zuo Qingluan and quickly walked up to her. “Luan, it’s been five years, and I finally get to see you again. Luan, you’re such a big girl now —”","Mrs. Zuo was so excited that she was in tears, but Zuo Qingluan only seemed impatient.","After much thought, Mrs. Zuo decided to tell Zuo Qingluan about her siblings; otherwise, she wouldn’t be able to sleep.","“I’m in a bad mood now. Please leave,” Zuo Qingluan said coldly before Mrs. Zuo could finish.","Mrs. Zuo felt like she had just been slapped.","Xiu, her maid, felt sorry for her.","She stepped forward on Mrs. Zuo’s behalf.","“Miss Qingluan, isn’t this a bit outrageous? During the years you were away, your mother missed you so much she could barely eat or sleep.","“How can you treat your mother like this? That’s so cold!","“Miss Qingluan, do you know...”","Mrs. Zuo was relieved that someone was speaking up for her.","However —","Zuo Qingluan kept her cold gaze on Xiu and asked calmly, “Are you telling me off now?”","Xiu stopped abruptly. “Miss Qingluan, I’m just...”","“Yes, you are,” Zuo Qingluan said calmly. Then —","Smack!","She slapped Xiu.","Xiu was just a maid with no spiritual essence.","But Zuo Qingluan was a powerful Spiritual King.","And she didn’t try to hold back her strength.","Poof!","Xiu’s face — more precisely, her whole head, exploded.","She dropped to the ground and died.","Gosh!","Granny Tao almost passed out.","Miss Qingluan had just...","Mrs. Zuo stared at Zuo Qingluan in disbelief as well.","“Qingluan, you...”","Why was her daughter like this?","What had she experienced in Firmament Palace?","Why was she surprised? Zuo Qingluan looked at Mrs. Zuo indifferently. After Feng Wu, people’s lives just didn’t matter to her anymore.","“Get her out of here.”","Zuo Qingluan had come back with a lot of servants this time.","After that, two silent men came out. One dragged Xiu out, and the other one cleaned the floor. Soon, it seemed that nothing had happened.","Mrs. Zuo was still in shock.","“Qingluan, you...” Mrs. Zuo was shaking from head to toe.","“Mother, please leave. I need to cultivate now.” Zuo Qingluan sounded as if she was talking to a stranger.","Mrs. Zuo felt a chill run down her spine. Granny Tao walked her out after that.","Thump!","The door to Phoenix Yard closed.","Mrs. Zuo put a hand on her chest and panted. She pointed at Phoenix Yard but couldn’t utter a word.","“How did she become like this? How? She’s so cold! I’m her mother!” She had just killed her mother’s maid!"]},{"number":2404,"title":"Chapter 2404 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Granny Tao was frightened as well. This also successfully terrified the rest of the manor, and everyone was now afraid of Zuo Qingluan.","“Miss Qingluan has grown up...” That was all Granny Tao could say.","After Mrs. Zuo left, Zuo Qingluan looked at Tongque.","Tongque shivered and dropped to her knees.","As Zuo Qingluan’s personal maid, Tongque knew better than anyone else how cold-blooded the sacred lady was. Everyone else was like ants in her eyes!","“Go ask around. Find out where His Royal Highness is today.” Zuo Qingluan’s expression became a little softer when she thought about Jun Linyuan.","Tongque stole a glance at her mistress. Seeing the soft look on her face, Tongque didn’t relax. Instead, it only gave her a strange feeling, and a chill ran down her spine.","“Yes.” Tongque promptly left after that.","Zuo Qingluan had bought off some maids in the crown prince’s residence already, so Tongque could easily find out where the crown prince was.","“The Ninth Hall?” Hearing that, Zuo Qingluan looked pleased.","“Good. I’ll run into him there,” she said to herself.","Tongque kept her head lowered, but she was filled with doubts.","All this time, she and everyone else in Firmament Palace had been told that the crown prince was deeply in love with their sacred lady.","But it seemed now that her mistress was having trouble even seeing the crown prince. What was wrong?","Fallen Star Yard.","Chaoge came back with the news. “Xiao Wu, His Royal Highness will be at the Ninth Hall today.”","“The Ninth Hall? Good. Let’s go,” said Feng Wu happily.","She had just made up her mind that she would finish this task as soon as she could manage.","Since there was no way around it, the sooner she could complete it, the better it would be.","To make Jun Linyuan fall in love with her... Feng Wu buried her face in her hands. It sounded so embarrassing, but to save her beautiful master, she had to do it.","However, she felt that to make Jun Linyuan fall in love with her would definitely be very difficult.","She kept thinking about it on her way to the Ninth Hall, so focused that she didn’t notice her surroundings. As soon as she arrived, she saw her archenemy.","Zuo Qingluan? Feng Wu frowned.","Today wasn’t her lucky day.","When she saw Zuo Qingluan, Zuo Qingluan saw her as well.","Their eyes met.","Time seemed to go back five years.","The road outside the Ninth Hall was bustling.","Both girls were the center of attention.","When people saw the two of them run into each other, they couldn’t wait to see something happen.","Since they were all from influential families, they weren’t as obvious about it as the common people.","They were filled with curiosity, but they didn’t say anything.","Zuo Qingluan’s gaze only landed on Feng Wu for a split second before she looked away as if Feng Wu didn’t exist."]},{"number":2405,"title":"Chapter 2405 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","She ignored Feng Wu!","She completely ignored Feng Wu!","The crowd was shocked that Zuo Qingluan made it seem like she hadn’t seen Feng Wu.","If Zuo Qingluan looked displeased, that meant that Feng Wu could still affect her.","But it seemed that Feng Wu was no more than an ant.","Zuo Qingluan turned around and walked into the building with Tongque.","Chaoge only realized what had happened when they were gone.","She was furious.","“Xiao Wu! She ignored you!” Chaoge stomped her foot angrily. “How can she be so arrogant? Who does she think she is, a princess? I’m so mad!!!”","Feng Wu looked pensive.","She found Zuo Qingluan’s attitude quite interesting.","“Let’s go.” She led Chaoge inside as well.","But the crowd still waited outside.","They had all seen Zuo Qingluan’s attitude and were waiting for some more drama.","“Isn’t Zuo Qingluan supposed to be very powerful now?”","“I heard that she’s already a Spiritual King!”","“Really? I thought that Feng Wu was making some rapid progress, but Zuo Qingluan is even faster!”","“Of course. Zuo Qingluan has the True Phoenix Blood!”","“Have you ever heard of that particular saying?”","“Do you mean the one which says that when the dragon and phoenix join hands, we’ll have eternal peace?”","“Yes, that one!”","“Does the phoenix refer to the Feng clan?”","“No, it doesn’t. It refers to the True Phoenix Blood! As for the dragon, of course, it refers to the royal family. His Royal Highness is the next True Dragon.”","“So, you’re saying that His Royal Highness and Zuo Qingluan...”","“Exactly!”","“That makes sense! See, His Royal Highness is the most capable teenager of his generation.”","“That’s true!”","“Not only is Miss Zuo Qingluan from one of the nine major families, she’s also the pupil of the master of Firmament Palace. No other girl her age has achieved that.”","“Gosh, a Spiritual King! She’s amazing!”","“Plus, she also has the True Phoenix Blood! That’s one of a kind!”","“So, shouldn’t she be His Royal Highness’s future wife?”","Someone said timidly, “I think Miss Feng Wu is just as good as she is...”","Many people retorted.","“Miss Feng Wu? Yes, she’s good, but she doesn’t have the True Phoenix Blood!”","“But she used to...”","“Not anymore. It means that she just isn’t lucky enough to possess it. It’s natural selection!”","“I agree.. She’s just not built for such blessings.”"]},{"number":2406,"title":"Chapter 2406 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Many people shook their heads.","Zuo Qingluan was walking up the stairs when she heard the conversation. She smiled a little.","Behind her, Feng Wu shook her head in resignation.","“Xiao Wu, aren’t you angry? She’s the one...” Chaoge pointed at Zuo Qingluan and was furious.","Feng Wu smiled. “Already upset? That’s nothing.”","Chaoge said, “What do you mean?”","Feng Wu patted her shoulder. “Don’t worry. We’ll soon get back at her in relation to what she cares about the most.”","Chaoge lowered her voice and asked, “What’s that?”","Feng Wu was speechless. “What do you think?”","Chaoge’s eyes lit up. “Do you mean...”","Feng Wu stopped her. “Don’t spoil it just yet.”","Chaoge was thrilled. She held Feng Wu’s hand and said excitedly, “Xiao Wu, you can like His Royal Highness now! I won’t be unhappy! Let’s upset her as much as we can!”","Feng Wu said, “Were you unhappy before?”","Chaoge said, “Well...”","Feng Wu patted her head. “Don’t worry. I only need Jun Linyuan to fall in love with me. As for me...” Feng Wu thought about the handsome teenager and let her voice trail off.","Chaoge didn’t understand why Feng Wu stopped talking all of a sudden. Just then, someone showed up.","“Miss Yue.” Feng Wu had dealt with Yan Yue several times before.","Yan Yue smiled politely at Feng Wu, but she was filled with emotion.","If she hadn’t seen how the crown prince treated Feng Wu, she would never believe that her young master had such a gentle side.","But she would never tell another soul.","“Miss Feng Wu.” Yan Yue smiled at her. “Are you here for His Royal Highness?”","Feng Wu would have said no on a normal occasion, but she nodded this time.","Yan Yue led Feng Wu to the eighth floor of the tower.","Each floor of the tower had an entry requirement, and to enter the eighth floor, one had to be either a Spiritual King or a very influential figure of the empire.","Right now, there were only two people there.","They were Zuo Qingluan and Tongque.","Recalling how grumpy her young master had been recently, Yan Yue was even more polite to Feng Wu.","She hoped that the sight of Feng Wu would appease the crown prince. “Miss Feng, please wait here. I’ll come back for you when His Royal Highness is free.”","Meanwhile, a maid was serving tea to Zuo Qingluan.","Yan Yue personally took a cup of tea from the tray and put it next to Feng Wu.","She was the head of this tower, and she had just served Feng Wu a cup of tea!","Zuo Qingluan was perplexed.","Although she wanted to ignore Feng Wu, Yan Yue was hovering...","Zuo Qingluan hated to think that Yan Yue was attending to Feng Wu like a maid, but that was exactly what it was.","The sacred lady’s face was livid.","She thought very highly of herself and wouldn’t speak to Feng Wu, so she glanced at Tongque.","In Zuo Qingluan’s circle, Feng Wu had always been a villain, so Tongque thought that she knew everything about Feng Wu."]},{"number":2407,"title":"Chapter 2407 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Tongque gave Feng Wu an arrogant look and frowned at Yan Yue. “Miss Yue, isn’t this inappropriate?”","Yan Yue was attending to Feng Wu’s needs. Seeing Feng Wu eat another strawberry, she made a mental note that she would prepare more strawberries for Feng Wu next time.","Just then, she heard Tongque’s voice.","Yan Yue frowned and glanced at her. “What’s inappropriate?”","Tongque said, “Doesn’t the tower have rules? Chief Yan Yue, you of all people should know what visitors belong to which floor.”","Yan Yue said, “Of course I do.”","Tongque was almost rendered speechless. She snorted and pointed at Feng Wu. “If that’s the case, why is she here on the eighth floor?”","Zuo Qingluan was here because she was a Spiritual King, but why was Feng Wu here?","Yan Yue looked from Tongque to Zuo Qingluan and frowned.","She was indeed the head of the nine-story tower, and many people in the imperial capital tried to curry favor with her, but at the end of the day, she was only the crown prince’s subordinate.","Therefore, despite knowing that the crown prince was interested in Feng Wu, she also thought that Zuo Qingluan might stand a chance.","Thus, she wasn’t going to offend Zuo Qingluan. However, she didn’t like Tongque’s attitude either.","“Miss Feng Wu is qualified to be here.” Yan Yue smiled mildly and looked at Zuo Qingluan.","Zuo Qingluan looked displeased.","“What if my sacred lady insists that she should leave?” Tongque retorted. “Miss Yue, will you do this favor for Firmament Palace?”","She thought that the mention of Firmament Palace would persuade Yan Yue.","Tongque smiled, and Zuo Qingluan still ignored Feng Wu.","She decided that ignoring Feng Wu was her most formidable weapon.","To their surprise, Yan Yue smiled and said, “I’m sorry, but I can’t do that.”","“You!” Tongque glared at Yan Yue.","Zuo Qingluan was going to ignore Feng Wu to the end, but it now seemed that wasn’t going to work.","She picked up her cup and sipped her tea before glancing coldly at Yan Yue. “I see that Chief Yan Yue is going to disappoint me.”","Yan Yue felt a chill run down her spine, but she was sensible enough to know which side she should take.","Therefore, she remained unperturbed and said, “If a guest is qualified to come up to this floor, I have no reason to stop them. Miss Zuo, there’s nothing I can do.”","Zuo Qingluan didn’t expect Yan Yue to turn her down.","Tongque smirked. “Miss Yue, didn’t you hear? Miss Feng Wu here isn’t exactly a rich person. When we gave out gift envelopes yesterday, she was hiding among the common people and trying to get some small change. Do you think a person like that is worthy of the eighth floor?”","The entire imperial capital had heard about it, and Yan Yue was no exception.","She looked from the confident Zuo Qingluan to the unperturbed Feng Wu."]},{"number":2408,"title":"Chapter 2408 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Based on what Yan Yue heard, she felt that both girls stood a chance of winning Jun Linyuan’s heart.","Therefore, she decided to wait and see.","Just then, they heard movements upstairs, and both Feng Wu and Zuo Qingluan rose to their feet.","Yan Yue smiled bitterly and said, “I think His Royal Highness is up. I’ll report to him first. Please wait here.”","She was curious about which girl the crown prince would see first.","Naturally, that would mean that he cared about that girl more.","As soon as Yan Yue was gone, the atmosphere in the room became quite tense.","Feng Wu was smiling, and Zuo Qingluan was sipping her tea.","Chaoge and Tongque looked like they wanted to tear out each other’s hair.","Tongque lost control first. She sneered at Chaoge and said, “She’s completely useless. Why would His Royal Highness want to see her?”","Chaoge was furious. “Who did you just call useless?”","Tongque said, “She doesn’t have the True Phoenix Blood anymore. What else can she be?”","She said those things to provoke Feng Wu.","To her surprise, Feng Wu didn’t react to her words at all. Instead, Chaoge jumped to her feet.","Yan Yue went to see Jun Linyuan.","The crown prince had just finished his cultivation and opened his eyes.","Feng Xun was sitting next to him. Hearing what Yan Yue said, he sprang to his feet and headed for the door. “Feng Wu is here with Zuo Qingluan?! Gosh, I hope they won’t start a fight!”","By the time he got there, Chaoge and Tongque were already fighting.","Because Chaoge had slapped Tongque.","Tongque had thought that with her own cultivation level and the fact that she was from Firmament Palace, she could easily take down Chaoge, but she had no idea that Chaoge was almost a Spiritual Lord now.","Therefore —","Smack!","It was so loud that Tongque almost fainted with humiliation.","“How dare you?!” Tongque wanted to hit Chaoge, but she wasn’t capable enough and almost got slapped again.","Zuo Qingluan couldn’t sit still anymore.","She planned to ignore Feng Wu at first because she thought that Feng Wu was no more than an ant. However, Feng Wu’s friend had just hit her maid!","Formidable energy poured out of her body, rushing toward Chaoge.","How dare Duan Chaoge humiliate her maid?","Chaoge was chilled to the bone and couldn’t even move a finger.","She felt like a drowning man.","But soon, she felt warm spiritual essence from Feng Wu’s direction.","It shielded her from Zuo Qingluan’s attack.","No one could gain the upper hand.","Feng Wu wasn’t surprised because she had always known how capable Zuo Qingluan was.","But Zuo Qingluan was astonished.","She rose to her feet and stared at Feng Wu.","She still remembered Feng Wu as she was five years ago.","That afternoon, after her True Phoenix Blood was destroyed, Feng Wu lay in the mud and was on the verge of dying.","But now, Feng Wu stopped her attack!"]},{"number":2409,"title":"Chapter 2409 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","How was that even possible?!","Zuo Qingluan couldn’t help but look shocked. She stared at Feng Wu and said, “You really have started cultivating again.”","More than one person had written letters to tell her, and Mu Yaoyao even went to Firmament Palace in person.","But Zuo Qingluan never thought much of it.","Since Feng Wu’s True Phoenix Blood had been destroyed, Zuo Qingluan decided that no matter how hard Feng Wu tried, she would still be useless. However, Zuo Qingluan had just learned how capable Feng Wu was.","Hence, she exerted more power.","She was very alarmed now.","However, after she increased the energy she exerted, so did Feng Wu.","They were well-matched in strength again!","“You!”","Now, Zuo Qingluan was really alarmed.","She was about to increase the energy she was exerting to crush Feng Wu, when she heard a hearty laugh.","“What a scene! You guys are fighting! Don’t you know that fighting is forbidden in the tower? Plus, pretty girls shouldn’t be violent.”","As soon as Feng Xun showed up, the tension immediately dissolved.","Both Zuo Qingluan and Feng Wu had to withdraw their energy.","Zuo Qingluan couldn’t ignore Feng Wu anymore.","“I’m impressed.” Zuo Qingluan’s face was livid, and her tone could chill one to the bone.","Feng Wu smiled. “You’ll be impressed even more later, Miss Qingyun.”","The name “Qingyun” felt like a slap to Zuo Qingluan’s face.","Zuo Qingyun was Zuo Qingluan’s original name. When Feng Wu’s cultivation ability was destroyed five years ago, Zuo Qingyun became the only one with the True Phoenix Blood. She then changed her name to Zuo Qingluan, indicating that she was the real phoenix.","She stared at Feng Wu and spoke in the same condescending tone, “I’m offended.”","Feng Wu said, “Really? I’m so scared.”","Zuo Qingluan said, “I had forgotten about you, and you could have lived a safe life, but you just had to walk into my sight.","“Why do you have to be my enemy? Do you have a death wish?”","As the sacred lady of Firmament Palace, Zuo Qingluan always gave off a formidable air.","When she looked down at Feng Wu, the energy around her was terrifying.","Chaoge felt a chill run down her spine.","But Feng Wu didn’t seem affected at all.","“I have no wish to abandon my life, so I’m not the one that’s going to die.” She smiled.","Zuo Qingluan said, “Is that so? I can’t wait.”","Seeing that they were bickering again, Feng Xun stopped them.","“Are you archenemies? Why are you quarreling all the time?” Feng Xun scratched his head.","“Yes,” Feng Wu and Zuo Qingluan answered in unison.","Feng Xun cleared his throat.","Zuo Qingluan glared at him. “I want to see the crown prince! You need to tell His Royal Highness!”"]},{"number":2410,"title":"Chapter 2410 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Thinking about how they had been friends when they were kids, Zuo Qingluan made that request to Feng Xun.","She recalled that Feng Xun had liked to tease her when they were little. When she grew up, she was told that boys liked doing such things to girls they liked. Hence, she was certain that Feng Xun was fond of her.","She knew how to use that kind of affection.","Feng Xun gave her a strange look.","He didn’t think that they were so familiar with each other.","Zuo Qingluan frowned and stared at Feng Xun. “Didn’t you hear what I said?”","Feng Xun had no idea what Zuo Qingluan thought about him because he had never fancied her that way.","He had indeed teased Zuo Qingluan when they were little and even tried to frighten her with frogs, but that was purely because he wanted to pick on her.","He didn’t like Zuo Qingluan’s commanding tone and pretended not to hear her. He walked to Feng Wu’s side and patted her on the shoulder. “Xiao Wu, are you hungry? Do you want to eat something? Boss Jun hasn’t finished cultivating yet and still needs a moment.”","Feng Wu asked, “Is he cultivating?”","Feng Xun said, “Yes, and it’s very important. Maybe he can even make a breakthrough. Don’t worry, Feng is there with him.”","Feng Wu said, “You can eat with me, then.”","Feng Xun’s eyes lit up when he saw the lunchbox in Feng Wu’s hands. “Is that your cooking?”","He had tried Feng Wu’s cooking in Northern Border City once, and he had been thinking about it ever since. Unfortunately, Feng Wu had never cooked for him again.","Feng Wu nodded. “I made it myself. Do you want some?”","“Of course! I’m not an idiot!” Feng Xun immediately said.","After that, he started taking plates out of the box in great excitement.","He had meant to talk to Zuo Qingluan, but when he saw the food, he forgot all about her.","Zuo Qingluan frowned when she saw how familiar Feng Wu and Feng Xun were with each other.","What was going on?","She had only been gone for five years. Why did it feel like everything had changed? Since when were Feng Wu and Feng Xun good friends?","She had wanted to show off her friendship in front of Feng Wu, but as it turned out, Feng Wu was more welcome here.","If it wasn’t for Jun Linyuan, Zuo Qingluan would have stormed off already.","She was so frustrated.","Feng Xun knew little of her feelings. He was practically dumping food in his mouth by the plate.","It was so spicy that he was in tears, but it was so delicious.","Looking up, he saw Zuo Qingluan’s livid face and felt that he should show her some hospitality, so he asked her, “Would you like some? Xiao Wu made it herself. It’s so good!”","Zuo Qingluan was furious.","If it was made by Feng Wu, she would have nothing to do with it!","But she had to keep calm because she was supposed to be the forever calm sacred lady.","She glanced at Feng Xun and said contemptuously, “You’re a young lord, for god’s sake. How can you eat something so crude?”","Feng Xun was displeased.","Crude? It was scrumptious!"]},{"number":2411,"title":"Chapter 2411 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","He hadn’t wanted Zuo Qingluan to feel left out, so he had invited her to join him, but she said such insulting words. Feng Xun lost his temper.","“What did you just call Xiao Wu’s food? Boss Jun loves it. Are you saying that Boss Jun has bad taste?”","He wasn’t going to tolerate Zuo Qingluan’s attitude.","Zuo Qingluan believed that Feng Xun used to fancy her and might still have feelings for her, but now, he was shouting at her.","She was Zuo Qingluan!","She was so frustrated that she wanted to cry. Luckily, she had a tough mind and only needed a moment before she adjusted her mood. She told herself that he was only Feng Xun, not Jun Linyuan.","However, the thought of Feng Xun being on Feng Wu’s side made her want to choke Feng Wu to death.","But the crown prince wouldn’t be on Feng Wu’s side. That thought calmed her down.","Soon, Feng Xun finished all the food Feng Wu brought.","He would have licked the plates clean if the gravy wasn’t so spicy.","Feng Wu was bewildered as well.","Feng Xun said, “Well, Xiao Wu, don’t tell Boss Jun you brought food with you. Otherwise, he’ll kill me!”","Zuo Qingluan snorted inwardly.","His Royal Highness was the most elegant person in the world and would never like such food!","At that thought, she liked Feng Xun even less.","Just then, Yan Yue came back.","Feng Wu and Zuo Qingluan both looked at her.","Before, Feng Wu couldn’t stay away far enough from Jun Linyuan, but today was different. She didn’t want to be defeated by Zuo Qingluan.","Zuo Qingluan was much more confident in comparison.","She believed that she and Jun Linyuan had always been close, unlike Feng Wu, who had been rejected by Jun Linyuan before.","The two of them decided that the first person Jun Linyuan wanted to see was the more important one.","Yan Yue looked from Feng Wu to Zuo Qingluan before she said, “His Royal Highness wants to see you both.”","Both?","Feng Wu glanced at Zuo Qingluan. Didn’t Feng Xun say that Jun Linyuan didn’t like Zuo Qingluan? Why would he want to see her?","Zuo Qingluan glanced at Feng Wu and wondered why the crown prince would see her if he disliked her.","Had His Royal Highness already gotten used to having Feng Wu around? Zuo Qingluan became even more alarmed.","She began to regret it.","If she had known that something like this would happen, she would have listened to Mu Yaoyao and come back earlier.","No, if she had known, she would have killed Feng Wu when she had the chance.","When they walked up the stairs, Zuo Qingluan glanced at Feng Wu and knocked into her.","Feng Wu was shoved to the side.","If Feng Xun hadn’t caught her in time, Feng Wu would have rolled down the stairs.","He glared at Zuo Qingluan. “You’ve crossed the line!”","Since Zuo Qingluan had decided that Feng Xun was her enemy, she smirked. “Feng Xun, you’d better stay out of it!”","Feng Xun lost his temper as well.","He was a young lord and was nice to Feng Wu because he liked her, but Zuo Qingluan wasn’t Feng Wu.","Feng Xun smirked."]},{"number":2412,"title":"Chapter 2412 - Zuo Qingluans Envy (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun snorted but didn’t say anything. He had made up his mind.","Feng Wu couldn’t help but glance at Zuo Qingluan.","The girl was much more aggressive than she had been five years ago. Back then, she would never have talked to Feng Xun like that.","The combination of Firmament Palace and the Zuo family had made her very confident.","However...","She wanted to laugh when she recalled what happened earlier. Zuo Qingluan had wanted to show off her friendship with Feng Xun, but had only been embarrassed by Feng Xun’s response.","And Feng Wu didn’t try to muffle her laughter.","Hearing it, Zuo Qingluan looked at her, and their eyes met.","Although Feng Wu didn’t say anything, Zuo Qingluan still guessed what she was thinking.","She blushed in fury before her face turned livid.","She couldn’t understand it. She had worked so hard in the past five years and had surpassed all cultivators of her generation.","She had thought that when she came back, Feng Wu would be as invisible as a grain of sand in comparison.","But now, she had to personally handle Feng Wu herself.","She had considered Feng Wu as something so unworthy!","Zuo Qingluan frowned and was furious.","The door opened.","She immediately saw the teenager that she had been thinking about all the time.","He was as eye-catching and majestic as ever.","One couldn’t help but feel intimidated by his presence.","He seemed to be standing on top of the highest mountain.","And he was unapproachable.","Thud, thud, thud —","Even someone as arrogant as Zuo Qingluan couldn’t help but feel her heart pounding.","All the so-called geniuses out there were completely useless when compared with him.","Zuo Qingluan took a deep breath and clenched her fists.","She had worked so hard just to be able to stand side by side with him one day to look down upon everyone else.","After telling herself not to get nervous, Zuo Qingluan breathed out and looked up at the man she deemed perfect.","She wanted to use her best smile and voice when she told him, “Your Royal Highness, your Luan is back.”","But what did she see?","For an instance, she forgot to breathe.","Feng Wu ran toward Jun Linyuan like a capering bird.","“Hey, Jun Linyuan, what were you doing? You kept me waiting for so long!” Feng Wu jabbed Jun Linyuan’s chest with a long finger.","Zuo Qingluan couldn’t believe what she saw.","She was furious.","Had Feng Wu lost her mind? How could she get so close to His Royal Highness and touch him?!","Even she was too nervous to walk up to Jun Linyuan. She was a nobody! How dare she?!","She had no right!","Zuo Qingluan believed that His Royal Highness would throw Feng Wu out of the room immediately.","She could barely contain her jealousy and hatred.","But...","To her surprise..."]},{"number":2413,"title":"Chapter 2413 - Zuo Qingluans Envy (2)","paragraphs":["But to Zuo Qingluan’s surprise, Feng Wu remained where she was.","Why... Zuo Qingluan studied the crown prince carefully.","Jun Linyuan’s face was expressionless, but the look in his eyes was very cold.","Zuo Qingluan grew confident again.","This was the crown prince she remembered.","She gave Feng Wu a contemptuous look.","Right now, Feng Wu had raised her head and was looking at His Royal Highness with her unblinking gaze.","How dare she look His Royal Highness straight in the eye?","“Feng Wu, you’re so dead!” Zuo Qingluan gloated inwardly.","She was convinced that Feng Wu didn’t know the crown prince well because she didn’t know that she should keep her distance! His Royal Highness hated it when girls got too close.","Zuo Qingluan was glad that she still knew the crown prince the best.","However...","The crown prince went on staring at Feng Wu.","And Feng Wu kept smiling at him.","Then?","Then, Zuo Qingluan saw Feng Wu beaming at Jun Linyuan. Her smile was like the first streak of light in the morning.","“Her smile is so silly! Mine is much more attractive!”","Zuo Qingluan smirked inwardly. She wanted to see what Feng Wu was trying to do.","Despite Feng Wu’s bright smile, the crown prince remained expressionless. If anything, his eyes seemed to turn even darker.","He then turned away from her.","You couldn’t run away from me fast enough at the Gu manner. Why are you smiling at me now?!","The more he thought about it, the more frustrated he became.","Feng Wu had no idea how petty the crown prince could be, but instinct told her that Jun Linyuan was angry.","Normally, she wouldn’t try to please him, but today was different.","Jun Linyuan turned to face the table.","There was no room in front of him, so Feng Wu couldn’t make him look at her.","She needed to find another way.","Without thinking, Feng Wu climbed onto the table and sat down.","Zuo Qingluan wanted to scream.","Did she know what she was sitting on?!","There was a painting on the table.","Zuo Qingluan recognized at once that it was Jun Linyuan’s work.","The crown prince’s work was very valuable, and many people would pay a small fortune for a piece.","Because he injected his cultivation energy into his paintings and calligraphy.","If one could comprehend a piece, it would greatly benefit their cultivation.","As for how expensive Jun Linyuan’s work could be...","The prices were frighteningly high.","Zuo Qingluan had given out a big quadrangle dwelling as her top prize, but one written word from the crown prince was worth 100 such houses.","But Feng Wu had just sat on it...","Zuo Qingluan usually wasn’t so jumpy, but..."]},{"number":2414,"title":"Chapter 2414 - Zuo Qingluans Envy (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","But the crown prince seldom wrote anything, and there were only a handful of his works on the market.","Feng Wu didn’t like the feeling of sitting on paper, so she dragged the paper out from under her bottom, crumpled it up, and threw it into a corner.","Crumpled and thrown away...","Zuo Qingluan felt dizzy, but she soon grew excited.","Because she knew that Feng Wu was doomed.","However, Jun Linyuan didn’t slap Feng Wu, nor did he throw her out the window.","Instead —","He snorted and turned away again. Zuo Qingluan was glad to see that Jun Linyuan despised Feng Wu.","She just couldn’t understand. How could Feng Wu still sit on the desk when the crown prince obviously didn’t want to see her?","Then Feng Wu did something that Zuo Qingluan deemed utterly shameless.","That was because —","Feng Wu was tugging at Jun Linyuan’s sleeve!","Seeing this, Zuo Qingluan almost couldn’t maintain her composure.","She clenched her fists in her sleeves, and blue veins popped on the back of her hands. She wanted to choke Feng Wu.","How could she touch His Royal Highness’s sleeve?","And she was even swaying it!","Feng Wu was also giving Jun Linyuan a lost-puppy look.","Meanwhile, she called the crown prince softly. “Brother Jun.”","“Shut up! You shameless woman!” thought Zuo Qingluan.","Her heart was pounding, and she wanted to slap Feng Wu.","“Your Royal Highness, do something!","“Kill this shameless woman!” Zuo Qingluan thought furiously, hoping that the crown prince would punish Feng Wu.","However, the crown prince only glanced at Feng Wu. There was a glimmer in his eyes.","“What?!” He stared at Feng Wu.","By then, he no longer looked so displeased.","Feng Wu smiled obsequiously. “Your Royal Highness, did you make a breakthrough?”","At Jun Linyuan’s level, breakthroughs were extremely difficult to achieve. Other people would have been thrilled, but he only nodded indifferently.","But Feng Wu needed some excitement.","This was such a great opportunity.","She rested her chin on her hands and looked at Jun Linyuan with twinkling eyes.","“Really? Brother Jun, did you make a breakthrough?! Wow! You’re so amazing! There’s no one like you! You’re like a god to me!!!”","Instantly...","Everyone fell silent.","Feng Xun gave Feng Wu a strange look.","Zuo Qingluan was so furious that she thought her head was going to explode.","She looked at Jun Linyuan. It was obvious that Feng Wu was pretending.","It was such a humiliation to the crown prince, and she was sure that His Royal Highness would kill Feng Wu."]},{"number":2415,"title":"Chapter 2415 - Zuo Qingluans Envy (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","While Zuo Qingluan was looking expectantly at the crown prince, he was looking at Feng Wu.","Although he immediately saw that Feng Wu was only pretending, the crown prince enjoyed it very much.","His earlobes had turned a little pinker, but it was too subtle to pick up.","To other people, he was still the same proud teenager. After giving Feng Wu a stern look, he turned away from her again.","“It’s too late for that!” thought Jun Linyuan.","But Feng Wu wouldn’t give up.","She had been a well-trained secret agent in her previous life, and her acting skills were impeccable!","She knew exactly what a teenage girl should look like when she worshipped an idol.","She realized that tugging at his sleeve alone wasn’t enough, so she moved closer and wrapped her arms around Jun Linyuan’s. “Brother Jun...”","The crown prince’s heart rate quickened.","If there was a detector around, it would be able to see his heart rate rising.","150!","160!","170!","...","250!","260!","270!","Thump! Thump! Thump!","He thought his heart was going to jump out of his throat.","“Stop it! Pull yourself together!” Jun Linyuan told himself.","Seeing how awkward he looked, Feng Wu asked innocently, “Brother Jun, do you not feel well? Why are your cheeks so hot?”","She then put her hand on his forehead.","She’s touching him!!!","Zuo Qingluan’s eyes popped.","His Royal Highness hates other people touching him!","And she’s touching his skin directly!","Zuo Qingluan remembered when they were at school, she had tried to touch Jun Linyuan’s finger when he was napping.","But before she could do it, Jun Linyuan waved his hand in his sleep and shoved her away.","She still remembered the human-shaped crater she made when she smashed into the wall...","Because of that, Zuo Qingluan both worshipped and feared Jun Linyuan. She didn’t dare express her feelings for him and could only spread rumors about them being a couple.","That was right, she went to school with all the princes and young lords when she was little.","Because of the privileged circle she was in, she had always felt that she was better than Feng Wu.","At that thought, she stared at Feng Wu’s arms, which were wrapped around Jun Linyuan’s arm.","You’re dead!","Although Zuo Qingluan expected that Feng Wu would smash into the wall at any moment...","Jun Linyuan didn’t do anything.","Well, he did try to take back his arm.","But he only pretended to do so.","With his capability, of course he could easily release his arm from Feng Wu’s clasp.","He looked down at Feng Wu and said, “Let go.”"]},{"number":2416,"title":"Chapter 2416 - Furious Sacred Lady (1)","paragraphs":["Feng Wu said, “No, I won’t!”","If she had a tail, she would be wagging it by now.","Does she think she’s a dog?! ?Zuo Qingluan found Feng Wu’s behavior unspeakable.","A young lady should be graceful and reserved!","Feng Wu looks like a woman who entertains men for a living! ?thought Zuo Qingluan.","She was waiting for the wise crown prince to see through Feng Wu.","But she was doomed to be disappointed.","After pretending to try and take back his arm, Jun Linyuan simply let Feng Wu hold it.","What?!","Zuo Qingluan was furious.","Jun Linyuan looked down at Feng Wu and said, “Are you a puppy? Stop whimpering.”","Somehow, Zuo Qingluan felt that there was affection in his voice.","No!","It can’t be!","I must have heard it wrong!","While interacting with Jun Linyuan, Feng Wu was also secretly observing Zuo Qingluan.","Because she was the target of her trial.","Why hadn’t Zuo Qingluan lost her temper?","She had to work harder!","She had done more humiliating things in front of Jun Linyuan before; this was nothing to her. Feng Wu stood on the table and rested her hands on her waist.","“Jun Linyuan, you called me a puppy! If you don’t say something nice, I’m going to be very mad!”","OMG!","Zuo Qingluan was astonished.","How dare Feng Wu speak to the crown prince like that?!","“Does she know who he is?!","Even Feng Xun couldn’t stand it for much longer.","He kept looking around the room.","Why was he being forced to watch this? Please make it stop!","He poked Zuo Qingluan’s arm with a finger. “Hey, hey.”","Zuo Qingluan’s mind had gone blank, and Feng Xun’s poke woke her up.","She reminded herself that she was the chosen girl.","She had been brought up as a genius and was supported by both the Zuo family and Firmament Palace. Even Jun Wuxia was inferior in terms of status.","Zuo Qingluan had always considered herself to be the most beautiful and talented teenager of the empire.","But now...","She felt that Feng Wu had just slapped her in the face.","Rage burned inside her.","At that moment, Feng Xun woke her up from her reverie.","“What?” Zuo Qingluan’s glance was very cold.","It made Feng Xun jump.","Seeing Feng Xun’s astonished look, Zuo Qingluan finally returned to herself.","I’m Zuo Qingluan, and I’m the sacred lady. How can I be jealous of Feng Wu? She’s nothing!","I would never envy a mortal!"]},{"number":2417,"title":"Chapter 2417 - Furious Sacred Lady (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Zuo Qingluan took a deep breath and asked Feng Xun, “What are you suggesting?”","Feng Xun looked from Feng Wu to Zuo Qingluan and realized what was going on.","Zuo Qingluan was jealous of Feng Wu!","That was to say, Zuo Qingluan was fond of Boss Jun!","Feng Xun frowned.","He had mixed feelings about that.","He had been a little unhappy when he thought that Feng Wu was in love with Boss Jun because he felt that now that his sister had a man, she wouldn’t care about her brother so much.","But when he saw that Zuo Qingluan wanted Jun Linyuan as well, he was on guard.","“Come with me.” He headed for the door.","Zuo Qingluan wouldn’t move, but Feng Xun said coldly, “It’s about Boss Jun!”","Zuo Qingluan was intrigued.","Was Feng Xun angry?","Was he in love with Feng Wu as well?","That’s always a possibility. I hate to admit it, but Feng Wu is a very pretty girl!","I bet Feng Xun doesn’t like seeing what’s going on either!","With that in mind, Zuo Qingluan followed Feng Xun out of the room.","Outside.","Feng Xun frowned and stared at Zuo Qingluan.","“Are you fond of Boss Jun?” He got straight to the point.","Once she was outside, Zuo Qingluan gradually regained her senses.","She decided that she wouldn’t embarrass herself over someone like Feng Wu.","Feng Xun repeated the question. “Are you fond of Boss Jun?”","Zuo Qingluan raised her chin and said coldly, “You’re thinking too much.”","Feng Xun kept his gaze on her. “Am I? So, you’re not in love with Boss Jun?”","Of course, Zuo Qingluan wouldn’t admit her feelings.","She believed that the first one to confess their affection would be the loser in a relationship. If she admitted it to Feng Xun now, the crown prince would soon know of it as well...","When that happened, she would look too eager, which was against her plan.","Zuo Qingluan had had five years to think about it in Firmament Palace, and she had observed many couples. She decided that she should never let a man know that she was in love with him!","Otherwise, she would lose the battle for good.","Feng Xun’s frown grew bigger. “Zuo Qingluan, I’m going to ask you one last time: Are you really not in love with Boss Jun?”","Zuo Qingluan snorted. “Yes, His Royal Highness is brilliant, but I’m not a nobody either. Why do I have to be in love with him? Do you think I’m as superficial as all those women?”","Feng Xun let out a breath of relief. “I’m so glad to hear that. Good. You’re not in love with Boss Jun.”","“No, it’s not good at all!” thought Zuo Qingluan. She wanted to smack Feng Xun on the head, but she needed to force herself to keep her composure.","And she feigned an indifferent attitude.","Once that problem was solved, Feng Xun became much kinder. After all, they had gone to school together once.","“Qingluan, that’s the way to go.” Feng Xun patted her on the shoulder. “Since you’re not Xiao Wu’s rival in love, we can all be friends!”","Zuo Qingluan frowned and shoved Feng Xun away."]},{"number":2418,"title":"Chapter 2418 - Furious Sacred Lady (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","It was true that to many teenage girls, Young Lord Feng was also an ideal future husband, but Zuo Qingluan thought very highly of herself and only saw Feng Xun as Jun Linyuan’s minion. Since she thought she was going to be Jun Linyuan’s future wife, she didn’t think much of Feng Xun.","Feng Xun pursed his lips. “You do believe that you’re the sacred lady, don’t you? How arrogant.”","Zuo Qingluan was so mad that she almost couldn’t keep a straight face.","She wanted to go back inside, but Feng Xun blocked her way. “Wait.”","She glared at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun said, “Why are you still going inside?”","Since she wouldn’t be his friend, he wouldn’t treat her like one.","Zuo Qingluan frowned at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun said, “Can’t you see what’s going on inside? The two of them are having a moment together. Don’t be a third wheel!”","Zuo Qingluan’s nails dug into her palms.","A moment together? Are they really a couple now? No, I won’t have it!","She scolded Feng Xun. “Do you know what you’re suggesting?”","Feng Xun said, “What do you mean?”","Zuo Qingluan said in a self-righteous tone, “You’re ruining His Royal Highness’s reputation! Feng Wu is a nobody! She can’t have anything to do with the crown prince!”","Feng Xun glared at her, but Zuo Qingluan went on before he could retort.","“Feng Xun, you’re His Royal Highness’s best friend and should uphold his reputation! Feng Wu is worthless! She’s detrimental to the crown prince!”","Feng Xun was infuriated.","In his eyes, Xiao Wu was the best. She was beautiful, talented, and kind. Why was Zuo Qingluan saying such things about her?","Feng Xun said, “If Xiao Wu isn’t worthy, who is? You?”","That rendered Zuo Qingluan speechless.","She pointed at Feng Xun and said, “Feng Wu has brainwashed you! You’re not His Royal Highness’s friend!”","She stormed off after that.","Tongque quickly ran after her.","Feng Xun was furious. If Zuo Qingluan hadn’t left so soon, he would have hit her.","“That woman is impossible! Is that what a sacred lady of Firmament Palace is supposed to be like?” he grumbled.","Zuo Qingluan was quite aloof when she was little, but she had still been a lovely girl. How did she become like this? Feng Xun was frustrated.","Inside —","Feng Wu didn’t do anything else after Zuo Qingluan left. She listened to the movements outside.","She had planned to take her acting to a new level after Zuo Qingluan came back. She would sit on Jun Linyuan’s lap, and if that couldn’t convince Zuo Qingluan, she would do something even more outrageous.","However, she only heard the sound of Zuo Qingluan leaving.","She felt defeated.","“Are you upset?” The crown prince frowned.","He looked in the direction of the door and seemed to realize something.","Since the eleventh trial wasn’t finished yet, Feng Wu had to keep sucking up to Jun Linyuan. At that thought, she smiled wryly.. “I’m not upset.”"]},{"number":2419,"title":"Chapter 2419 - Feng Wus Birthday (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Really? The crown prince glanced at Feng Wu and felt that he had missed something important.","Seeing the pensive look on his face, Feng Wu felt uneasy.","She was worried that Jun Linyuan would realize that she had been acting.","That would put her in a very difficult spot. He would be furious!","At that thought, Feng Wu changed the subject. “I still need to take care of something at home. I’m off! Bye!”","Before Jun Linyuan realized it, Feng Wu jumped out the window and was out of sight.","She was so fast!","Jun Linyuan didn’t say anything.","He could catch up with her if he wanted to, but what happened earlier was nagging at him, and he sat there, frowning.","He then walked out of the room.","Feng Xun was perplexed. “Where’s Xiao Wu?”","Jun Linyuan smirked. “She’s gone; she ran faster than a thief.”","Feng Xun rubbed his nose. “Zuo Qingluan is gone, and so is Xiao Wu. It’s almost like she was putting on a show for Zuo Qingluan.”","Boom!","Those words sounded like a thunderclap in the crown prince’s ears.","Feng Xun saw Boss Jun suddenly stop walking, so he glanced at him. The crown prince’s face was livid!","Realizing what he had said, Feng Xun wanted to slap himself.","Why did he say such things?!","He immediately tried to repair the damage. “I’m talking nonsense. Xiao Wu was like this long before Zuo Qingluan came back. Of course, it’s not because of Zuo Qingluan.”","Only then did the tension in the air disappear.","Feng Xun sighed in relief. The intimidating energy from Boss Jun had almost crushed him.","He stole a glance at Boss Jun and saw that he still wasn’t in a good mood.","When Feng Wu was around, he almost looked peaceful.","But as soon as she was gone, he was back to being the intimidating crown prince.","Feng Xun tried to strike up a conversation, but the crown prince never replied.","They walked down the stairs together. When they reached the fourth floor, they heard voices inside.","“Do you know how embarrassing that Feng Wu is?”","The crown prince had been deep in thought, but that name triggered him again.","Feng Xun looked at the room where the voice came from.","“Feng Wu? Do you mean the girl from the Feng clan? I heard that she started cultivating again and has been doing a good job.”","“Yes, she has, but have you forgotten? Five years ago, she was mentioned alongside Miss Zuo Qingluan. Do you know what happened recently?”","“What?”","“Miss Qingluan, the sacred lady of Firmament Palace, came back in her phoenix carriage.”","“That’s right.”","“And the magpies were giving out envelopes that contained vouchers. Guess what happened?”"]},{"number":2420,"title":"Chapter 2420 - Feng Wus Birthday (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","All the guests in the tower were some kind of influential figures; otherwise, they would never be able to get in.","They didn’t care if other people heard their conversation, but they had no idea that the most influential figure in the empire was listening in.","“And the magpies were giving out envelopes that contained vouchers. Guess what happened?”","“What happened?”","“Did you know that there was a top prize?”","“Of course! It’s a house with a big courtyard in the imperial capital!”","“Yes, that’s the prize. It must be worth a lot! Do you know who got the envelope?”","“Who’s the lucky person?”","“Feng Wu!”","“Feng Wu? As in THE Feng Wu?”","“That’s her.”","“Then she’s quite lucky.”","“No, she’s not! Both she and Miss Qingluan had the True Phoenix Blood five years ago. Now, Miss Qingluan is already the sacred lady of Firmament Palace, but what about Feng Wu?","“She has to fight with the common people for petty gifts!”","Hearing that, everyone laughed.","They had no idea that someone who cared a lot about Feng Wu had heard every word.","The crown prince now had a murderous look in his eyes.","“Your Royal Highness —” Yan Yue was with them. Hearing the conversation, she stepped out and reported in a low voice, “They’re the children of some fifth-ranked officials. Their names are...”","The crown prince only glanced at Yan Yue.","Yan Yue knew that those officials were going to be demoted.","She tried to explain on Feng Wu’s behalf. “I don’t think Miss Feng Wu meant to take that envelope. She doesn’t care about such things.”","She could tell that the crown prince was a little less furious when she said those words.","She realized what the crown prince wanted to hear.","She went on, “Because when I served tea to Miss Feng Wu, she gave that envelope to me as a tip. Here it is.”","Yan Yue then showed the envelope to Jun Linyuan.","She felt a chill run down her spine.","When the crown prince was angry, many people could die.","That was a fact.","Feng Xun snorted. “Those people are abominable! How dare they talk about Xiao Wu behind her back? I’ll teach them a lesson!”","Jun Linyuan didn’t try to stop him.","Just then, Yan Yue said, “I remember that Miss Feng Wu’s birthday is coming up.”","Because she knew that her master cared about Feng Wu, she had collected some information on her.","“Is it?” Feng Xun’s eyes lit up. “When? And isn’t Zuo Qingluan’s birthday on New Year’s Eve?”","Yan Yue smiled. “Miss Feng Wu’s birthday is on that day as well.”","“What?!” Feng Xun cried out. “Really? What a coincidence! I didn’t know!”"]},{"number":2421,"title":"Chapter 2421 - Feng Wus Birthday (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Yan Yue smiled. “Probably because Miss Zuo’s birthday celebration is always very elaborate.”","Seeing the crown prince’s attitude, Yan Yue knew which side she should stand on now.","Feng Wu was a brilliant young lady, but Yan Yue wouldn’t support Feng Wu just because she liked her. People like Yan Yue never revealed their own opinion.","Their master’s opinion was theirs.","They would like whoever their master liked.","Yan Yue was glad that she and her master liked the same person.","“Boss Jun, you’ve been to Zuo Qingluan’s birthday party before. Do you remember?!” Feng Xun finally remembered something. “You were already engaged to Xiao Wu, but you still went to Zuo Qingluan’s party.”","Jun Linyuan looked confused. He couldn’t remember.","Feng Xun said in frustration, “The guests here are all from good backgrounds, but they’re still talking about Xiao Wu like that. Other people will just be meaner. Why did that girl take the envelope?”","Yan Yue spoke up at that moment.","She casually said, “Miss Feng Wu doesn’t think much about the prize, so I don’t think she meant to take the gift. Maybe it was meant to land in her hands.”","Feng Xun said, “There were so many people. How could that envelope just happen to land in her hands, unless Zuo Qingluan purposefully... Wait. Zuo Qingluan didn’t do it on purpose, did she?”","Yan Yue dropped the hint. “Miss Qingluan stormed off just then. Young Lord Feng, did you offend her?”","Feng Xun said, “I wanted to talk to her outside because I saw that she was angry, but she somehow got offended. Forget about it. That’s not important.”","He waved Yan Yue off.","Yan Yue looked at him in resignation.","Were all men so slow? She could tell why Zuo Qingluan was mad right away, but these men just couldn’t see it!","She had dropped all the hints she needed to drop, but he said that it wasn’t important!","At that thought, Yan Yue wanted to smack Feng Xun on the head.","Feng Xun was already thinking about Feng Wu’s birthday.","He said, “Xiao Wu will be 14 after New Year’s Eve, and in the Junwu Empire, that makes her eligible for marriage. It’s a very important birthday.”","Yan Yue glanced at Jun Linyuan.","Although he didn’t say anything, she could tell that he was thinking the same thing.","The teenager just wouldn’t speak his mind.","Yan Yue immediately said, “Miss Zuo has given out gifts, so how about we do the same for Miss Feng Wu’s birthday?”","Feng Xun said, “That’s not a bad idea, but won’t those people say that Xiao Wu is copying Zuo Qingluan?”","Yan Yue said grumpily, “Giving out gift envelopes is a tradition. Miss Zuo didn’t invent it.”","Zuo Qingluan was only “Miss Zuo” to her now.","“Plus,” Yan Yue chuckled, “Miss Feng Wu is so clever. I’m sure she’ll use this opportunity well.”","Hachoo!","Feng Wu sneezed in Fallen Star Yard."]},{"number":2422,"title":"Chapter 2422 - Feng Wus Birthday (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Phoenix Yard, the Zuo family.","Zuo Qingluan had been angry the whole day.","The entire Zuo family felt very nervous.","All the servants remained silent and worked efficiently, fearing that Miss Zuo would vent her anger on them.","In Zuo Qingluan’s bedroom.","Tongque still remembered what happened the day before.","When the sacred lady entered her bedchamber, she tilted her head back and let out an angry roar.","Instantly, all the wooden furniture was pulverized.","There had been two maids in the room when they entered.","They turned into puddles of blood as well right in front of Tongque’s eyes.","Tongque was speechless.","She had never seen the sacred lady so angry before.","Zuo Qingluan was in a trance-like state the whole day.","No one was allowed to get within ten meters of her. She would kill anyone who dared to try.","Tongque only moved closer after she saw that Zuo Qingluan didn’t look so furious anymore.","She had finally come up with an idea.","“Miss Qingluan —” Tongque knew what was on Zuo Qingluan’s mind, so she carefully reminded her, “I asked around after we got back yesterday. That Feng Wu really is a piece of work.”","Zuo Qingluan glared at her.","She couldn’t tolerate the mention of that name!","However, Tongque hadn’t served Zuo Qingluan for five years for no reason.","She had a soft, steady voice and was very considerate.","“Miss Qingluan, you’ve been cultivating in Firmament Palace for the past five years, unlike her, who had all the time to hover around His Royal Highness. That’s why the crown prince is more familiar with her.”","Tongque knew that she couldn’t make it sound like Zuo Qingluan was to be blamed. She needed to belittle Feng Wu as much as she could.","If the sacred lady thought that she was being humiliated, Tongque knew that she was dead.","She was right.","Zuo Qingluan had been spreading rumors, saying that the crown prince was so fond of her that she was the only candidate for his future wife.","She had even fooled herself, not to mention Tongque.","But Zuo Qingluan was no fool. When she saw the crown prince’s interaction with Feng Wu, she knew that there was something going on between them.","Back then, she had been the only close female friend of the crown prince, but Feng Wu had basically replaced her now.","It made her feel humiliated in front of Tongque.","In her mind, no one was allowed to see that side of her.","Tongque’s life was indeed in danger.","But the young maid could read people well. She had seen that her life was in danger yesterday, but instead of running away, she faced the challenge head-on and went to check up on Feng Wu.","They should have done that a long time ago.","But Zuo Qingluan had been ignoring Feng Wu because she thought she had taken Feng Wu out of the running five years ago. To her, Feng Wu wasn’t even worth a glance.","But Tongque realized how serious it was, so she went out for help.","Firmament Palace had a branch in the imperial capital. It was known as Firmament Pavilion.","They hired professional spies there, and it had only taken them a day to gather all the information Tongque needed.","After reading what Feng Wu had been doing these days, Tongque was astonished."]},{"number":2423,"title":"Chapter 2423 - Feng Wus Birthday (5)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Tongque was shocked by how cunning Feng Wu was. Her sacred lady had definitely underestimated that woman.","After putting all the information in order, Tongque put a 10cm-thick folder on Zuo Qingluan’s desk.","The Zuo family had efficiently restored the bedchamber one hour after it was destroyed.","However, Mrs. Zuo had forbidden anyone from spreading the news.","“Miss Qingluan —” Tongque put the file on the desk, but Zuo Qingluan still ignored her, so she reminded her mistress, “We should probably get to know our enemy better.”","Zuo Qingluan frowned and looked like she was going to explode at any moment.","If she lost her temper, things would get very ugly...","Tongque bowed and left the room.","After she was gone, Zuo Qingluan’s gaze moved to the file.","Was that everything Feng Wu had done in the imperial capital in the past year?","In fact, Zhen Xia of the crown prince’s residence, her mother, and many other people had all written to her, but she had burnt all the letters that had Feng Wu’s name in it.","Mu Yaoyao, her junior sister, went to Firmament Palace in person to beg for her to come back.","She told Zuo Qingluan that if she didn’t come back soon, Feng Wu would steal the crown prince’s heart.","And what did Zuo Qingluan say?","She said that if a man could be stolen, he wasn’t meant for her to keep.","She still remembered how frustrated Mu Yaoyao had looked.","She rubbed her forehead and looked at the file on the desk.","How thick! Were there so many things to record?","Before, Zuo Qingluan would have burnt the file to ash.","However...","She remembered what Tongque said.","“We should know our enemy a little better.”","Taking a deep breath, Zuo Qingluan fought back her repulsion and took the first booklet in the file.","Northern Border City...","She read from dawn to dusk.","Tongque stayed outside the entire time, filled with anxiety.","In front of everyone else, the sacred lady was as otherworldly as an immortal, but Tongque had been with her for many years, and she knew better.","The real sacred lady was treacherous and ruthless. She wouldn’t even blink when she killed someone, as if they were just an insect on the road.","After she read Feng Wu’s story, would they have to redo the bedroom again?","Just then, she heard Zuo Qingluan’s calm voice. “Bring Mu Yaoyao here.”","Mu Yaoyao had come back a few days earlier. Although she was the daughter of Lord Mu, to Zuo Qingluan, she was just another minion.","“Yes.” Tongque was finally relieved.","She knew that this was a historical moment.","Because her sacred lady was finally starting to pay attention to Feng Wu.","Zuo Qingluan looked at the booklet on the desk. It read, “Feng Wu’s birthday: New Year’s Eve.”","She smirked.","She remembered that five years ago, the crown prince went to her birthday party in person and gave her a gift. This time, she would show Feng Wu that she was the woman the crown prince loved!"]},{"number":2424,"title":"Chapter 2424 - Gift Envelopes","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Fallen Star Yard.","Whenever Feng Xun went to see Feng Wu there, he always jumped over the wall and never used the front door.","The gate of Fallen Star Yard had been damaged and repaired again.","Feng Wu then put inscriptions on the walls so that they wouldn’t be damaged so easily.","“Xiao Wu?” Feng Xun sat on the wall and waved at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was sitting on top of a tree and absorbing the spiritual essence in the morning sunlight. She opened her eyes to find the teenager beaming at her.","“Feng Xun?” Feng Wu didn’t move, so Feng Xun eagerly jumped into the tree and sat down next to her.","The big tree had been in Fallen Star Yard for many years now. It would take three people to wrap their arms around the tree, and it was over 30 meters tall. Sitting on top, one could see the entire Feng manor, as well as the street outside.","It was deep into winter, and everything was covered by snow.","On the street, the Feng clan had arranged for someone to clean up the snow outside the front gate.","Around the corner, a few breakfast stalls had been set up, and the aroma was mouth-watering.","“Shall I buy you breakfast?” Feng Wu glanced at Feng Xun.","Although she could see everything up on the roof, it felt too far away from the common people, and she didn’t like that feeling.","She would rather blend in with the crowd.","“Breakfast? Great!”","Before Feng Xun could jump into the courtyard, Feng Wu led him to the other side of the wall and toward a street corner.","There was a wonton stall with only a few customers.","The owner was an elderly couple, who seemed to know Feng Wu well. They asked, “Miss Wu, do you want the usual? Small wontons with a lean meat baked bun?”","Feng Wu nodded with a smile.","Feng Xun said, “I’ll have the same, but a large one!”","The elderly couple nodded.","After ordering the food, Feng Xun asked curiously, “Do you know them well?”","Feng Wu said, “Their food tastes like home.”","Feng Xun said, “You’re such a strange girl.”","Feng Wu looked at him curiously.","Feng Xun said, “I thought noble young ladies like you would never eat on the side of the street. Zuo Qingluan hated it. If she gets any of the smell in her hair, she’ll wash it three times.”","Feng Wu said, “How pretentious.”","“That’s so true!” Feng Xun couldn’t agree more. ?Before I knew you, I thought that all girls were like Zuo Qingluan. I was so wrong!","“By the way!” Feng Xun finally remembered why he was here today. “Xiao Wu, I need to ask you something.”","“What is it?” Feng Wu asked. “You never sound so humble. What’s the question?”","“Do you know how to give out gift envelopes?” Feng Xun asked grumpily. “Zuo Qingluan came back with all those magpies and red envelopes, and I don’t like it at all! Can you do something better?”","Something better? Of course Feng Wu could!","In her previous life, Feng Wu was used to giving out and receiving gift envelopes.. She knew exactly what to do with them."]},{"number":2425,"title":"Chapter 2425 - Dragon and Phoenix","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Many big companies had also turned this activity into a profitable business, and Feng Wu knew that she could learn from them.","However...","“Why gift envelopes? Are you going to pay for them? Do you have too much money to burn?” Feng Wu was perplexed.","Feng Xun cleared his throat.","He glanced at Feng Wu. Of course, it was because of Jun Linyuan, but he couldn’t tell Feng Wu that.","“New Year’s Eve is in a few days; what’s wrong with giving out some gifts? Any ideas?” Feng Xun grumbled. “We have to do better than Zuo Qingluan!”","Feng Wu said, “But it’ll cost you a lot of money.”","Feng Xun patted his chest. “Money won’t be a problem! I’ll take care of it!”","Feng Wu asked, “How big a scene do you want it to be?”","Feng Xun said, “The bigger, the better!”","Feng Wu asked, “Are you sure?”","Feng Xun said, “Of course!”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at him. She couldn’t understand these rich people.","The Zuo family.","Master Zuo and Mrs. Zuo were discussing in low voices. “Apart from the first day, Qingluan has kept a low profile since she came back. We hardly ever see her.”","Master Zuo nodded.","Mrs. Zuo said, “Her birthday is coming up. How about we throw her a big party?”","Master Zuo asked, “Is it really necessary?”","Mrs. Zuo said, “Of course it is. Have you forgotten who Qingluan is? She’s the only girl with the True Phoenix Blood in the empire, and you know what that means!”","Everyone in the Junwu Empire knew what it meant.","Noble families would often marry one another, including the imperial family.","The True Phoenix Blood was one of the most prestigious bloodlines and almost as respected as the dragon bloodline.","Not all imperial family members had the dragon bloodline. There would be one member at most in each generation.","Sometimes, the entire living imperial family might not have it.","For instance, no one in Emperor Wu’s generation had it. Therefore, everyone was elated when they found that Jun Linyuan had the bloodline.","That was why no matter what Jun Linyuan did, Emperor Wu would only shout at him but wouldn’t actually do anything.","With his dragon bloodline, it would only make sense that he should marry a girl with the True Phoenix Blood. Once the two bloodlines combined, they would probably have even more talented babies.","Mrs. Zuo was very pleased. “His Royal Highness has the dragon bloodline, and Qingluan has the only True Phoenix Blood in the empire. She’s the only girl His Royal Highness will marry!”","Master Zuo was more level-headed than she was. “You forgot about Feng Wu.”","Mrs. Zuo smirked. “You did that thing five years ago precisely because of Feng Wu, right? His Royal Highness had two choices, but now, he only has one!”","Mrs. Zuo didn’t think much of it when she saw Master Zuo’s frown because she knew that her family was going to be connected to the imperial family by marriage.","“My lord, we were friendly with Prince Jun Linshen, but we can’t do that now. After all, His Royal Highness is going to be Qingluan’s future husband, so we should support him.”","Master Zuo rolled his eyes at her. “Everyone knows that Prince Jun Linshen can never replace the crown prince; his supporters are only making fools of themselves.. His Majesty will only laugh it off.”"]},{"number":2426,"title":"Chapter 2426 - Jun Linyuan Isnt the Only One I Can Marry","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Whenever Emperor Wu got angry at Jun Linyuan, he wanted to urge Jun Linshen to compete with his brother, but that was very naive of him. Jun Linshen wasn’t Jun Linyuan’s match at all.","Master Zuo shook his head.","“But His Royal Highness treats Feng Wu differently.” Master Zuo frowned.","“I disagree!” Mrs. Zuo shook her head. “Yes, His Royal Highness found Feng Wu special before, but that was when Luan hadn’t come back. Now that she’s here, things will be different!","“My lord, just think about Qingluan!","“She has the True Phoenix Blood and is the only perfect match for the dragon bloodline.","“And she’s supported by both the Zuo family and Firmament Palace. That’s unmatched in the Junwu Empire.","“Moreover, she’s very talented. She’s only about to turn 18, but she’s already a Spiritual King. How formidable is that?!”","...","Mrs. Zuo listed Zuo Qingluan’s merits before naming Feng Wu’s shortcomings.","In the end, she reached the conclusion: “His Royal Highness was only tricked by that Feng Wu because he doesn’t know how brilliant Luan is. I believe that he’ll come to his senses.”","The more she spoke, the more excited she became. “Let’s have a big celebration and show everyone how amazing Luan is. The entire imperial capital will talk about it, and His Royal Highness will have to listen.","“Of course, the most ideal situation is that His Royal Highness will come in person,” said Mrs. Zuo. “Wait, I need to discuss it with Luan.”","In Phoenix Yard.","“My lady?” Tongque thought that her mistress was lost in thought, so she wanted to wake her up from her reverie.","But in fact, Zuo Qingluan was eavesdropping on her parents.","Master Zuo didn’t set up a barrier when he spoke, and at Zuo Qingluan’s cultivation level, she could easily hear them.","Zuo Qingluan glanced at Tongque and rose to her feet.","Mrs. Zuo was coming out with her maids when Zuo Qingluan arrived.","She was pleasantly surprised when she saw her daughter. “Luan, I was going to see you, and you’re here. What a coincidence! Come in. Mom and Dad have something to tell you.”","Zuo Qingluan remained indifferent. She still used her condescending manner when she spoke to her parents.","After they entered, Master Zuo cleared his throat. “Luan, there’s no one else around, so just tell us: What do you think of His Royal Highness?”","Mrs. Zuo rolled her eyes at her husband. What kind of question was that? Of course, everyone admired His Royal Highness!","But Zuo Qingluan frowned and said coldly, “His Royal Highness is brilliant, but he’s not the only one I can marry.”","What?!","Mrs. Zuo paled. “Luan, are you in love with someone else? Who is it? Is he from Firmament Palace?”","Zuo Qingluan said, “There’s no one. I’m only saying that I’m just as brilliant as he is. If he marries me, I’ll stand by his side, but if he won’t, I can rise to the top myself!”","Mrs.. Zuo panicked. “Who gave you that idea? What do you mean ‘if he won’t’? You have to marry him!”"]},{"number":2427,"title":"Chapter 2427 - Wheres His Royal Highness? (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Master Zuo nodded and said, “You’re right!”","Mrs. Zuo glared at him. “No, she’s not! We invested so much in her so that she can marry His Royal Highness!”","Master Zuo said, “His Royal Highness is brilliant, but so is Luan. She’ll marry His Royal Highness one day, but she can’t seem too eager. We should let other people hear her little speech as well.”","Mrs. Zuo didn’t understand.","Master Zuo patted Zuo Qingluan’s shoulder. “That’s good. You know what you’re doing, and you have a clear goal. Although we’ve lost your siblings, with you here, the Zuo family will still have a bright future!”","Only then did Zuo Qingluan remember what she read in the file. “What happened? Did Feng Wu kill them?”","She didn’t trust what she heard from other people, so she asked her parents.","Mrs. Zuo had been waiting for that question for a long time, and she burst into tears.","She added very colorful details to her description when she told Zuo Qingluan how Zuo Qingxian, Zuo Qingliu, and Zuo Qingyu died. In the end, she took Zuo Qingluan’s hand and wept. “Feng Wu hated you for destroying her True Phoenix Blood, so she took it out on your siblings. Luan, you have to make her pay for what she did!”","Zuo Qingluan didn’t really care about her siblings, but...","She took what Feng Wu did personally.","“Mother, I’ll avenge them. Don’t worry,” Zuo Qingluan promised. “Throw a big party for me. If you can, invite Feng Wu.”","“Why?!” Mrs. Zuo asked angrily.","“Because her birthday is on the same day,” Zuo Qingluan said viciously.","“She’s already on guard. I don’t think she’ll come,” said Mrs. Zuo.","Zuo Qingluan smirked, “Then she’ll be a coward.”","Mrs. Zuo didn’t understand, but she trusted her clever daughter.","“By the way, send an invitation to the crown prince’s residence as well,” said Zuo Qingluan before she left.","Mrs. Zuo was pleasantly surprised. She grabbed Master Zuo’s hand and said, “Look, Luan really is fond of His Royal Highness. If we send the crown prince’s residence an invitation, we should invite the other influential families as well. The entire imperial capital will see how miserable Feng Wu is in comparison!”","Master Zuo didn’t say anything, but instinct told him that things wouldn’t be so simple.","The crown prince’s residence.","Granny Gong frowned when she saw the invitation.","Zuo Qingluan’s 18th birthday was coming up.","And His Royal Highness was invited to the party.","Granny Gong snorted, tossed the letter aside, and went back to what she was doing.","She needed to prepare for something very important!","Soon, it was New Year’s Eve.","The Zuo family was packed. Many influential guests were there for the event.","Even the main street outside was blocked by carriages.","The Feng clan had no visitors at all.","It was a stark contrast to the Zuo family.","There were guests from all nine major clans. Even a royal banquet probably wouldn’t have so many people.","“Where’s His Royal Highness?” That was the only thing Mrs.. Zuo cared about."]},{"number":2428,"title":"Chapter 2428 - Wheres His Royal Highness? (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","It was a stark contrast to the Zuo family.","There were guests from all nine major clans. Even a royal banquet probably wouldn’t have so many people.","“Where’s His Royal Highness?” That was the only thing Mrs. Zuo cared about.","Granny Tao replied with a smile, “We sent invitations to the crown prince, Young Lord Feng, and Young Lord Xuan.”","Mrs. Zuo nodded. “They were friends with Luan when they were little. I’m sure they’ll be here to celebrate Luan’s birthday.”","Granny Tao said, “I’m sure they’ll come.”","Just then, they heard the announcement outside. “Princess Mu Yaoyao is here on behalf of the Mu family.”","Mrs. Zuo said happily, “Look, Princess Mu is here.”","Immediately after that, there was another announcement. “Princess Jun Wuxia is here.”","Jun Wuxia and Zuo Qingluan had been good friends since they were little. Her presence meant a lot.","Unlike old Mrs. Gu’s birthday, the guests weren’t government officials.","Most of them were noble ladies with their daughters, and some had brought their sons as well. After all, Zuo Qingluan had many admirers.","For instance, Mrs. Dugu brought both Dugu Yamo and Dugu Mengxi.","The teenagers gathered in the garden, and the mothers and daughters stayed indoors and chatted.","Of course, their conversation revolved around lavishing praise on Zuo Qingluan.","They all said that she was the most talented and capable young woman in the empire, and her True Phoenix Blood made her the only candidate for the future wife of the crown prince.","Mrs. Tao and Tao Qingqing were there as well.","They were in a quieter corner of the room.","Mrs. Tao nudged Tao Qingqing. “Why don’t you say hello to Miss Qingluan?”","Tao Qingqing thought very highly of herself as well and didn’t like the idea of sucking up to Zuo Qingluan.","Mrs. Tao lowered her voice and chided her daughter in a voice that only the two of them could hear. “You’re going to marry Prince Jun Linshen one day, and that will make you and Miss Qingluan sister-in-laws. Just go!”","Tao Qingqing said, “Prince Jun Linshen doesn’t get on well with His Royal Highness...”","Mrs. Tao said sternly, “Use your brain! Prince Jun Linshen will never be the crown prince’s match! He’ll always be only a prince!”","Tao Qingqing said, “Mother, how can you say such things about your future son-in-law?! If that’s the case, why do you want me to marry him?!”","Mrs. Tao said, “Do you think you can marry His Royal Highness, then?”","Tao Qingqing said, “Mother!”","Mrs. Tao was very direct. “I’m not criticizing you, but you’re just not the sharpest tool in the box. Your father and I have indulged you, and you’ve never been a hardworking cultivator. You’re simply not Miss Qingluan’s match.”","Tao Qingqing snorted. “It’s not certain that Zuo Qingluan will marry His Royal Highness. That Feng Wu has a chance, too.”","Mrs. Tao rubbed her head affectionately and sighed. “Sweetheart, you know nothing about marriage. Yes, His Royal Highness is fond of that girl, and we all can see it. So what?”","Tao Qingqing was confused. “What do you mean?”"]},{"number":2429,"title":"Chapter 2429:","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Mrs. Tao said, “Marriage is the joining of two families, and the Feng family is nothing compared with the Zuo family, not to mention that Zuo Qingluan is also connected to Firmament Palace.","“Although Feng Wu has been making fast progress, Zuo Qingluan has the True Phoenix Blood. Do you know what that means? It means that she’s the Chosen One!”","“But Feng Wu is so pretty,” Tao Qingqing said. “She’s already so good-looking now. Just imagine how beautiful she’ll be when she grows up!”","Mrs. Tao shook her head.","Tao Qingqing was perplexed. “Am I wrong?”","“Of course you are!” Mrs. Tao patted her head. “You don’t understand men at all. To men like His Royal Highness, a pretty girl like Feng Wu can be an addition to their collection, but someone like Zuo Qingluan is the woman they’ll marry.”","Tao Qingqing said, “Is that so?”","Mrs. Tao said, “Just wait and see. His Royal Highness and Zuo Qingluan were childhood friends, and they’re still very close. Today is Zuo Qingluan’s birthday; His Royal Highness will definitely come here. It’ll be as good as an official announcement. After that, Zuo Qingluan will be even more prestigious. Quickly, go talk to her before His Royal Highness arrives!”","Tao Qingqing mumbled, “I feel sorry for Feng Wu, then. I heard that she was still engaged to His Royal Highness...”","She then went to befriend Zuo Qingluan.","However —","Zuo Qingluan was so unapproachable!","She glanced past Tao Qingqing as if she was invisible.","She only showed her face for a brief moment before going inside, and probably wouldn’t come back out again before the party started.","Tao Qingqing was speechless.","She stared at Zuo Qingluan in disbelief.","She was the daughter of a lord and was used to getting things her way. When she went to court, even Empress Dugu had taken her hands and praised her in front of His Majesty.","But Zuo Qingluan...","She wasn’t mean or said anything rude to her. She simply looked past Tao Qingqing as if she wasn’t worth the energy.","Tao Qingqing would rather hear some harsh words from her. That would make them enemies on equal footing.","But Zuo Qingluan made her feel like a nobody. That was so frustrating!","Tao Qingqing stomped her foot and grumbled, “His Royal Highness may not come!”","“I don’t think His Royal Highness will come,” said a cold voice behind her.","Tao Qingqing turned around and saw that it was Dugu Yamo.","She asked, “Why are you so sure?”","The Dugu family and the Zuo family were related by marriage and were allies. She couldn’t understand why Dugu Yamo said that.","“Do you fancy His Royal Highness?” Tao Qingqing frowned."]},{"number":2430,"title":"Chapter 2430 - Wheres His Royal Highness? (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“I don’t deny that I used to be in love with His Royal Highness, but I fancy someone else now.” Dugu Yamo smiled.","Tao Qingqing didn’t believe her. “How can you like someone else after you’ve been in love with His Royal Highness? Dugu Yamo, you must be lying! So tell me, who’s that person?”","“It’s Feng Wu.” Dugu Yamo grinned.","Tao Qingqing almost choked on her own spit. “That’s not funny!”","Dugu Yamo stopped joking. She looked at Tao Qingqing and asked seriously, “Do you want to know the real Feng Wu?”","Tao Qingqing frowned. “Do you know what she’s really like?”","Dugu Yamo asked, “Do you want to hear the story of how she was trapped in the tombs and how she fought against all odds and succeeded in the end?”","Tao Qingqing was intrigued. “Tell me everything!”","...","“Wow! Really?! She’s so smart!","“Noooo! She turned a maid into an Ultimate Yin Body, you said? That’s so rare! Of course everyone will try to recruit her!","“What?! Even that useless Duan Chaoge is a genius now? OMG!","“Did you say that Feng Wu spoke back to His Majesty?!","“What?! Feng Wu...”","Tao Qingqing kept crying out in surprise and making all kinds of exclamations.","Meanwhile, Mrs. Zuo was having a difficult time.","Mrs. Tao asked a subtle question when she greeted Mrs. Zuo. “Will we be seeing His Royal Highness today? I had the pleasure to meet him once in the Gu family. I would be so honored to see the crown prince again.”","Mrs. Zuo recalled what Zuo Qingluan told her.","Zuo Qingluan said that she had personally sent another invitation to the crown prince, so he would definitely be here.","All the noble ladies around them looked in their direction when Mrs. Tao asked the question.","Most of them had decided to come here today because of the crown prince.","The rumor outside was that the crown prince was deeply in love with Zuo Qingluan, so they all wanted to see that side of Jun Linyuan.","Mrs. Zuo forced a smile and said, “Qingluan wrote the invitation herself, and His Royal Highness replied in person, saying that he would be here to celebrate Qingluan’s birthday. You know how busy His Royal Highness is. I’m sure he’s still working right now.”","“That’s right. State affairs are more important.”","“I’m sure His Royal Highness will be here once he’s free. Maybe he’s already seeing the sacred lady in her room now. Hahaha —”","...","Once the subject was diverted, Mrs. Zuo quickly went outside. She grabbed Granny Tao and asked in a low, fierce voice, “Is His Royal Highness here yet?”","Granny Tao had been waiting outside the front gate the whole time. She shook her head anxiously. “Not yet.”","“Then... Has Young Lord Feng arrived?” asked Mrs. Zuo.","Feng Xun was the crown prince’s best buddy. Having him here would be the next best thing.","Granny Tao still shook her head. “I don’t see him either.”","“What about Young Lord Xuan?”"]},{"number":2431,"title":"Chapter 2431 - Miserable Feng Wu","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“I haven’t seen him.”","Mrs. Zuo wanted to slap Granny Tao.","“Could they have gone to Phoenix Yard directly?” That was Mrs. Zuo’s last hope.","Granny Tao smiled bitterly and shook her head. “If that was the case, Miss Qingluan wouldn’t have smashed all those dishes.”","Mrs. Zuo shook her head and began to panic.","If His Royal Highness didn’t come, she couldn’t imagine what would happen.","“Go find my husband! And send people to the crown prince’s residence, Northern Feng Mansion, and Lord Xuan’s manor! If His Royal Highness doesn’t come in the end, you have to get Feng Xun and Xuan Yi here, even if you need to kidnap them!”","“Yes!” Granny Tao immediately went off to give out the order.","Meanwhile —","Where was Feng Xun?","And where was Xuan Yi?","They were both at the crown prince’s residence.","“Boss Jun, it’s Xiao Wu’s birthday today. Aren’t you going to tell her happy birthday in person?” Feng Xun tried to take Jun Linyuan to Feng Wu.","The crown prince was his usual self and refused to admit his feelings. He glanced at Feng Xun and waved him off. “That won’t be necessary.”","Feng stood by his side and looked down at his feet.","He was venting his sarcasm inwardly.","Before Feng Xun arrived, Jun Linyuan had changed outfits 13 times. The robes were either the wrong color or of poor design. He ended up complaining to the tailors.","His Royal Highness had never tried on different clothes before.","Feng Xun grabbed Jun Linyuan’s arm. “Just come with us, and let’s celebrate Xiao Wu’s birthday for her. You have no idea how busy the Zuo family is today. On my way here, I saw that all the carriages were going that way.","“Nearly all the nine major clans have sent someone to attend the party. Xiao Wu is so miserable in comparison. Her family doesn’t like her either. I bet she’s all alone right now.”","Jun Linyuan frowned a little.","Feng knew that it was time for him to make an excuse for his young master, so he suggested, “Your Royal Highness, your celebration plan for Miss Feng Wu will soon take place. Would you like to go to the Feng family and see the effect in person?”","Jun Linyuan glared at him. “My plan?”","“Of course it’s your plan! You stayed up all night for it!” thought Feng.","But he knew the crown prince too well, so he immediately said, “I mean, Young Lord Feng’s plan.”","Anyway, once those people cashed in the vouchers, they would still need to come to the crown prince’s residence. Everyone would know then that the crown prince had funded the event...","Feng Xun said, “Boss Jun, just come with us. I feel so sorry for Xiao Wu! She’s my sister, and you’re my best friend! Won’t you do me this favor?”","The crown prince rolled his eyes at him. “Let go, and I’ll go with you.”","Fallen Star Yard.","Feng Wu was cooking today.","She had never felt the necessity of celebrating birthdays. As a result, only the people very close to her knew her birthday.","She made two bowls of noodles, one for herself and the other for her mother. It was to thank the beautiful lady for giving birth to her.","Then, she moved on to the spicy dishes.","“Miss, the Zuo family is very busy today..” Qiuling chatted with Feng Wu as she chopped up the peppers."]},{"number":2432,"title":"Chapter 2432 - Theyre Here (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu loved Sichuan dishes, but she didn’t have time to cook them too often,","So she taught Qjuling how to make them.","Qjuling was almost as good as Feng Wu, but Feng Wu was still the best.","Therefore, Feng Wu decided to cook everything herself today.","After chopping up the peppers, Qjuling moved on to sorting the vegetables.","She told Feng Wu, “The Zuo family is very busy today because it’s Zuo","Qingluan’s birthday.”","She sounded upset when she said, “Every year, the Zuo family has a big","celebration, telling everyone that it’s her birthday.”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes. “Why do you even care?”","Qjuling was already an excellent cultivator, and many people had been trying","to acquire her. She could easily become a core disciple in any family or sect, but","here she was, doing housework like a common maid.","Qjuling added, “I heard that His Royal Highness is going to celebrate Miss Zuo’s","birthday with her!”","Feng Wu felt a dull pain in her chest. “Is that so?","Qiuling said, “That’s right. They all say that His Royal Highness is very close to","Miss Zuo, and they’ll soon be engaged. But how can that be? You’re already","engaged to His Royal Highness!","She tried to comfort Feng Wu. “Miss, please don’t be sad.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at Qiuling. “Why should I be sad? It’s not like I actually","like him!","“Is that so” Qjuling wasn’t convinced.","She noticed that Feng Wu was very serious today","Usually, she would chat happily while she was cooking.","Their initial plan was to make six dishes, but Feng Wu came up with another","four and made ten in total.","There was fish, meat, tofu, and more meat..","Every dish was covered with red chili, and the aroma made one’s mouth water.","The beautiful lady had already taken her seat. Her slender hands were in her","lap, and she had the most elegant posture, which reminded one ofa white","swan.","However, she was practically drooling over the dishes.","Like a five-year-old.","Seeing this, Feng Wu felt her spirits lift. “I wished Xiaoqi were here, but","traveling with Grand Secretary Fang must be very helpful to him.”","However, the beautiful lady acted as if she couldn’t hear Feng Wu.","Feng Wu then picked out some food for her.","Although she loved Feng Wu’s food, she only had the appetite of a bird.","Feng Wu then took off her apron. “Tll go get the elders.”","Chaoge said, “I thought they never left the restricted area.”","Feng Wu chuckled. “TIl invite them; it’ll be up to them whether they want to","come here or not.”","After all, it was New Year’s Eve.","She handed the apron to Chaoge and jumped out the window, soon","disappearing into the night.","In the restricted area.","The noise outside only made this place feel more lonely.","The three elders were Elder Breeze, Elder Jing, and Elder Grain."]},{"number":2433,"title":"Chapter 2433 - Theyre Here (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 2433: They’re Here (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations| Editor: Henyee Translations","Where Feng Wu was concerned, Elder Breeze remained neutral, and Elder Jing","was on her side. Elder Grain used to support Feng Yanfeng, but after what","happened previously, his attitude toward Feng Wu had changed, though he","would still pick on her from time to time.","“Eat outside? No way!” Elder Grain shook his head when he heard the","suggestion. “Kiddo, we can’t leave this place.","“Plus, you can’t buy me off with a single meal!","Feng Wu sat down in front of him and grinned. “But didn’t you tell Feng","Yanfeng off for me already?","Elder Grain said, “That was because he crossed the line! I wasn’t helping you!”","He crossed his arms and raised his chin.","Feng Wu wanted to laugh, but she fought it back. She knew that the old man","would be mad at her if she burst out laughing now.","Making the trip here had cheered hear up.","She brushed away her frustrated thoughts and asked, “Are you really not","coming? Today is my birthday.”","Birthday? Elder Jing was persuaded.","Elder Grain said, “I won’t go even if you were getting married today!”","Feng Wu said, “Fine. Here’s an appetizer for you. If you like it, there’s more in","Fallen Star Yard.”","She had packed a tiny portion of each dish, but they still looked very delicious.","Seeing that she was leaving, Elder Grain grumbled, “When are you going to pull","yourself together?","“What?” Feng Wu was confused.","Elder Grain glanced at her and said contemptuously, “Your fiance is celebrating","another girl’s birthday right now.”","Feng Wu was speechless. Why did she have to hear this even when she was no","longer in Fallen Star Yard?","She madea mental note to blame it on Jun Linyuan. Then she asked curiously,","“How do you know that it’s Zuo Qingluan’s birthday today?”","Elder Grain said smugly, “Since your last visit, I’ve been in charge of gathering","information. I know everything”","He still helda grudge against Feng Yanfeng for trying to fool him. He couldn’t","be bothered to deal with Feng Yanfeng just yet, but that didn’t mean that he","had forgotten about it.","Feng Wu said grumpily, “Why do you care about such gossip? If you have the","time, work on your cultivation! The entire clan is counting on you lot!","She didn’t want to linger on the subject, so she turned to leave.","Elder Grain said, “I know what you’re doing. Your man was stolen by some","flirtatious woman, so you’re lashing out at me.","Feng Wu clenched her fists.","She told herself to calm down, but she wanted to shout at Jun Linyuan.","Elder Jing glared at Elder Grain. “Why did you say that?! The girl is already so","sad, you should be gentle! What if she cries?!”","Feng Wu wanted to tell them that she wasn’t sad at all.","Elder Grain grumbled, “I just can’t believe it! That Jun Linyuan boy is the most","excellent cultivator ever, and he should marry our girl, not that Zuo Qingluan!”","Elder Jing gave him some of the food Feng Wu brought. “Just eat your dinner.”","“Gosh! It’s so good!” Elder Grain’s eyes widened."]},{"number":2434,"title":"Chapter 2434 - Theyre Here (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations| Editor: Henyee Translations","When Feng Wu retuned to Fallen Star Yard, she heard cheerful activity inside.","Feng Xun said, “That’s hilarious! Chaoge, guess what? We all received her","invitation!","Chaoge said, “So, did you come here after you went to her party?","Feng Xun said, “Of course not! We never went there! We weren’t anywhere","close to that house!”","Chaoge said, “But everyone has been saying how much His Royal Highness","likes that sacred lady! Not only was he going to attend the party, he was also","going to give her a gift! And","Feng Xun said, “And what","Chaoge said, “And I heard that His Royal Highness was going to announce","today that he was going to marry Zuo Qingluan.”","“Nonsense!” Feng Xun grew agitated. “of course not! Boss Jun is going to marry","Xiao Wu. He’ll never marry that pretentious woman!","Chaoge looked at Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan glanced at her with his brooding eyes.","Chaoge sucked in her breath.","She dared to bicker with Feng Xun, but she was intimidated whenever Jun","Linyuan was present. She didn’t even dare to meet his gaze, let alone question","him","So, Jun Linyuan hadn’t gone to the Zuo family. Feng Wu raised her eyebrows.","Who’s out there?","“Me. Feng Wu walked in","She walked into the courtyard to meet Jun Linyuan’s brooding eyes. She felt","that he could see right through her.","What was that supposed to mean?","She looked away to avoid his gaze.","Why are you here?","She tried to walk past Jun Linyuan to sit on the other side, but Feng Xun","wouldn’t let her.","He pressed her down in the empty chair next to Jun Linyuan and chuckled.","“Where do you think you’re going? Here’s your seat!","Why should she sit next to Jun Linyuan? Feng Wu glared at Feng Xun and","asked, “Why must I sit here?","Tt was as if she had been labeled Jun Linyuan’s girl. Feng Wu decided that she","would like someone else; she couldn’t afford to have such a connection with","him.","“of course you have to sit here.” Feng Xun grinned. “His Royal Highness is the","most prestigious person here, so he has to take the host seat. You’re the","birthday girl, so it only makes sense that you sit in the second-best seat.”","Feng Wu blushed.","“Am I wrong? Where ese should you sit? Feng Xun looked confused.","Feng Wu wondered if he was saying it on purpose","To avoid embarrassment, she changed the subject. “Shouldn’t all of you be with","the Zuo family right now?","Feng Xun snorted.","He sat right next to Feng Wu and was very close.","Feng Wu asked, “What’s that look on your face?","Feng Xun sighed. “Why do you even ask? For her birthday, Zuo Qingluan and","her mother each sent us an invitation, but what about you? You didn’t even","send us a note!","Feng Wu said, “Well"]},{"number":2435,"title":"Chapter 2435 - Theyre Here (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations| Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun snorted. “We wouldn’t have come here if we hadn’t felt sorry for you.","We knew that you would be so lonely.”","Feng Wu said, “But I’m not lonely at all","Feng Xun said, “Of course you’re lonely. All the influential figures of the","imperial capital are at the Zuo residence, and you’re all on your own. If we","hadn’t come here, your place would look abandoned!”","Feng Xun took a bite of the fish as he teased Feng Wu.","This whole time, Feng Wu could feel a pair of eyes on her.","She felt her cheeks heat up.","But she didn’t look back and pretended that she couldn’t feel it.","For some unknown reason, the more intense the gaze, the longer she spoke to","Feng Xun.","She said, “Why do I get the feeling that you’re here for my food instead of me?","Feng Xun chuckled, awkwardly. “It’s the same thing. It’s the same thing”","Soon, the ten dishes were eaten up, and there was only some gravy left on the","plates.","Her eyes unexpectedly met Jun Linyuan’s gaze.","This time, he quickly looked away.","Feng Wu was surprised. Would someone like him feel shy?","Was he? Feng Wu couldn’t be sure.","But soon, the crown prince came back to his senses, and he turned his","aggressive gaze on Feng Wu again.","Feng Wu now decided that she must have been seeing things. Of course the","man couldn’t feel shy.","While Xuan Yi was observing them, Feng Xun was busy cleaning the plates. He","didn’t notice any interaction between Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan.","Feng Xun said, “Xiao Wu, you should really make some friends. We’re the only","people that would celebrate your birthday with you.”","Feng Wu wanted to smack him on the head.","Feng Xun said, “You don’t even have a visitor from your clan. You really don’t","get along well with your family members.”","How blunt.","He said, “How about we make a bet? I’ll lose if you have one visitor from your","clan. How about that?”","Feng Wu wouldn’t respond.","Feng Xun said, “If you win, I’ll help you whenever you have to face Zuo","Qingluan. And if I win, you have to do something for me.”","Feng Wu chuckled. “Deal.”","Just then, they heard footsteps outside.","“Xiao Wu, where’s the food you promised us?”","Elder Jing walked in, followed by the reluctant Elder Grain.","Feng Xun’s eyes widened. Who were these people?","Elder Jing and Elder Grain also stared at them in bewildermment.","Before, when they were cut off from the outside world, they hardly knew","anyone, but since they started gathering information, they couldn’t avoid","hearing these teenagers’ names.","“Jun Linyuan?” Elder Jing’s eyes lit up.","Jun Linyuan had obviously recognized them, and he looked amazed, but he","soon regained his poise."]},{"number":2436,"title":"Chapter 2436 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Chapter 2436: Untitled","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Even when facing the elders, the crown prince remained seated in the host seat. He nodded at the two old men.","That was the most polite greeting he could offer.","Elder Jing didn’t think much of it, but Elder Grain was surprised.","Wasn’t Jun Linyuan the crown prince who had been seduced by that Zuo girl?","Elder Grain stared at Jun Linyuan and wanted to give him a speech, but when he saw the look in his eyes, he backed off.","Feng Wu glanced at Feng Xun. “You lost.”","Feng Xun felt like he had just slapped himself.","Elder Jing turned to look at Feng Wu. “Can’t you be a little more generous? You only gave us a mouthful of each dish, and we barely tasted everything before the plates were empty. Elder Grain was so grumpy.”","Elder Grain grumbled, “No, I wasn’","Elder Jing said, “Fine. You weren’t. Someone else was too embarrassed to come here alone and forced me to come with him.”","“Feng Lanjing!” Elder Jing stomped his foot in frustration.","Elder Jing chuckled. “Whatever you say. Xiao Wu, where’s our food?”","Seeing that Elder Breeze wasn’t here, Feng Wu knew that the chief elder must have stayed behind to guard the restricted area.","She was speechless when she saw the empty plates on the table.","Since when did Feng Xun lick the plates clean?","“Tl cook something right now. Just wait here. Feng Xun, you chat with the elders. Qiuling, come and help me in the kitchen.” Feng Wu gave them a nod before going into the kitchen.","Elder Jing looked amazed when he saw Qiuling.","“That’s a very talented girl.”","Elder Grain nodded, “Yes, she’s much better than some of the kids of our clan. I don’t know what’s happened to this clan, but the younger generation is such rubbish.”","Feng Xun patted Elder Grain on the shoulder. “What should I call you?”","Elder Grain glared at him. How rude!","Elder Jing looked Feng Xun up and down. “You’re Feng Beiting’s son, aren’t you? How’s your dad doing?”","Feng Xun asked, “Do you know my dad?”","Elder Grain said, “I even know your grandpa. We had an epic fight here in the imperial capital once. Didn’t your grandpa tell you anything?”","Feng Xun stuttered, “Are – are you Feng Chengu? That makes him Feng Lanjin;","“You’ve finally figured it out.” Elder Grain put a few peanuts into his mouth.","“Iremember that many excellent cultivators died in that battle, and the rumor was that the two of you also...”","Elder Grain said, “Do people still know us?”","Feng Xun said, “Of course! You’re two of the most famous cultivators ever! I didn’t expect to see you alive!”","He was glad that the two old men liked Feng Wu.","‘They could help her greatly in battle.","Less than an hour later, Feng Wu started serving new dishes."]},{"number":2437,"title":"Chapter 2437 - Good News","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor:","Henyee Translations","She made another ten dishes and made sure that there was enough to fill everyone’s stomachs.","After she sat down, Feng Xun glanced at her. “Xiao Wu, today is your birthday, and we’ve prepared —”","Boom!","Before he finished speaking, fireworks filled the sky.","Feng Wu looked over her shoulder and saw the colorful fireworks. The pattern formed a few letters that said “happy.”","What?","Feng Wu didn’t know who was firing them.","Moreover, she was amazed that people of this age could actually use fireworks to form words.","Jun Linyuan glanced at Feng Xun in satisfaction.","Feng Xun was rendered speechless.","He felt that something was off, because the first word was supposed to be “Feng.”","Boom!","Soon, the second wave of fireworks was in the sky, and formed the second part of the word: “ness.”","Feng Xun grew uneasy. Were those fireworks of the Zuo family?","Meanwhile —","Mrs. Zuo was panic-stricken.","She had bragged that the crown prince would definitely be there.","She even told the others that the crown prince would propose to Zuo Qingluan tonight, which was why all the guests were here.","‘They were here for the crown prince!","Even Mrs. Dugu was anxious. She led Mrs. Zuo to the side and asked, “Will His Royal Highness come tonight?”","Mrs. Zuo said, “I don’t know!”","Mrs. Dugu said, “You don’t know? How can you not know?! Didn’t you say that the crown prince would definitely be here? We’ll be so humiliated!”","Mrs. Zuo said, “We sent an invitation to the crown prince’s residence, and Qingluan says she sent one as well.”","Mrs. Dugu asked, “Then what did the crown prince’s residence say?”","Mrs. Zuo fell silent. In fact, the crown prince’s residence never gave any reply. She had only been so certain because Zuo Qingluan said so.","Mrs. Dugu said, “I hope they’ll be here soon. Mrs. Tao is already asking questions. If His Royal Highness still doesn’t come, the other families will grow doubtful as well.”","While the two of them talked behind a tree, several other guests were discussing among themselves.","“Do you think His Royal Highness will come tonight?”","“| think so. Isn’t the crown prince going to propose to Miss Qingluan?”","“But we’re already halfway through the banquet. Shouldn’t His Royal Highness be here already?”","“If everything tums out to be a lie, Miss Qingluan will be so humiliated.”","Mrs. Zuo was furious when she heard the conversation, but she couldn’t retort.","She was supposed to be the elegant lady of the Zuo family and couldn’t shout and curse like a commoner. Moreover, they were right. His Royal Highness still hadn’t arrived.","“Luan, why are you out here?” Mrs. Dugu was surprised when she turned around and saw Zuo Qingluan.","Under the flickering lights, Zuo Qingluan looked rather scary.","Before Zuo Qingluan could say anything, Mrs.. Zuo’s maid arrived in a hurry and said, “My lady, I have good news!”"]},{"number":2438,"title":"Chapter 2438 - Mistaken","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor:","Henyee Translations","“My lady, I have good news!” Granny Tao grabbed Mrs. Zuo’s hand and was trembling in excitement.","Mrs. Zuo took a deep breath. “Is His Royal Highness here? Is he?”","Granny Tao shook her head. “It’s better than that! I heard that Young Lord Feng has been preparing for a very big celebration, and it’s happening tonight! All the common people of the imperial capital will take part!”","Mrs. Zuo shook with excitement as well. She took another deep breath and said, “Keep going!”","Granny Tao said, “Yes. The steward of the Northern Feng Mansion is instructing people to carry things to the central square. I saw some silver, gold, and spiritual stones. According to the steward, they’re all going to be prizes!”","Mrs. Zuo asked, “What prizes?”","Granny Tao said, “I was confused at first as well, so I asked him. He said that Young Lord Feng was asked to hold a birthday celebration tonight, and is even giving out gift envelopes. The vouches can be cashed in on the spot, and the total value is 100 million coins!”","“100 million coins?!” Mrs. Zuo was so excited that she almost fainted.","‘The imperial vault might not have that much cash.","The total value of Zuo Qingluan’s gifts was less than a million, but Feng Xun was giving out 100 million!","“The common folk have gone insane, and they’re all heading for the central square!” said Granny Tao.","Mrs. Zuo said, “Did you say a birthday party? Is Young Lord Feng celebrating someone’s birthday?”","Granny Tao said, “That’s right!”","Mrs. Zuo took a deep breath and forced herself to calm down. “And today is...”","Granny Tao said, “It’s Miss Qingluan’s birthday today!”","Mrs. Zuo said, “But why would Young Lord Feng...”","Mrs. Dugu chimed in. “Don’t you get it? Northern Feng Mansion can’t be that rich!”","Mrs. Zuo nodded, still perplexed.","Mrs. Dugu said, “It means that Young Lord Feng is doing it on someone else’s behalf! Who else can come up with so much money?”","Mrs. Zuo still couldn’t believe it. “What do you mean?”","Mrs. Dugu nudged her. “Stop making us envy you! Of course, it has to be His Royal Highness!”","“Congratulations, Mrs. Zuo and Miss Qingluan.” Mrs. Tao heard the conversation because Mrs. Dugu didn’t try to keep her voice down.","Mrs. Tao and Tao Qingqing stepped out to congratulate Mrs. Zuo and Zuo Qingluan.","Zuo Qingluan’s face remained indifferent, but one could tell that she was in a good mood.","The other ladies followed suit and offered their congratulations.","Mrs. Zuo was over the moon, but she feigned a modest tone and said, “It can’t be.. We must be mistaken."]},{"number":2439,"title":"Chapter 2439 - That Heartless Boy","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Mrs. Zuo said, “Don’t say that. His Royal Highness doesn’t really know Luan. This can’t be for her. I’m sure you’re all mistaken.”","Mrs. Tao was almost devoured by jealousy, but she still had to offer her congratulations.","The other ladies did the same.","After all, jealousy was part of human nature.","How lucky could Zuo Qingluan be? She was already so talented, but now, she had also earned the crown prince’s affections.","Tao Qingqing mumbled, “Why are they all saying that His Royal Highness is celebrating Miss Qingluan’s birthday? He could be celebrating Feng Wu’s.”","Mrs. Tao nudged her with her elbow and gave her a warning glance.","“The Zuo family is already one of the most influential families, and now, they’ve earned the crown prince’s support. Do you know how formidable that is? Don’t offend Zuo Qingluan!”","Just then, the fireworks went off!","The resplendent fireworks formed two words in the night sky: Happiness forever.","Wait.","Mrs. Dugu pointed at the sky and told Mrs. Zuo, “Look, those words are lingering in the sky. They’re another way of saying happy birthday, aren’t they?”","Mrs. Zuo still feigned a humble tone. “Of course not. You guys are overthinking it...”","Mrs. Dugu smiled. “The fireworks are rising from the north and west gates, and the south and east gates haven’t started yet. What do you think the remaining words will be?”","“I think it’ll be Miss Qingluan’s name,” someone said.","The celebration event today had attracted the attention of the entire imperial capital.","Of course, Emperor Wu heard about it.","Right now, he was standing on the tallest building and looking down at the entire city.","He looked silently in the direction of the west and north gates.","Gao, the eunuch, didn’t dare disturb his master. He fetched a thick cape and put it around Emperor Wu’s shoulders.","Seeing the words in the sky, Emperor Wu said, “I heard that the Zuo family is holding a big party, and everyone is there.”","Gao nodded.","Emperor Wu smirked. “They’re very popular, aren’t they?”","Gao lowered his head and didn’t reply.","“Lwas told that Jun Linyuan prepared gifts for everyone to celebrate Zuo Qingluan’s birthday?” Emperor Wu frowned.","Gao said, “That’s what the rumor has been saying...”","“He never did such a thing for Xiao Wu’s birthday. By the way, when is her birthday?”","Gao glanced at Emperor Wu.","Emperor Wu smacked his head. “That’s right! Today is her birthday as well! Her mother had a difficult labor when she was born, and I sent an imperial physician to her home!","“Has Jun Linyuan lost his mind?!” Emperor Wu grew angry.. “He was so nice to Xiao Wu before, but now that Zuo Qingluan is back, he’s all over her! What a heartless boy!”"]},{"number":2440,"title":"Chapter 2440 - Its Not \"Qjngluan\"","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“I’m going!” Emperor Wu stormed off.","“Your Majesty, where are you going?” Gao asked curiously as he helped","Emperor Wu change into a casual outfit.","“Xiao Wu must be devastated now. My stupid son abandoned her; I can’t live","with that!” Emperor Wu put a hand to his chest.","Gao thought, “I think you’re just looking for an excuse to see Lady Ling..”","Of course, he didn’t dare to say that out loud.","Just then, fireworks rose above the south gate of the city and turned into two","words: Birthday girl","“Your Majesty, look!” Gao pointed at the sky.","Emperor Wu’s face darkened. “So, I was right! He really is celebrating Zuo","Qingluan’s birthday! How can I have such a promiscuous son?!”","Gao cleared this throat, finding that description a little over the top.","Meanwhile, in the Zuo family.","Zuo Qingluan stood in the center of the crowd, and her otherworldly beauty","made her look like a fairy.","Her clenched fists relaxed when she saw the two words.","His Royal Highness must be celebrating her birthday!","She could see the jealousy in everyone’s eyes.","Tao Qingqing snorted inwardly.","That arrogant woman!","It was just some fireworks! Big deal!","At that thought, she became angry at Feng Wu.","You’re so pretty and smart, how can you let Zuo Qingluan steal your fiance","That’s just dumb!","On second thought, she wondered what would happen if Feng Wu’s name","appeared in the sky later. Everyone would be so shocked.","Unfortunately, that wouldn’t happen.","Before Tao Qjngqing was done criticizing Feng Wu in her head, fireworks rose","into the sky above the east gate.","Boom!","Scarlet patterns filled the sky.","It was so resplendent!","Nothing could compare with it.","But!","The crowd was astonished when they saw the name in the sky.","Because the name in the sky wasn’t Qingluan.","It was “Feng Wu”!","“Feng Wul It really is Feng Wu!” Tao Qingqing was shocked.","So was everyone else.","Mrs. Dugu looked at Mrs. Zuo.","Mrs. Zuo felt like she had just been slapped.","Her brain seemed to stop working.","Everyone then slowly turned to look at Zuo Qingluan.","What was the expression on her face?","Deep down, she was furious and wanted to skin Feng Wu alive, but she forced","herself to calm down because she was the graceful sacred lady of Firmament","Palace and a true phoenix.","Feng Wu was nothing!","Zuo Qingluan, you must calm down!","Zuo Qingluan closed her eyes and took a few deep breaths. When she opened","her eyes again, her face was no longer twitching,."]},{"number":2441,"title":"Chapter 2441 - Yu Mingye?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor:","Henyee Translations","“Go to the east gate and find out who’s doing it! Can it be the Feng clan?”","Not everyone had lost their judgement.","At that critical moment, Master Zuo made the call.","“That’s right! Go to the east gate and see if the Feng clan is setting off all the fireworks!”","‘The Dugu family and the Zuo family were allies. If the Zuo family was humiliated, the Dugu family would become a laughingstock as well. Therefore, Mrs. Dugu stepped out to help Master Zuo.","However","They couldn’t change what everyone thought.","The expression in the eyes of other people was already changing when they looked at Zuo Qingluan.","Tao Qingqing was the most excited.","For a moment, she thought she was blessed.","Otherwise, why would things turn out the way she wanted?","“Mom! Mom! Did you see it?”","She dragged Mrs. Tao to a quiet corner and whispered, “It was Feng Wu’s name in the sky!”","“Theard that Prince Yu is studying under Black Dragon King at the moment and has been making amazing progress!”","“Iwas told that Miss Qingluan went to challenge Yu Mingye, but he forced her to surrender after three stances!”","“Isn’t Miss Qingluan supposed to be a junior Spiritual King? Three stances... What level is Prince Yu at, then?”","“The Black Dragon King is the guardian of the Dark Court. If Prince Yu is studying under him, how formidable is he?!”","Zuo Qingluan’s face was livid.","She was glad when she heard that the fireworks weren’t from the crown prince.","It proved that His Royal Highness still cared about her.","Feng Wu hadn’t stolen him away.","But why was Yu Mingye involved?","Moreover, why Yu Mingye?","If Jun Linyuan was the most brilliant teenager that ever existed, then Yu Mingye was the second best.","Zuo Qingluan wanted the best, but she hated to think that Feng Wu, the girl she loathed, was courted by Yu Mingye, an almost equally excellent boy.. She wouldn’t allow it!"]},{"number":2442,"title":"Chapter 2442 - Jun Linyuan the Sovereign","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Zuo Qingluan took a deep breath.","She had to calm down.","She needed to figure out a way to force Feng Wu out of this game and destroy her for good.","At the same time.","Fallen Star Yard!","‘When Feng Wu’s name appeared in the sky, Jun Linyuan stared at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun was equally perplexed.","He felt that something was off when the fireworks rose above the north gate.","Because his order was to set it off in the central square!","And Feng Xun was even more confused when he saw the words in the sky.","Because they weren’t his design.","Feng Xun and Jun Linyuan looked at each other in bewilderment.","Jun Linyuan’s fireworks would also form some words.","And they were","Feng Xun glanced at Boss Jun.","Jun Linyuan had written those words himself. Feng Xun was sure that Feng Wu would be so excited.","“Xiao Wu, that’s so nice!” Chaoge was over the moon. “Happiness forever, birthday girl Feng Wu. That’s such a wonderful wish!”","The others nodded as well.","Elder Grain was intrigued, but he was too proud to ask the question.","So he nudged Elder Jing with his elbow.","Elder Jing rolled his eyes at him.","Elder Grain nudged him again.","Elder Jing was speechless.","He had no choice but to ask, “Xiao Wu, who’s setting off the fireworks? Is it...”","He glanced at the crown prince.","Boom!","At that moment, the fireworks went off in all four directions before they formed a name in the sky: Yu Mingye.","Everyone saw it.","Yu Mingye!","‘The crown prince glared at Feng Xun with a murderous look in his eyes.","Feng Xun wanted to cry.","He had no idea that Yu Mingye would join the competition. That was why the fireworks had started three minutes too early and had the wrong words!","“Boss Jun, I...” Feng Xun didn’t know what to say. He made a mental note to find Yu Mingye later and kick his ass.","“Shut up!” Jun Linyuan glared at him.","Feng Xun rose to his feet. “T’ll go...”","But right at that moment!","Thump!","‘There was another loud bang.","The fireworks this time were even louder and more resplendent than Yu Mingye’s.","What the hell?","Feng Wu was baffled by everything that had happened.","She just wanted a peaceful birthday, but why wouldn’t these people let her have it?","And it was getting worse.","Because the words formed by the fireworks were astonishing.","“Jun Linyuan the sovereign descends to the world”!","The handwriting contained so much force that the words looked like they had been carved into the sky.","Residents of the imperial capital would probably remember it forever.","‘The Zuo family!","“Look! More fireworks!”","“They’re even better than before!”","“Yu Mingye’s fireworks were amazing. Only a handful of people in the Junwu Empire could make them.”","“Who’s setting off these ones, then?”","“The sovereign descends to the world? Gosh, can it be."]},{"number":2443,"title":"Chapter 2443 - Feng Wu the Phoenix","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Jun Linyuan the sovereign descends to the world? Gosh, can it be...”","“Can it be from His Royal Highness?”","“Has His Royal Highness joined the game?”","Meanwhile, Mu Yaoyao ran up to Zuo Qingluan and shouted excitedly, “Sister Qingluan! His Royal Highness created those fireworks for you!”","Zuo Qingluan remained indifferent, as if nothing could affect her.","The common people of the imperial capital were shocked by everything that was happening.","They had been eating dinner with their families at home when all the noise went off.","In Willow Alley.","“Wang, come out here! Get your whole family! I have good news!”","“Chen? What good news?”","Chen was a cart driver and had always been well-informed.","“Some big shot is giving out gift envelopes today! At the central square! Let’s go!”","“What’s the occasion?”","“What do you think? His Royal Highness is celebrating Miss Qingluan’s birthday, and the gifts will be worth 100 million in total!”","“100 million? OMG! Let’s go!”","Many families had heard similar news, and they all headed for the central square.","‘The Feng clan.","Lady Wang and Feng Yanfeng were having dinner with Feng Yiran and Feng Sang.","Of course, they all heard the news as well.","Feng Yanfeng said, “Today is Xiao Wu’s birthday.”","Lady Wang glared at him.","They were going to kick Feng Wu out of the family; why was he still calling her “Xiao Wu’","“Xiao Wu and Miss Qingluan’s birthdays are on the same day. Wouldn’t all those fireworks offend Miss Qingluan?” Feng Yanfeng was a little scared of Zuo Qingluan.","Lady Wang snorted. “No one can steal Zuo Qingluan’s spotlight. Feng Wu just isn’t important enough to offend her!”","Feng Yiran chimed in, “Father, don’t worry. His Royal Highness is in love with Zuo Qingluan, and Feng Wu can’t change that. See? It says ‘Jun Linyuan the sovereign descends to the world’ now; the next sentence will probably be ‘Qingluan the phoenix is by his side’","Feng Sang rolled her eyes at him. “That doesn’t even rhyme! It should be...”","The second round of fireworks went off before she could finish.","Feng Sang was pleasantly surprised.","It was right on cue! Was she the lucky girl?","Would all her wishes come true, then?","But soon, she knew that she wasn’t the lucky girl, but Feng Wu!","Because she saw the sentence in the sky!","“Feng Wu the phoenix soars above the land”!","‘The first line was still in the sky when this line appeared. Feng Wu couldn’t help but curse under her breath.","What about the Zuo family?","Everyone had become very quiet.","One could even hear the sound of leaves falling on the ground.","What an embarrassing moment!","It wasn’t Zuo Qingluan.","It was never going to be her.","Rather, it was Feng Wu!","The girl whom so many people had slandered before!","‘Tao Qingqing put a hand over her mouth, fearing that her heart would jump out at any moment.","Meanwhile, Zuo Qingluan —"]},{"number":2444,"title":"Chapter 2444 - How Can It Be Feng Wu?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Meanwhile, Zuo Qingluan —","She was completely baffled.","For the first time in her life, her head was completely blank.","The blow was so hard that she didn’t know how to react.","How could it be Feng Wu?","“Luan?” Mrs, Zuo rushed to her side and embraced her, fearing that she might pass out.","Zuo Qingluan slowly came back to her senses, and her eyes refocused.","She was shocked by the looks the others gave her.","She panicked.","She had never panicked after she destroyed Feng Wu’s True Phoenix Blood, but now, she was panic-stricken.","No! She was Zuo Qingluan!","She was the sacred lady of Firmament Palace and the only one with True Phoenix Blood! She shouldn’t panic!","She regained her posture and looked perfectly calm again.","Mrs. Zuo was still grumbling, “Who’s doing it? Who? Someone must be setting off these fireworks under the guise of His Royal Highness’s name! That’s right! Someone is setting His Royal Highness up!","“Jun Linyuan the sovereign descends to the world’? His Royal Highness is still the crown prince; that line is so provoking! Are they trying to turn His Majesty against His Royal Highness?","“And what is ‘Feng Wu the phoenix soars above the land’ supposed to mean? Luan is the one His...”","“Mother, be careful with your choice of words.”","Zuo Qingluan wanted to tell Mrs. Zuo to shut up, but she thought that wasn’t the words a future empress would use, so she toned it down a little.","Mrs. Zuo was very scared of Zuo Qingluan.","Hearing that, she immediately shut up.","However, she didn’t know what she had done wrong.","Zuo Qingluan looked at Dugu Menghai, the eldest son of the Dugu family.","Dugu Menghai was the vice-captain of the imperial guards who worked under Qin Yan, the captain who was always by the emperor’s side.","“I’s okay to celebrate Feng Wu’s birthday, but someone is pretending to be the crown prince and incriminating him for treason. I can’t overlook it. Brother Menghai, please look into it now.”","“Of course. I’ll be on my way.” Dugu Menghai immediately went to carry out that order.","Mrs. Tao studied Zuo Qingluan.","How clever. She immediately concluded that someone was working against His Royal Highness. Not only did she save herself from the embarrassment, she blamed Feng Wu as well.","However, when she recalled what Feng Wu had done in the Gu family, she felt that Feng Wu was still the smarter one.","Many people depended on the Zuo family, so in a moment like this, they jumped out to defend the family.","“Miss Qingluan is right! Someone must be doing it on purpose!”","“Of all the girls out there, they have to mention Feng Wu’s name. I’m sure she’s involved!”","“Does Feng Wu still hold a grudge against Miss Qingluan for what happened back then, so she’s using this opportunity to disgust her?”","“What happened back then?”","“Don’t you know? Five years ago, two people had the True Phoenix Blood. One was Miss Qingluan and the other one was Feng Wu, but Feng Wu destroyed her own blood and became useless. She must hate Miss Qingluan after that!”","“So true! Feng Wu must be involved! We have to get to the bottom of it!”"]},{"number":2445,"title":"Chapter 2445 - Mysterious Father of the Emperor","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Tao Qingging smirked. Get to the bottom of what?","‘The crown prince had protected Feng Wu against the Gu family; it was so obvious that he was fond of her! That Zuo Qingluan should stop daydreaming!","She gave Zuo Qingluan a mocking glance.","It just so happened that Zuo Qingluan glanced in her direction at that moment.","Tao Qingqing was scared out of her wits. She turned the other way, and her face lost all color.","Mrs. Tao shook her head in resignation.","Meanwhile, on the street.","Emperor Wu was outside when he saw the words.","“Jun Linyuan the sovereign descends to the world and Feng Wu the phoenix soars above the land?”","Emperor Wu stood in the busy street and looked at the central square from afar. He narrowed his eyes when he read the words.","Gao and Qin Yan looked at each other in astonishment.","“TIL look into it,” said Qin Yan.","Emperor Wu smiled a little. “Of course it has to be that boy. Who else is bold enough to say such a thing?”","“The sovereign descends to the world? He just can’t wait to take the throne, can he?” thought Emperor Wu.","Neither Gao nor Qin Yan dared to utter a word.","However, the fury they expected never came. Emperor Wu said quietly, “Jun Linyuan the sovereign descends to the world and Feng Wu the phoenix soars above the land. That’s quite a match! What a clever boy!”","That settled everything.","Gao and Qin Yan’s clothes were soaked in sweat.","“I thought he had abandoned Xiao Wu, but here he is, planning something big. My dear son is so smart, isn’t he?”","No one answered.","When he turned around to see the two scared subordinates, he snapped, “Grow some balls!”","Emperor Wu had been furious when he first saw the words.","“Jun Linyuan, are you going to usurp the throne now?”","But then, he remembered something.","Before his father abdicated, he had summoned Emperor Wu to the study and told him something.","“The throne was meant for your younger brother because he’s better than you.”","Emperor Wu worshiped his wise father, and that comment almost broke him.","However, there was a “but.”","“But you have an excellent son, so you’re going to guard the throne for him for 20 years. After that, it’ll be his.”","Emperor Wu was overwhelmed by all the information.","“Father, I promise you that I’ll pass the throne to Jun Linyuan!”","‘The old man gave him a long look and said indifferently, “If he wants it.”","‘The young Emperor Wu almost cried.","He and his brother had fought tooth and nail for the throne, but what did his father say?","Seeing that he was upset, his father patted him on the shoulder. “It’s a family tradition. We only get a genius every other generation. Your generation just isn’t lucky enough..”"]},{"number":2446,"title":"Chapter 2446 - His Majesty the Onlooker","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Emperor Wu realized that both his father and son were geniuses, making him the only idiot in between.","He almost wanted to cry.","That was why he had indulged Jun Linyuan all these years. He was only holding the throne for him.","What a sad story. Emperor Wu waved off the old memories. At least his son was indeed a genius, proving his own wise father correct.","“Keep moving!” He glanced at Gao and Qin Yan.","Everyone had gathered in the central square.","It was almost impossible for Emperor Wu to get through. Of course, if Qin Yan were to force his way in, no one would be able to stop them.","But Emperor Wu wouldn’t let him.","“It’s New Year’s Eve. Let them enjoy tonight,” said Emperor Wu.","A young man saw them and asked curiously, “Are you here for the lucky draw as well?”","Emperor Wu asked, “What lucky draw?”","The young man known as Chen said excitedly, “Don’t you know? Northern Feng Mansion is giving out gifts today! Join the queue!”","Qin Yan wanted to punish the man for talking to the emperor that way, but Chen had already dragged Emperor Wu into the queue.","Seeing that the emperor was glad to join the game, Qin Yan didn’t object. He and Gao stayed right next to Emperor Wu on either side, protecting the most important figure of the empire.","Chen had no idea that he had narrowly escaped death.","“I guess you have no idea that it’s the birthdays of two people today,” said Chen. “One is the sacred lady of Firmament Palace, and the other is the useless daughter of the Feng family.”","Emperor Wu said, “You’re quite well-informed, aren’t you?”","Chen said, “Of course! I subscribe to Capital Gossip, and it has everything! By the way, do you know who Miss Qingluan and Miss Feng Wu are?”","Emperor Wu wanted to say no, but seeing how talkative the young man was, he nodded. “I’ve heard those names.”","Chen said, “In that case, I won’t go into detail. In short, they have the same birthday and are competing for the same man — our crown prince. How exciting is that?!","“Everyone thought that His Royal Highness would be celebrating Miss Qingluan’s birthday, but as it turns out, he did something else! Do you know what he did?”","Emperor Wu pointed at the words in the sky that hadn’t dissipated yet.","Chen said, “That’s right! It sounds like they’re perfect for each other, doesn’t it? I’ve been their supporter from the very beginning!”","Emperor Wu wanted to laugh, but he only nodded and listened to the young man.","Chen said, “That is to say, these gifts are from His Royal Highness! They’re his way to express his feelings for Miss Feng Wu! Isn’t it exciting?!”","Emperor Wu said, “Yes, of course.”","Chen said, “His Royal Highness is so generous! The total value of these gifts is 100 million coins! I don’t think there’s that much cash in His Majesty’s treasury!”"]},{"number":2447,"title":"Chapter 2447 - His Majesty and Two Bags of Rice","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Emperor Wu glanced at Chen.","‘The young man had no idea how close he was to death. He told Emperor Wu, “Enough chit-chat. Here’s how you play: They’re giving out ten rounds of gift envelopes at 15-minute intervals.","“All envelopes contain vouchers, and they represent various gifts. Some can be exchanged for silver and gold coins, and others can give you spiritual stones, condiments, and food! You can cash them in right here and take everything home with you.","“Do you know what’s the most important prize?”","Emperor Wu asked, “What is it?”","“It’s a collection of eight words!” Chen said excitedly. “On the back of each voucher, there’s a word. There are eight different words in total, and if you can find all eight of them, you can exchange them for 999 silver coins!”","Emperor Wu said, “That’s a lot.”","“You don’t say! His Royal Highness is so generous. When that Miss Qingluan gave out gift envelopes, her prizes were so petty. His Royal Highness’s gifts are 100 times better!","“Back then, some people said that Miss Feng Wu competed for the house which Miss Zuo was giving out as a gift. What were they thinking? She can receive much better gifts from His Royal Highness!”","Emperor Wu was baffled.","He looked over his shoulder at Gao and wondered when public opinion had changed. Zuo Qingluan had seemed much more popular than Feng Wu before.","Gao was equally confused.","Emperor Wu asked, “You think very highly of Feng Wu, don’t you?”","Chen said, “I’m not the only one. Look, Prince Yu of the Dark Court set off fireworks to express his love for Miss Feng Wu, which goes to show how amazing she is. She’s only 14, but she’s already a Level 6 Spiritual Lord!”","Emperor Wu smiled proudly. He knew that Feng Wu’s level was even higher than that.","“Plus, Miss Feng Wu is so pretty. I wonder how beautiful her mother has to be.”","Emperor Wu wanted to announce that he had met her mother in person.","“Twas so mad when I saw Prince Yu’s fireworks. Luckily, His Royal Highness’s are much better, and they outshine Prince Yu’s!”","Emperor Wu wondered if this could count as some sort of patriotism.","Emperor Wu started gathering gift envelopes and tried to find all eight words. However, he just wasn’t lucky enough.","Chen had much better luck. He soon found all eight words, cashed them in for 999 silver coins, and went back home.","In the end, Emperor Wu only received two bags of rice.","He had Qin Yan carry them for him, and it was quite a funny picture.","Emperor Wu laughed when he saw the look on Qin Yan’s face.","“Your Majesty, are we really going back with the rice?” Gao asked in bewilderment.","“Going back? Not yet! We’re going to the Feng family!” Emperor Wu marched off.","‘The Feng clan.","Fallen Star Yard.","Everyone was baffled when they saw the lines in the sky.","Apart from Feng Xun and his two friends.","“What’s that supposed to mean?” Elder Jing couldn’t believe his eyes. “Who did it? Are they trying to get Xiao Wu killed?!”","Feng Xun said, “Elder Jing, why do you say that? I would never harm my own sister!”","Elder Jing said, “So, you’re the culprit! Have you lost your mind?!”","Feng Xun asked, ‘Why do you say that?”"]},{"number":2448,"title":"Chapter 2448 - Do You Not Know?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xum asked, “Why do you say that?!”","Elder Jing pointed at the sky with a shaking finger. “Can you read? You can’t use such expressions freely! You’re going to get Xiao Wu killed!”","Elder Grain was equally angry and wanted to slap Feng Xun.","“Hey! Not my face!”","Feng Xun took off when he saw that the two elders were coming after him.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu didn’t know how she should react.","She looked up at the sky, where the words were still twinkling.","‘Jun Linyuan the sovereign descends to the world and Feng Wu the phoenix soars above the land.”","That was a very ambitious statement.","Feng Wu couldn’t begin to describe her feelings.","She was angry, excited, proud, and abashed at the same time.","The feelings almost overwhelmed her.","She took a deep breath to clear her mind and wouldn’t let herself be carried away by her emotions.","She decided that Feng Xun had to be the culprit and that he was trying to make fun of her and the crown prince like he used to.","At that thought, she threw a dirty look at Feng Xun.","She would get back at him later!","Meanwhile, Feng Xun was running away from the two elders as he shouted, “Don’t hit me! I didn’t come up with those lines! It was J—”","He was about to say the name, when a steamed bun flew into his mouth, shutting him up.","“You’re all here.”","They were still chasing and shouting when they heard the voice. Everyone looked up and saw Emperor Wu standing in the doorway.","Qin Yan and Gao were with him as usual. It was just that...","There were two bags of rice in Qin Yan’s hands, which was an unusual scene.","“Your Majesty? To what do we owe this honor?’ Feng Wu was genuinely surprised to see Emperor Wu, but she reacted quickly and greeted him.","Emperor Wu waved at her. “I’m just taking a walk. I heard all the noise and thought I should take a look. I had no idea that it’s your house.”","Feng Wu wanted to roll her eyes at him.","Liar!","With the defense formation she had set up, people outside wouldn’t be able to hear any noise in the courtyard.","But since the emperor had spoken, she decided to take his word for it.","However —","She was baffled when Qin Yan handed her the rice. “Your Majesty, what’s this about?”","Everyone looked from Emperor Wu to the rice and was confused.","Ahem...","Emperor Wu cleared his throat and said with a smile, “Someone was giving out gift envelopes on my way here, and I was lucky enough to receive the rice as a gift. I guess it’s a blessing from above, awarding me for feeding all the people of the empire. It’s quite meaningful, so I thought I could give it to you as","a birthday present. Kiddo, aren’t you happy?”","‘What else could Feng Wu say?","She smiled. “Thank you, Your Majesty.”","Emperor Wu said, “Don’t mention it.”","Feng Wu asked, “But who would give out gift envelopes at this late hour?”","Emperor Wu gave her a strange look.","Feng Wu looked back at him in confusion.","Emperor Wu looked from Jun Linyuan to Feng Wu and asked, “You mean you don’t know..”"]},{"number":2449,"title":"Chapter 2449 - Who Wrote Them?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu was confused. “What should I know?”","Emperor Wu said, “The lucky draw.”","Feng Wu asked, “What lucky draw?”","Emperor Wu pointed at the rice. “The lucky draw that’s being carried out in your name. And do you see the lines in the sky?”","Feng Wu nodded.","Emperor Wu lowered his voice. “All the envelopes contain a word, and there are eight in total that say together, ‘Jun Linyuan the sovereign, Feng Wu the true phoenix.’ If one collects all eight, they can exchange them for 999 silver coins! I tried to find them all but failed. What a shame.”","Feng Wu said, “Did you say ‘collect all eight words’?”","Emperor Wu nodded.","Feng Wu glared at Feng Xun!","So, that was what it was about!","Feng Xun felt a chill run down his spine. He moved closer and grinned at Feng Wu. “Xiao Wu, are you mad?”","Feng Wu glared at him. “You’re making fun of me!”","Feng Xun grew anxious.","Boss Jun would kick his ass if he heard that!","Feng Xun immediately said, “I would never do that! Why would I do such a thing?!”","Feng Wu said, “Never? What words did I give you when you came to me for ideas? I never said any of that!”","Feng Xun said, “The envelopes are for a birthday celebration! What words did you give me? Patriotic and diligent? They just don’t suit the mood!”","Feng Wu said, “I thought His Majesty was giving out gift envelopes on New Year’s Eve!”","Emperor Wu was perplexed.","Feng Xun said, “How could it be His Majesty? They’re for celebrating your birthday!”","Feng Wu said, “But you didn’t tell me what you were going to use!”","If she had known, she would never have let Feng Xun use those words.","Yes, Zuo Qingluan would be furious when she saw it and might acknowledge that Jun Linyuan was in love with Feng Wu. That way, she would be able to finish the eleventh trial. However, it would also mean that Feng Wu herself was admitting to her relationship with Jun Linyuan.","“The entire imperial capital will think that there’s something going on between me and His Royal Highness! You...” Feng Wu told the two elders, “Do whatever you want with him!”","Elder Jing and Elder Grain were already chasing Feng Xun. Upon hearing what Feng Wu said, however, they both stopped.","Elder Jing asked Feng Wu, “Aren’t you still engaged? What’s wrong with letting people know about it?”","It would be very wrong!","Feng Wu glared at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun didn’t know what to do.","It wasn’t his fault!","The crown prince hadn’t liked the words Feng Wu suggested, so he wrote those words himself!","He was so pleased with what he came up with that he couldn’t stop smiling.","Feng Xun hated to admit that it was a very foolish smile.","He had never seen Jun Linyuan smile like that.","Feng Wu grabbed Feng Xun. “Did you write those words?”","Feng Xun said, “Of course not! Do you think I have such excellent handwriting?”","Feng Wu said, “Who wrote them, then?”"]},{"number":2450,"title":"Chapter 2450 - Arrest","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun said, “It wasn’t me!”","He knew that Boss Jun would kill him if he told the truth.","Emperor Wu shook his head when he heard the bickering. He then looked around the courtyard, as if he was searching for someone.","Soon, he found the person he was looking for.","He was astonished. Lady Ling was even more beautiful than he remembered.","Just then, they heard footsteps outside.","It sounded like a trained army.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","Thump! Thump! Thump!","Someone pounded on the front gate.","Emperor Wu frowned. He barely had time to look at his goddess. How dare these people disturb him?","The knocking went on and became louder.","Someone shouted, “Open up! Surround Fallen Star Yard!”","Who was that?","Everyone was perplexed.","Feng Wu said, “Wait here. I’ll have a look.”","Feng Wu opened the gate and saw hundreds of people outside. Their armor shone coldly in the torchlight.","Two men led the team. One of them was dressed like a general and had a fierce look in his eyes.","He stared at Feng Wu the moment she opened the door. It was obvious that she was his target.","‘An unwelcome guest.","Feng Wu frowned and looked at Feng Yanfeng, who was standing next to the general.","He had hidden away in his own house ever since the incident with Lady Gu, but he couldn’t do that anymore.","He had no idea what visitors Fallen Star Yard had at the moment. He stared at Feng Wu and said, “How could you do such a thing?!”","Feng Wu had no intention of letting them in.","Even when she saw all the heavily-armed soldiers, she remained perfectly calm.","She sighed in resignation when she said to Feng Yanfeng, “Today is New Year’s Eve and my birthday. Can’t you let me have a peaceful evening? What’s this all about?”","Feng Yanfeng gloated at Feng Wu’s predicament.","He said in an authoritative tone, “Xiao Wu, you’ve done the most unspeakable thing. Even I can’t protect you now. I’m so disappointed in you.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Before she could say anything, the general spoke. “Feng Wu, you’re suspected of usurping the throne. I’m going to arrest you now. If you resist, I’m going to kill you!”","Usurping the throne?","Feng Wu wanted to laugh. Why would she want the throne?","She said, “And you are?”","Feng Yanfeng said, “This is General Dugu Menghai, the heir to the Dugu family and the vice-captain of the imperial guards.”","Feng Wu said, “I see. Vice-captain Dugu, is it?”","Dugu Menghai’s face darkened."]},{"number":2451,"title":"Chapter 2451 - Elder Grain Said So","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Most people would omit the “vice” when they addressed him.","Feng Wu smiled at him. “Vice-captain. How impressive. I’m so scared.”","She thought, “Your captain is holding bags of rice in my yard. Would you like to meet him?”","If Dugu Menghai could read her mind, he would have fled the scene.","But he couldn’t, so he remained very arrogant.","“Take her down!” Although Dugu Menghai was amazed by how pretty Feng Wu was, he didn’t feel anything for her because to him, power was the most important thing.","“Wait,” Feng Yanfeng interjected.","He then turned to stare at Feng Wu. “Xiao Wu, if you still care about your family, sign this.”","Feng Wu glanced at the paper. “What’s that?”","Feng Yanfeng said, “It’s an agreement saying that you’ll leave the clan for good.”","Feng Wu said, “What agreement?”","Feng Yanfeng gestured at Dugu Menghai, asking him to wait a moment. He then walked up to Feng Wu and said, “Xiao Wu, your crime is unforgivable. You’re trying to usurp the throne! The Feng clan has lived peacefully for generations, and I can’t let you bring everyone down with you. If you still have","any conscience at all, you should give everyone a chance.”","Feng Wu looked from the paper to Feng Yanfeng and smiled. “So, you want me to voluntarily sign this agreement. If anything goes wrong in the future, you won’t need to take any responsibility. Is that right?”","Feng Yanfeng said, “Xiao Wu, stop stalling and sign it!”","Feng Wu asked, “Removing a member from the clan is a major decision. Have you asked the elders yet?”","Feng Yanfeng hadn’t because everything had happened too suddenly and he didn’t have the time.","He decided that Feng Wu would never get to talk to the three elders, and she would have to take his word for it.","He feigned a sympathetic tone. “Xiao Wu, there’s no hope left for you. All the elders agree with me, and Elder Grain even said...”","Feng Wu fought back her laughter and said with a straight face, “What did Elder Grain say?”","Feng Yanfeng said, “Elder Grain called you a disloyal and immoral member of the clan. You’ll only destroy us if you stay here. And there’s more.”","Feng Wu glanced in the direction of the yard and smiled a little. “What else?”","Feng Yanfeng sighed. “Elder Grain said that we should have kicked you out five years ago. He said that keeping you here was the biggest mistake he ever made.”","Feng Wu said, “Is that so? Did Elder Grain really say that? You’re not making it up, are you?”","Feng Yanfeng glared at Feng Wu.. “Elder Grain said so himself! Feng Wu, stop stalling and sign it! From now on, you’ll have nothing to do with the Feng clan!”"]},{"number":2452,"title":"Chapter 2452 - Face-slapping (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Just then, a person charged out of Fallen Star Yard and kicked Feng Yanfeng in the stomach.","What a forceful kick!","Feng Yanfeng immediately flew backward.","Behind him was a team of soldiers.","Soldiers with shiny armor and steel blades!","Therefore —","‘When Feng Yanfeng flew backward.","The soldiers behind him fell like dominoes.","‘They ended up piling on top of one another, and Feng Yanfeng landed on top of that little “hill.”","‘The impact cleared a path wide enough for five people to walk shoulder-to-shoulder.","The soldiers were all baffled by the sudden turn of events. They all stared at the newcomer.","Next to Feng Wu was a powerful old man.","He was shouting angrily.","He charged at Feng Yanfeng, lifted him off the ground, and bellowed, “What did you just say? Keeping Feng Wu is my biggest regret? I agreed to kick Feng Wu out?!”","Feng Yanfeng was utterly confused when he was kicked away, but when he saw Elder Grain, he was astonished.","“Elder Grain?!” He didn’t know what to say.","‘The old man was the last person he expected to see here.","Elder Grain punched him in the stomach. “Tell me! When did I agree to kick Feng Wu out?!”","Feng Yanfeng was so embarrassed. If the ground could open up right now, he would hide in it.","Seeing that Elder Grain was going to hit him again, Feng Yanfeng surrendered. “No! You didn’t say any of that!”","“Hmph!” Elder Grain threw Feng Yanfeng to the ground, still looking annoyed.","Feng Wu crossed her arms and smiled at Feng Yanfeng. “You just said that Elder Grain wants to kick me out, but now you’re saying that he didn’t say it. Uncle, which is it?”","Feng Yanfeng was so embarrassed and wished that he could run back home.","But as the head of the Feng clan, he couldn’t do that.","No one came to help him, so he had to struggle to his feet.","He didn’t have time to respond to Feng Wu’s mocking. Right now, he had to focus on appeasing Elder Grain.","“Elder Grain, didn’t you say you want to kick Feng Wu out? I got carried away, and that was why I said those things without asking for your permission first...”","Elder Grain shouted, “When did I say that? I didn’t!”","Feng Yanfeng cringed, but he answered, “You said so yourself when I returned from the grassland...”","Elder Grain was embarrassed.","Back then, he didn’t know Feng Wu and was indifferent to the suggestion of kicking her out, but that was a long time ago!","He glared at Feng Yanfeng. “That was a long time ago! Things have changed!”","Feng Yanfeng wanted to cry. It was less than a month ago.."]},{"number":2453,"title":"Chapter 2453 - Face-slapping (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Elder Grain, why are you here?” Feng Yanfeng asked gingerly.","Elder Grain bellowed at him, “Feng Yanfeng, you’re heartless! Do you know what day it is today? It’s Xiao Wu’s birthday! You left her alone in her courtyard. Is that what an uncle is supposed to do? Why am I here? I’m celebrating her birthday!”","Feng Yanfeng didn’t even dare to wipe off the spit that was on his face.","He was scared out of his wits when he heard what Elder Grain said.","If he was celebrating Feng Wu’s birthday, that meant that he had to be very close to Feng Wu.","“That’s right. We’re here for Xiao Wu’s birthday.” Elder Jing came out and stood next to Elder Grain.","Elder Jing?!","Feng Yanfeng’s pupils contracted.","Elder Grain was known for his mood swings and wasn’t exactly a reliable character. Elder Jing, on the other hand, was very level-headed.","Feng Yanfeng’s heart sank when he heard what Elder Jing said.","Dugu Menghai glanced at Feng Yanfeng.","Their plan was to get Feng Wu to sign the agreement. After that, he would arrest her and put her in jail. Once there, she would soon be executed.","But now, the two elders were involved","Dugu Menghai nodded to them and briefly showed them his token. “I’m sorry to have ruined your evening, but Feng Wu has committed a serious crime, and I have to take her away. Now —”","“Oh my, listen to that authoritative tone. So it’s you, Vice-captain Dugu.” Feng Xun walked out with a grin on his face.","Feng Xun?!","Dugu Menghai frowned.","Feng Xun was the young lord of Northern Feng Mansion. Despite his prestigious status, he didn’t have much actual power. Therefore, Dugu Menghai didn’t feel intimidated.","What worried him was Feng Xun’s friend, Jun Linyuan.","If he was here, would Jun Linyuan be inside as well?","No. Dugu Menghai shook his head. If the crown prince really was visiting someone, it had to be Zuo Qingluan. Why would he be here in Fallen Star Yard?","Therefore, he said matter-of-factly, “Young Lord Feng, Feng Wu’s crime is punishable by death, and that’s beyond you! Please move aside!”","Feng Xun smiled. “What crime is it? Tell me about it. Otherwise, I won’t let you leave even if you want to.”","Dugu Menghai said, “Feng Xun, are you obstructing official business now?!”","Feng Xun cupped his fists to show respect to the authority Dugu Menghai represented before he said, “‘m the most loyal member of the court, why would I do such a thing? The problem is, I think you’re abusing your power for personal gain!”","Dugu Menghai glared at Feng Xun.. “The Zuo family is looking everywhere for you! You should be at their party now!”"]},{"number":2454,"title":"Chapter 2454 - Face-slapping (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun laughed. “Why should I go? Just because they invited me?”","Dugu Menghai said, “Feng Xun, are you going to support Feng Wu, then?”","Feng Xun said, “You’re not taking her anywhere unless you give me a reason I can accept.”","Dugu Menghai knew that he had to do something to persuade Feng Xun.","He pointed at the lines in the sky. “Do you see that?”","Feng Xun said, “Yes. So what?”","Dugu Menghai said, “So what?! Do you know what it means?!”","Feng Xun said, “What does it mean?”","Dugu Menghai shouted, “Stop playing dumb! Those words are proof that Feng Wu wants to usurp the throne! I can understand that Feng Wu wants to be connected to His Royal Highness. All girls do.","“But ‘the sovereign’ and ‘the land’? She’s slandering His Royal Highness! How dare you try to protect her! Do you have a death wish?!”","Feng Xun rolled his eyes. “Dugu Menghai, who told you that Feng Wu set off those fireworks?”","Dugu Menghai snorted. “We caught the suspect and he admitted that Feng Wu is the mastermind behind the fireworks. She can’t deny it!”","“Proof? Suspect?” Feng Xun wanted to laugh.","How ridiculous.","Feng Wu had no idea that they were going to celebrate her birthday today. She didn’t know anything about their plan.","But this man was saying that he had some sort of proof and wanted to arrest her.","It was preposterous!","Feng Xun felt so sorry for Feng Wu because he could only imagine how much she had gone through.","“Dugu Menghai, you’re dead.” He glared at Dugu Menghai.","Dugu Menghai smirked. “You don’t know what you’re talking about. Feng Xun, you’re going down. The person who set off the fireworks is the steward of your family!”","‘The Dugu family had been trying to bring down Northern Feng Mansion, but Northern Feng General was such an upright man that they never had the chance.","But right now, they felt that they had the perfect opportunity.","Even if they couldn’t destroy Northern Feng Mansion, taking down Feng Xun would be a great achievement as well.","But then, Dugu Menghai saw a man coming out of the courtyard.","‘The crown prince?!","Dugu Menghai couldn’t believe his eyes.","He was even more surprised than Feng Yanfeng was when he saw Elder Grain.","“Your Royal Highness? Why are you here? Aren’t you taking care of governmental affairs in your residence?!” All those people they sent to the crown prince’s residence had come back with the news saying that the crown prince was still busy.","But here he was.","Dugu Menghai’s eyes popped out.","He had a very bad feeling, and his heart sank."]},{"number":2455,"title":"Chapter 2455 - Face-slapping (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“No, this can’t be happening!”","Dugu Menghai wouldn’t give up his last bit of hope.","“Your Royal Highness, Feng Wu is slandering you. I’ve reported it to His Majesty, and she will be punished!” Dugu Menghai trembled under Jun Linyuan’s cold gaze.","He knew that he had to follow the crown prince’s order, so he used Emperor Wu as an excuse instead.","He would probably cry if he knew that Emperor Wu was right inside.","‘The energy Jun Linyuan gave off made everyone shiver.","He said in a decisive tone, “I wrote them.”","“What?” Dugu Menghai didn’t get it.","‘The crown prince smirked and repeated, “I wrote the lines. Do you have a problem with that?”","What?!","This time, Dugu Menghai finally understood.","And he wished that he hadn’t heard it.","Because the truth was too scary!","“Your Royal Highness, what do you mean? Did you remember incorrectly?” Dugu Menghai’s heart was racing.","He couldn’t believe his ears!","‘The crown prince had admitted that he was the one who had written the lines in the sky! Dugu Menghai wanted to cry.","‘The Dugu family and the Zuo family were close allies!","If Zuo Qingluan could marry the crown prince, the Dugu family would benefit from it as well, but he now discovered that the crown prince had come to see Feng Wu.","‘The Zuo family had invited members of all the influential families of the imperial capital tonight. Rumor was that the crown prince was so in love with Zuo Qingluan that he was going to announce their engagement tonight.","That love never existed!","Nor would there be an engagement!","‘The crown prince wouldn’t even set foot inside the Zuo family residence! He was here with Feng Wu!","Not only that, he also wrote those words to announce his feelings to the world!","He was in love with Feng Wu!","Feng Wu was their ultimate enemy!","Dugu Menghai glared at Feng Wu.","Meanwhile.","Feng Wu was dumbfounded.","Ever since Jun Linyuan said that he had written those words, her head stopped working.","A little Feng Wu ina pink dress laughed in her head. “I told you so! He’s fond of you!”","A little Feng Wu in a black dress shook her head. “No! It can’t be! It has to be a misunderstanding!”","Pink Feng Wu said, “If he’s not in love with you, why would he give in whenever you speak nicely to him?”","Black Feng Wu said, “Because... that’s just the way he is.”","Pink Feng Wu said, “If other people try to do the same thing, they’ll be kicked away before they get anywhere near him. You’re so dumb!”","Black Feng Wu covered her face. “I don’t believe you!”","While the two little girls fought in her head, Feng Wu remained dumbfounded.","She closed her eyes and decided to pretend that she hadn’t heard anything,"]},{"number":2456,"title":"Chapter 2456 - I Wrote Them","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, Dugu Menghai was determined to arrest Feng Wu.","He looked from Feng Wu to Jun Linyuan and came up with an idea.","‘They could accept that the crown prince was in love with Feng Wu, but he had to marry Zuo Qingluan. Therefore, Feng Wu had to be arrested. That way, she would be tamed and could only obey Zuo Qingluan’s orders in the future.","At that thought, Dugu Menghai summoned up his courage and looked Jun Linyuan in the eye. “Your Royal Highness, don’t you think what you wrote has crossed the line? The order came from His Majesty, so I must take Feng Wu with me!”","Hearing that those men were going to take Feng Wu away, the beautiful lady burst into tears. She wanted to go out and help her daughter.","It pained Emperor Wu to see Lady Ling like this, so he immediately said, “Just wait here. I’ll go.”","The beautiful lady looked at Emperor Wu with teary eyes. “Can you help us?”","‘That was all Emperor Wu needed to hear.","“Of course I can!”","Who could say no to such a beautiful woman?!","“It’ll only take a minute!” Emperor Wu turned around and marched off.","Gao didn’t know what to say.","His Majesty had never been so eager in front of any of his women.","Dugu Menghai couldn’t believe his eyes when he saw Emperor Wu","He was astonished.","His face lost all color.","And his head went blank.","Dugu Menghai froze on the spot, as if he was ina trance.","He stared at Emperor Wu and Qin Yan.","Captain Qin was his direct superior, and becoming the captain of the imperial guards was Dugu Menghai’s life goal!","“Why don’t I remember giving such an order?” Emperor Wu raised his eyebrows and asked in a casual tone.","He was feeling very protective at the moment because Lady Ling was watching. He wanted to show her that he was the most important man in this empire.","Dugu Menghai dropped to his knees. “Your Majesty! Why... why are you here...”","Emperor Wu said coldly, “Do I need to inform you where I go?”","Dugu Menghai shook his head, and his face was very pale. “No, no, I didn’t mean that. I was only trying to say...”","Emperor Wu smirked. “You’re only trying to say that I gave you the order to arrest Feng Wu, is that it?”","Dugu Menghai looked like he was going to pass out.","He knew that he had made the biggest mistake.","‘The imperial guards were in charge of guarding the capital city. If their vice-captain delivered a false order from the emperor, the entire army could be seen to have turned against the throne as well. Therefore, Dugu Menghai couldn’t afford to be considered a liar.","But now.","He had said such a thing when His Majesty was listening.","He had just delivered a false imperial edict.","Dugu Menghai didn’t think that the emperor would take Feng Wu’s side, but what he did was still unforgivable.","He had forgotten all about Zuo Qingluan and was overwhelmed by the fear of death.","He didn’t want to die.","“Your Majesty, it was all my fault! I shouldn’t have made up such an order! But those words still show Feng Wu’s intent to usurp the throne!”"]},{"number":2457,"title":"Chapter 2457 - Strange Mood In the Zuo Family","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Dugu Menghai decided that if he could prove that Feng Wu planned to usurp the throne, his crime wouldn’t be so severe.","However, Emperor Wu only smiled. “You don’t like what those lines say, do you?”","Dugu Menghai said, “Your Majesty, that proves she’s a usurper!”","Emperor Wu didn’t seem angry, but he suddenly kicked Dugu Menghai in the chest.","He was displeased when he saw that Dugu Menghai didn’t fly away.","He said grimly. “Usurper? Then I’ll be usurping my own throne! I wrote those words!”","Dugu Menghai was shocked.","So was everyone else.","Emperor Wu sneered at him then looked over his shoulder at Lady Ling.","Lady Ling was smiling now.","Emperor Wu was so happy that he smiled for a split second as well. Dugu Menghai couldn’t believe it.","His Majesty was smiling? He had to be seeing things!","However, when Emperor Wu turned around, he kicked Dugu Menghai again. “Your crime is punishable by death!","“Qin Yan!”","“Yes, Your Majesty.”","“Dismiss him from his post! He’ll never be employed as an officer ever again!” Emperor Wu said coldly.","“Yes.”","Emperor Wu stole a glance at Lady Ling.","She was frowning and seemed worried.","She was worried about her daughter because the crown prince was there, but she was only wearing a casual outfit and wasn’t behaving like a noble young lady.","But Emperor Wu took it as a sign that Lady Ling wasn’t satisfied with the punishment Dugu Menghai received, although Dugu Menghai had almost fainted.","Emperor Wu waved his hand. “Destroy his cultivation ability and break his legs. If the Dugu family dares to give him any help, they can go down with him!”","Qin Yan said, “Yes, Your Majesty.”","Gao almost felt sorry for Dugu Menghai.","One shouldn’t take lives on New Year’s Eve, so Emperor Wu gave him a punishment that was worse than death.","Dugu Menghai was dumbfounded.","He knew that he would be punished and possibly demoted, but his family would ensure that he got his job back. However, what was happening was beyond his expectations","“Your Majesty!”","Dugu Menghai wanted to beg for mercy, but Qin Yan hit him on the back of his neck, knocking him out.","Qin Yan dragged him away after that.","The 300 hundred guards whom Dugu Menghai had brought here were filled with terror as well.","Qin Yan took them away with him as well.","As for what he would do with them","He wouldn’t be much gentler than Qin Mo, the head of military intelligence.","‘What happened to Dugu Menghai was confidential information, and the Zuo family wasn’t notified.","They were still waiting for more information.","But the news never arrived.","No news was bad news. Zuo Qingluan’s heart began to sink.","The party had been going on for hours, and it would soon be midnight. The guests were already thinking of leaving.","But with the strange atmosphere in the manor, no one dared to bring it up.","Tao Qingging tugged at Mrs. Tao. “Mother, I’m sure that His Royal Highness isn’t coming. We can wait for news of Feng Wu back home.. How about we leave now?”"]},{"number":2458,"title":"Chapter 2458 - Humiliation","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Tao Qingqing couldn’t stand the suffocating atmosphere anymore.","Mrs. Tao still hesitated.","Just then, the servants whom the other families sent out to gather information came back to deliver the news.","WHAT?!","The fireworks at the central square were set off under the order of Young Lord Feng?!","Even Zuo Qingluan couldn’t deny the fact that Feng Xun and the crown prince were best buddies.","So","“Those words came from His Royal Highness?!”","“OMG! What’s that supposed to mean?!”","“Isn’t it obvious? His Royal Highness is telling everyone he’s in love with Feng Wu! Don’t you see? Feng Wu is the one His Royal Highness is going to marry!”","“Gosh! It can’t be! I don’t believe it!”","“That may not be the case. If His Royal Highness really is confessing his love for Feng Wu, why didn’t people of the crown prince’s residence set off the fireworks? Why was it Northern Feng Mansion?”","“Well, what does that mean?”","Hearing the conversation, Mrs. Dugu said, “It can’t have been His Royal Highness’s idea. I’m sure that it was Young Lord Feng’s own decision.”","But Tao Qingqing said, “But can those 100 million coins’ worth of gifts be from Young Lord Feng as well? Does he have that much money?”","Everyone fell silent.","Yes, Northern Feng Mansion could afford it, but Feng Xun was no fool. Why would he spend so much of his own money to show Feng Wu that the crown was in love with her?","Tao Qingging grinned. “That can be easily proven. If His Royal Highness didn’t give permission, no one would dare to use those words. You’ve been guessing that the fireworks are from Feng Wu or Young Lord Feng, but just wait until tomorrow. If Feng Wu and Feng Xun are both safe and sound tomorrow,","that means that His Royal Highness gave his consent. What’s more, His Royal Highness might even be the one who set off the fireworks. Do you agree with me?”","Tao Qingging didn’t really like Feng Wu, but she disliked Zuo Qingluan even more and would use every chance to annoy the sacred lady.","Zuo Qingluan stared coldly at Tao Qingging.","She had heard everything Tao Qingging said.","But because she was the sacred lady, she couldn’t be bothered to quarrel with an ant.","While she was staring at Tao Qingging, Tao Qingging stared back at her as well.","You don’t scare me! I’m from the Tao family, and I have amazing brothers! Bite me!","The temperature around Zuo Qingluan seemed to drop.","Mrs. Tao was speechless. She was here to make friends, not enemies. Seeing how things were turning out, she had to leave. “Mrs. Zuo, I’m so sorry, but we need to go to Wandering Temple early in the morning, so we should leave now.”","The mention of Wandering Temple reminded everyone of the important event of the new year.","Mrs. Dugu asked, “Did you get a place?”","Mrs. Tao said, “Yes, we were very lucky. We’re going to be the fifth to pray at the temple this year, and we can’t be late. See you later.”"]},{"number":2459,"title":"Chapter 2459 - Wandering Temple","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Mrs. Tao nodded at Mrs. Zuo.","Mrs. Zuo nodded back, her smile a little forced.","It was the perfect excuse, and no one could stop her.","Master Linghu of Wandering Temple was like a god to the people of the Junwu Empire.","Fora time, Master Linghu had lived in seclusion and wasn’t known to the public.","13 years ago, the empire came under attack. At a critical juncture, he single-handedly killed the head of the Dongsang Kingdom and stopped the enemy from advancing. He became the savior and protector of the empire.","It was said that he could see everything in the past and future. It was also rumored that he was the most advanced cultivator in the Junwu Empire.","And there was more.","People believed that if they were the first precant at Wandering Temple in the new year, Master Linghu would give them an object personally blessed by him, and the person would be lucky for the whole year.","Therefore, people fought head over heels for that opportunity every year.","The Zuo family was no exception.","Mrs. Zuo had visited Wandering Temple countless times; she thought that if Zuo Qingluan could become the first precant, that would mean that she had been acknowledged by Master Linghu.","With that, she would be even more likely to marry the crown prince.","But she never succeeded.","She spent a small fortune on donations to the temple, but the abbot told her that the first precant was always chosen by Master Linghu himself. It could be anybody.","From second place onward, the sequence was decided by the amount of donations given. With what Mrs. Zuo had spent, she would have taken eighth place.","Mrs. Zuo stormed off. Eighth just wasn’t good enough.","But that place was soon filled. When Mrs. Zuo regretted her decision and went back, she was already out of the competition.","Mrs Zuo didn’t know what to say.","“The good luck of the first precant is real,” old Mrs. Gongsun said. “My grandson had back luck for years, but then, he was chosen. After that, he became very smart, and is already in the top 3 in his class!”","She was talking about Gongsu Jia, who was indeed an impressive teenager. However, it was the first time people heard of the story behind it.","“I think that position belongs to Her Majesty the empress dowager this year. Her Majesty has been talking about it for a long time.”","Because of the change in subject, the atmosphere didn’t feel so awkward anymore.","Zuo Qingluan went back to her Phoenix Yard.","She knew that people had tried to change the subject to ease the tension, but she could see the pity in their eyes.","“Tm the sacred lady! I don’t need pity!”","Zuo Qingluan gritted her teeth and hated Feng Wu even more.","Meanwhile, in Fallen Star Yard.","After taking care of Dugu Menghai, Feng Wu was ready to ask everyone to leave because it was time for her mother’s beauty sleep.","But there was a tap on the door.","Everyone was alarmed.. More unexpected guests?"]},{"number":2460,"title":"Chapter 2460 - Who’s Master Linghu?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiuling opened the door to find a smiling young monk outside.","Feng Xun cried out, “Aren’t you the little monk from Wandering Temple?!”","He knew the monk well.","‘Whenever he went to Wandering Temple with Jun Linyuan, he never had the chance to meet Master Linghu. Every time, this little monk would take him to the gatehouse and force him to practice his cultivation there.","It was one of Feng Xun’s most painful memories.","“Yuanbao.” Feng Xun rubbed the monk’s smooth head. “I thought you never left the mountain. What are you doing here?”","Wandering Temple?","Feng Yanfeng, who had been lying forgotten in a corner, was shocked by the name.","‘Was it THE Wandering Temple?","There was too much information for Feng Yanfeng to digest.","The two elders were on Feng Wu’s side, then there was the crown prince and even the emperor himself. What was going on?","He had been about to pass out when the monk of Wandering Temple arrived.","Master Linghu was about as famous as Emperor Wu and Jun Linyuan. Was he involved as well?","The little monk greeted Feng Wu. “Miss Feng Wu, my master wants to invite you to visit our temple.”","“Master Linghu?” Feng Wu still held a grudge against that old monk. “What does he want?”","Yuanbao grinned. “My master wonders if you’re interested in being the first precant.”","Feng Wu wasn’t. She was more interested in smacking Master Linghu on the head.","Had it not been for him, she wouldn’t have to go through the 12 trials and fawn on Jun Linyuan!","At that thought, she shook her head. “No!”","Elder Jing and Elder Grain were equally shocked.","Although they had read information on what Feng Wu had done after she returned from Northern Border City, it was never mentioned that she was acquainted with Master Linghu.","But it was such a sweet deal.","Elder Jing pulled Feng Wu to the side, and Elder Grain smiled at Yuanbao. “Of course she’s interested!”","He then gave Feng Wu a warning glance.","“Silly girl, that’s Master Linghu! What are you thinking?!”","Feng Wu didn’t think much of it. She rolled her eyes at Elder Grain. “That old trickster will only set me up! Become the first precant? He’s only trying to trick me again!”","Emperor Wu opened his mouth but didn’t know what to say.","The empress dowager had wanted to be the first precant. She went to see Master Linghu but was sent back without meeting the old man. She had wept in her palace, and Emperor Wu had offered to talk to the master himself.","He did see Master Linghu after that, but the old monk only said no.","Emperor Wu knew Master Linghu’s true identity.","Because of that, he felt so strange when he heard Feng Wu call him an old trickster.","He stared at Feng Wu.."]},{"number":2461,"title":"Chapter 2461 - Emperor Wu’s Impression of Feng Wu","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Of course you should go. Why waste such a great opportunity?” Emperor Wu glanced at Feng Wu. “You have no idea how precious it is. People would kill for it.”","Hearing what Emperor Wu said, Feng Wu had to say yes, but she didn’t look very happy.","Emperor Wu was annoyed.","“Why are you so reluctant? Do you know how much people would pay for that opportunity? Even I...” No, I can’t let her know. She’ll laugh at me.","Emperor Wu felt so frustrated as he went back to the palace.","After some hesitation, he went to visit his mother.","His wives were there as well. At this hour, they were still keeping the empress dowager company. Everyone was chatting happily except for the old lady.","The consorts and Empress Dugu stood up to greet Emperor Wu.","Emperor Wu waved at them. “How lively. What are you talking about?”","Before Empress Dugu could answer, Concubine Oriole said, “Your Majesty, we were talking about the sacred lady of the Zuo family. Is she really that amazing?”","“The sacred lady? Zuo Qingluan, is it?” Emperor Wu knew more than his women and felt sorry for Zuo Qingluan.","With the gates locked, no one except for Emperor Wu could come into the palace, so the women here couldn’t get any information.","Concubine Oriole had the voice of a singing bird, and her smile reminded Emperor Wu of Lady Ling. Because of that, Emperor Wu had favored her.","Now that he had seen the real Lady Ling, however, Concubine Oriole didn’t seem that pretty anymore.","“Your Majesty, it’s the sacred lady’s birthday today. I heard that His Royal Highness was there as well!” Concubine Oriole didn’t sense the change in Emperor Wu’s mood. She held his arm and leaned toward him.","She heard that His Majesty didn’t like Feng Wu, so she thought that he would like it if the crown prince and Zuo Qingluan were a couple.","Before Emperor Wu could reply, Empress Dugu said, “I heard that as well.”","Of course, Empress Dugu would want Zuo Qingluan to marry Jun Linyuan. It would be like having an insider on Jun Linyuan’s team.","She heard? Emperor Wu and Gao exchanged glances.","Concubine Oriole smiled. “I think Miss Qingluan and His Royal Highness will make such a perfect couple. Don’t you think so, Your Majesty?”","Emperor Wu could tell that Concubine Oriole and Empress Dugu were a team.","He frowned. “Don’t you know that the crown prince is already engaged?”","‘Well.","Ever since the last time when Jun Linyuan talked about his engagement, the news had spread, but not many people believed it.","“Your Majesty, is Feng Wu really engaged to His Royal Highness?” Concubine Oriole asked the million-dollar question.","Hearing that, even the empress dowager was intrigued.","‘As for what Emperor Wu thought of Feng Wu.","Before, Feng Wu and Zuo Qingluan were pretty much the same to him.."]},{"number":2462,"title":"Chapter 2462 - Who Is the Most Blessed Child In the Empire?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Because of the invitation from Master Linghu tonight, Emperor Wu preferred Feng Wu a little more.","He was already leaning toward Feng Wu.","He hadn’t realized the change in his attitude, but.","“As for the engagement...” Emperor Wu put his hands behind his back and thought for a moment before he nodded. “It’s true. The engagement was never annulled.”","“We can’t have that!” Concubine Oriole almost jumped to her feet. “Your Majesty, we have to do something!”","‘The empress dowager glanced at her in approval, making a mental note to promote her when the time was right.","But Emperor Wu was displeased.","Nonetheless, he didn’t let it show.","“Is that so? Why can’t we have that?”","Concubine Oriole said, “Your Majesty, Miss Qingluan is the daughter of the Zuo family and the sacred lady of Firmament Palace. Apart from that, she’s also a very capable cultivator, not to mention that she has the True Phoenix Blood!","“Your Majesty, if His Royal Highness’s dragon bloodline is combined with the True Phoenix Blood, they’ll have such amazing children!","“In comparison, Feng Wu has nothing!","“Yes, she can cultivate again, but so what? Even if we can look past her cultivation level and personality, she still doesn’t have the True Phoenix Blood. Your Majesty, we have to cancel the engagement!”","Emperor Wu’s gaze turned cold.","“How much did the Zuo family pay you to speak up for them like that?” Emperor Wu’s face darkened.","“Your Majesty, I never... I meant every word I said!” Concubine Oriole dropped to her knees and trembled.","“That’s enough.” Finally, the empress dowager spoke.","She glanced at Emperor Wu. “Concubine Oriole only made a suggestion; there’s no need to shout at her.” She then had Emperor Wu sit down next to her.","“Junjun is old enough to get married and have children. As for who he should marry, it’s not up to us to decide,” the empress dowager said indifferently.","“Really? Who gets to make the decision, then?” Emperor Wu smiled at her.","‘The empress dowager said, “Fate.”","Emperor Wu asked, “How does that work?”","‘The empress dowager said, “Master Linghu will know. I’ve been trying to become the first precant of the year to ask him, but...”","Emperor Wu glanced at his mother.","If Master Linghu represented fate, then Zuo Qingluan had already lost.","Even as they were speaking, Feng Wu was on her way to see Master Linghu!","‘The empress dowager said, “Master Linghu said that he was going to keep that place for the most blessed child in the empire. I wonder who that is.”","Empress Dugu said, “Maybe it’s Qingluan.”","The empress dowager’s eyes lit up.. “Really?!”"]},{"number":2463,"title":"Chapter 2463 - He Wasn’t There?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Empress Dugu smiled. “When Qingluan came to see me earlier, she mentioned that she was going to Wandering Temple. So...”","‘The empress dowager’s eyes lit up. She grabbed Empress Dugu’s hand and said excitedly, “If that’s true, then she’s definitely the most blessed girl in the empire. Master Linghu is never wrong!”","Emperor Wu found their conversation idiotic.","He just didn’t get it. Why was Zuo Qingluan everywhere when they never saw her?","For instance, Jun Linyuan was at Fallen Star Yard tonight, but the rumor was that he was madly in love with Zuo Qingluan and would announce their engagement tonight. How unbelievable!","Also, Feng Wu was invited by Master Linghu to be the first precant of the year, but everyone was saying that Zuo Qingluan was the most blessed girl. Why?","It seemed that Zuo Qingluan had been very busy!","Emperor Wu had thought highly of Zuo Qingluan before because of her True Phoenix Blood and the fact that she was the sacred lady of Firmament Palace. Now, however, he had a different opinion of her.","He glanced at Gao.","Gao immediately took the hint. The emperor wanted to know where the rumors came from.","He wished Miss Zuo good luck.","While they were still chatting, Jun Wuxia came back.","She had been invited to Zuo Qingluan’s party tonight, and had taken a walk afterward. Only then did she come back in a bad mood.","She greeted Emperor Wu, Empress Dugu and the empress dowager, and was going to leave.","Empress Dugu adored her daughter, so when she saw that Jun Wuxia looked upset, she couldn’t help asking, “Xia, what’s wrong? Weren’t you at the birthday party? Did someone upset you? How was it? Did Jun Linyuan announce the engagement?”","“Mother!” Jun Wuxia didn’t want to be reminded of what happened. “It was such a humiliation!”","‘The empress dowager didn’t really like Jun Wuxia, but she frowned when she heard the complaint. “What happened? Did someone disrespect the crown prince at the party?”","All this time, Junjun was the only one she cared about.","Jun Wuxia said, “Who would dare do that? Obviously, it was my brother who did something.”","“Did His Royal Highness upset Miss Qingluan?” Concubine Oriole asked.","Everyone looked at Jun Wuxia expectantly.","Jun Wuxia said, “Yes! Miss Qingluan was so angry!”","‘The empress dowager’s heart sank.","Jun Wuxia said, “My brother was never there! No one knows where he was tonight! We searched everywhere, but we never found him!”","Emperor Wu wanted to tell them that he knew the answer.","Of course, he didn’t do that. For some reason, he was quite happy.","Concubine Oriole, Empress Dugu, and the empress dowager cried out in unison, “He wasn’t there?!”"]},{"number":2464,"title":"Chapter 2464 - Mrs. Chu","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jun Woxia said in frustration, “He wasn’t there! Nor was Feng Xun or Xuan Yi. It was like the three of them disappeared altogether!”","WHAT?!","Those words were like a thunderclap in everyone’s ears.","“His Royal Highness wasn’t there?!” Empress Dugu’s voice was the loudest.","She thought she had planned it out so well.","After Zuo Qingluan married Jun Linyuan and kept him under control, Jun Linshen would have a chance to","“I thought His Royal Highness is very fond of Qingluan. Was he too busy?” Empress Dugu asked Emperor Wu.","“Emperor Wu said, “He wasn’t. He finished work early, and I let him take his leave.”","“Then...” Empress Dugu didn’t know what to say.","They would still have an excuse if the crown prince was busy with state affairs, but now.","“His Royal Highness is very much in love with Qingluan, isn’t he? Maybe it’s a misunderstanding.” Empress Dugu forced a smile. “Maybe they’re having a lovers’ quarrel. It’s not something we should interfere with.”","‘The empress dowager wasn’t very pleased.","She preferred Zuo Qingluan over Feng Wu, but ever since Zuo Qingluan returned to the imperial capital, she had never visited the empress dowager to pay her respects. How arrogant.","Wandering Temple.","Mrs. Tao and Tao Qingging were waiting in a side room.","They were the fifth to go in and had to wait a bit longer.","The fourth was the wife of Chancellor Chu.","The Chu family had recently risen to power after Chancellor Chu took office.","Mrs. Chu was here today.","She was a regular visitor to the temple and had been among the first ten worshippers several years in a row.","Seeing that Mrs. Tao was getting anxious, she said, “It is indeed taking longer this year. Please don’t worry. It’ll be our turn soon.”","Mrs. Tal asked curiously, “Mrs. Chu, do you come here every year?”","Mrs. Chu glanced at her own daughter, who was wearing a mask, and nodded with a bitter smile. “Yes. I’m here every year for my daughter. She’s unable to live for so many years. I’m here every year to ask for a pill which can keep her alive for another year.”","The girl had been ill since she was born, and it was common knowledge in her circle, so Mrs. Chu didn’t try to keep it from Mrs. Tao.","Mrs. Tao gave her a sympathetic look. “I remember that Firmament Palace has some great doctors. Have you tried them?”","Mrs. Chu nodded. “We pulled quite a few strings and made contact with a governor of Firmament Palace. They sent a physician, but nothing changed afterward.”","Mrs. Tao said, “I don’t think ordinary physicians will do the trick. Miss Qingluan is back. She’s the sacred lady of the palace and the disciple of the current palace master. It’s said that she’s a great doctor!”","Mrs. Chu asked, “Really?”","Mrs. Tao said, “I was told so.”","Mrs. Chu said, “We were in a hurry to come here today, so we declined the invitation to Miss Qingluan’s birthday party. I hope she won’t mind. Now that she’s with His Royal Highness, she has become even more unapproachable. I’ll visit her tomorrow and apologize to her in person.”","Because of something which had happened before, Mrs. Chu didn’t like interacting with the Zuo family. If it wasn’t for her daughter, she would never visit them.","Mrs. Tao cleared her throat. “I wouldn’t recommend it. It’s a little complicated...”","Mrs. Chu asked, “What’s going on?”","Mrs. Tao told her what happened, and Mrs. Chu’s eyes widened. “Is that so?”"]},{"number":2465,"title":"Chapter 2465","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Mrs. Tao said, “Yes, that’s what happened. Zuo Qingluan and Feng Wu’s birthdays are on the same day, and they were both born with the True Phoenix Blood. What a coincidence. The Zuo family wanted to undermine Feng Wu, so they threw this big party and invited everyone important in the imperial","capital. In the end, however, the most anticipated guest didn’t show up.”","“Is she still trying to undermine Feng Wu? How...” Mrs. Chu was filled with anger.","Mrs. Tao was confused. “Is there something wrong?”","She found Mrs. Chu’s reaction strange.","Mrs. Chu shook her head at Mrs. Tao. She recalled what she saw five years ago while on her way here","But she stopped herself from going down memory lane.","She calmed down and said, “No, it’s nothing. What happened after that?”","Mrs. Tao then told Mrs. Chu about what happened in the imperial capital, including the matter with the gift envelopes.","“That was very considerate of His Royal Highness.” Mrs. Chu smiled. “They’re truly the perfect couple.”","Mrs. Tao found that statement strange. “But everyone knows that His Royal Highness and Zuo Qingluan make the perfect couple.”","Mrs. Chu said, “If one has a poor moral character, they’re not good for anything, no matter how precious their bloodline is or what an advanced cultivator they are.”","Mrs. Tao asked, “Mrs. Chu, are you saying that Zuo Qingluan has a poor moral character?”","‘The Chu family was newly risen to power, but the Zuo family had a long history and was well-connected. Despite not liking the family, Mrs. Chu wouldn’t offend such a colossus.","Before Mrs. Chu could respond, Tao Qingqing snorted and said, “That’s what Zuo Qingluan is like. If you ask me, I think all the talk about His Royal Highness being madly in love with her are rumors she created herself.”","“Watch your mouth!” Mrs. Tao shot a warning glance at Tao Qingqing.","Tao Qingging took a few steps away. “I’m telling the truth!”","She suddenly stopped and stared at someone in the distance.","“What’s wrong?” Mrs. Tao asked.","Tao Qingqing waved at her. “Come over here! Hurry!”","Mrs. Tao walked up to her.","“Mom, look!” Tao Qingqing pointed at someone ahead of them. “Doesn’t that look like Feng Wu?”","It was snowing, and they couldn’t see very clearly.","By the time Mrs. Tao went to her daughter’s side, that person had moved even further away from them, so she couldn’t make out who it was.","“Feng Wu? Why would she be here? You’re imagining things.” Mrs. Tao rubbed Tao Qingqing’s head and thought that her daughter had been obsessed with Feng Wu lately.","“It really was her! I saw her coming out of the bamboo grove!”","‘That was where Master Linghu lived.","Mrs. Tao jabbed Tao Qingqing’s forehead with a finger. “Why does everyone look like Feng Wu to you? Remember, we’re still on Zuo Qingluan’s side.”","Tao Qingqing was frustrated.","Just then, the abbot announced that the first worshipper had left, and the rest could enter the main hall in turn. They would each be given an object that had been blessed by Master Linghu.","Asa matter of fact, Tao Qingqing was right. The person she had seen was indeed Feng Wu.","Feng Wu suspected that the old monk had some connection to her beautiful master, so she asked him some questions.."]},{"number":2466,"title":"Chapter 2466 - I Won’t Admit It","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, Master Linghu wouldn’t answer any of her questions, which Feng Wu found very annoying.","Before she left, Master Linghu said, “Do you still have the jade pendant? If you run into any problems with officials that you can’t solve, show them the pendant. It may help you.”","Feng Wu said, “That won’t be necessary.”","Master Linghu smiled mysteriously, as if he could see through everything.","“No, you’ll need it.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Phoenix Yard at the Zuo family.","The furniture and decor had been replaced. If one didn’t know better, they wouldn’t know that the place had been smashed up yet again.","This time, Zuo Qingluan didn’t try to keep it a secret. Her parents also knew that she was furious.","But they were having a row in their own courtyard and didn’t have time to talk to Zuo Qingluan yet.","The maids were so frightened that they didn’t dare make a sound.","They couldn’t understand how a sacred lady could be so ferocious.","Tongque dismissed them all.","The maids couldn’t move fast enough, fearing that Miss Zuo would vent her rage on them.","After the door was closed, Tongque walked into the bedroom with a stack of files.","The room was lit up by the moonlight shining in through the window.","Half of Zuo Qingluan’s face was lit up, and the other half was in the dark. It was quite a disturbing image.","But Tongque wasn’t scared.","She whispered something in Zuo Qingluan’s ear.","“What?!”","Zuo Qingluan almost jumped to her feet.","“Are you sure?!” She grabbed Tongque’s arm.","She was so agitated that she broke Tongque’s arm with sheer force.","Sweat broke out on Tongque’s face at the pain, but she nodded and said calmly, “My lady, His Royal Highness did indeed go to Feng Wu’s Fallen Star Yard. The news came from Firmament Pavilion.","Zuo Qingluan found the people of the Zuo family incompetent, so she relied on Firmament Pavilion to collect information.","Tongque handed her a letter. “Our people saw it with their own eyes.”","Zuo Qingluan’s eyes turned red as she read the letter.","Feng Wu... Feng Wu","Jun Linyuan had gone to Fallen Star Yard. How.","Tongque studied Zuo Qingluan.","Before they left, the head of the palace had told her that the sacred lady was indeed a genius, and if she put her mind to her cultivation, she would have such a promising future.","Tongque wanted to tell Zuo Qingluan to open her eyes and admit that the crown prince was in love with Feng Wu.","And how did Firmament Pavilion get that information?","Feng Wu was the one who spread the news.","She wanted Zuo Qingluan to know that Jun Linyuan had been in Fallen Star Yard.","She needed Zuo Qingluan to admit that Jun Linyuan was fond of Feng Wu.","She was a little ashamed of what she did, but she told herself that she had to do it for the eleventh trial.","Feng Wu walked back and forth in her room and waited for the fairy to tell her that she had completed the task.","“No, it’s not happening!” Zuo Qingluan clenched her fists. “Unless I’m dead, I’ll never admit that he’s fond of her!”","Zuo Qingluan glared at Tongque.","Her eyes were so red that she looked like a mad person."]},{"number":2467,"title":"Chapter 2467 - Immortal Spiritual Fruit","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“L regret it so much!” Zuo Qingluan bit her lower lip and closed her eyes. “Why did I listen to my master and go traveling for a year? I shouldn’t have given Feng Wu that extra time!”","Otherwise, His Royal Highness would never have fallen for Feng Wu.","However, Zuo Qingluan managed to fight back her rage.","She gradually calmed down.","‘That quality made her a most formidable enemy for Feng Wu.","Tongque said, “Miss Qingluan, I discovered something about Feng Wu. I wonder if it’ll be of interest to you.”","Zuo Qingluan stared at her.","Tongque tensed up and said, “I think Feng Wu is too pretty, and her good looks can easily affect any man, so I looked into her past in Northern Border City and found something.”","Before, Zuo Qingluan wouldn’t even bother to know anything about Feng Wu, let alone what she did in Northern Border City.","But now, after all the humiliation she had received from Feng Wu, she knew that she couldn’t keep ignoring the girl anymore.","Therefore, Tongque’s information came just in time.","“Tell me more,” said Zuo Qingluan.","‘With a wave of her hand, Tongque summoned a man to the room. He knelt down in front of Zuo Qingluan.","Tongque said, “Shadow Three just came back from the northern border with some information.”","Zuo Qingluan stared at the man.","Shadow Three looked as if he was going to melt into the darkness.","He was a formidable assassin.","“Miss Qingluan.” Just like his figure, his voice also lacked any distinctive characteristics. He took out a letter and handed it to Zuo Qingluan.","Zuo Qingluan quickly read it.","Her eyes widened.","How was that possible?","She read the letter again.","This time, she made sure that she didn’t miss a word.","Feng Wu would jump to her feet if she saw the letter, because","It was talking about the incident with the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","About a year ago, Jun Linyuan and his friends went to Northern Border City to search for the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, which could keep Bao Er alive. However, disguised as an ugly girl, Feng Wu had snatched that fruit from them.","“I don’t believe it!”","Zuo Qingluan had never been so excited.","“Get Mu Yaoyao for me!”","Despite her great satisfaction, Zuo Qingluan remained level-headed. She needed Mu Yaoyao to tell her exactly what happened so that she could get things right and destroy Feng Wu once and for all.","‘Mu Yaoyao soon arrived.","Zuo Qingluan asked her about what happened in Northern Border City, and Mu Yaoyao told her everything.","“That ugly girl was as annoying as Feng Wu!” Mu Yaoyao clenched her fists in frustration.","Zuo Qingluan asked, “Do you think the two of them are similar somehow?”","“Wait!” Mu Yaoyao slapped her own lap. “Now that you’ve mentioned it, they do resemble each other! They’re both so cunning!","“Does Feng Wu have a sister?” Mu Yaoyao was confused.."]},{"number":2468,"title":"Chapter 2468 - Feng Wu and Her Masks","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Sister? Zuo Qingluan smirked.","It was Feng Wu herself!","Back then, when Zuo Qingluan considered Feng Wu to be a worthy enemy, she had learned everything about that girl.","Feng Wu could disguise herself as someone else!","And she was an expert at it!","After hearing what Mu Yaoyao said, Zuo Qingluan reached a conclusion: Feng Wu was the thief who had stolen the Immortal Spiritual Fruit from His Royal Highness!","Zuo Qingluan had never expected to discover something so useful.","“Miss Qingluan, that information...”","Zuo Qingluan smirked. “She humiliated me. I wouldn’t be me if I don’t get revenge!”","‘Tongque looked forward to seeing what happened next.","“Let’s go.” Zuo Qingluan rose to her feet.","Tongque followed her in a hurry. She wondered where they were going.","But she didn’t ask.","Zuo Qingluan headed for the Feng clan.","Meanwhile, in the Feng clan —","‘When Feng Wu turned around, she saw the two elders shouting at Feng Yanfeng. One was saying that he was going to destroy his cultivation ability, and the other one wanted to remove him from his position as the head of the clan.","Feng Yanfeng was scared out of his wits. He begged Feng Wu to spare his life, and promised that he would do everything in his power to repay her.","Of course he would be frightened. The two elders, Jun Linyuan, and Emperor Wu were all on Feng Wu’s side. No one would be able to handle such pressure.","Feng Wu said, “Let’s give him another chance. If he does anything to betray my trust again, we can cut him into little pieces.”","Feng Yanfeng said, “I won’t!”","As soon as he opened his mouth, Feng Wu threw a pink pill into his mouth.","By the time Feng Yanfeng realized it, he had swallowed the pill.","He had no idea what it was, but it melted in his mouth immediately, and there was no way to spit it out.","Feng Wu crouched down and grinned at Feng Yanfeng, who had dropped to the ground.","“know you don’t like me. I don’t like you either.","“Your promise means nothing to me. I only trust my own medicine.","“That’s a very effective pill. If you try anything funny again, no one will be able to save you.”","She then rose to her feet and said to the two elders, “He can be useful at times, so just let him keep his position a little longer. What do you think?”","Elder Jing and Elder Grain exchanged reluctant looks.","‘They wanted a new clan head, but they couldn’t find anyone suitable for the position.","Feng Yanfeng could keep his position, but from then on, he wouldn’t dare offend Feng Wu again.","Lady Wang greeted him when he went back to his courtyard. “My lord, did they arrest Feng Wu?”","Feng Yiran and Feng Sang were waiting for his answer as well.","Feng Yanfeng looked like he had lost the ability to think.","“My lord, did Feng Wu sign that agreement? We need to show it to Elder Grain...”","Feng Yanfeng couldn’t take it anymore. He slapped his wife.","He used so much force that she spun like a spinning top.."]},{"number":2469,"title":"Chapter 2469 - Since When Is His Majesty on Feng Wu’s Side?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lady Wang was dumbfounded. She had never thought that Feng Yanfeng would hit her.","“My lord!”","“Dad!”","“Father!”","Lady Wang, Feng Sang and Feng Yiran cried out at the same time.","Feng Yanfeng’s eyes were bloodshot.","How terrifying!","He looked from Feng Sang to Feng Yiran.","He then stared at Lady Wang.","He pointed at Lady Wang and shouted in a shaky voice, “You vile woman! How many times have I told you not to mess with Feng Wu? You just won’t listen! And you keep urging me on! You almost got me killed today!","“What did you say? ‘Is Feng Wu dead? She’s going to be around long after you’re dead!” Feng Yanfeng was furious.","He had knelt in front of the two elders and begged them to spare his life.","And Feng Wu had forced him to swallow that pill. If he did anything wrong, she could kill him in an instant.","Lady Wang burst into tears. “Liu, you died for nothing! Your father won’t avenge you...”","“That’s right! She died for nothing!” Feng Yanfeng said decisively.","When his life was threatened, he knew what he would choose.","“If anyone brings up this subject again, I’ll throw them out of this house!” Feng Yanfeng took a deep breath and stared at Lady Wang. “And you!","“Two elders are backing Feng Wu now! Who are they, you may ask? Elder Jing and Elder Grain!” Feng Yanfeng gritted his teeth.","Lady Wang didn’t know Elder Jing well, but Elder Grain.","“I thought Elder Grain was on our side. Plus, they’ve never interacted with Feng Wu before. How... My lord, is there a misunderstanding?” Lady Wang still wouldn’t believe it.","Feng Yanfeng was reminded of what happened in Fallen Star Yard, and he shouted at Lady Wang. “There’s no misunderstanding! Those two elders supposedly never leave the restricted area, but they were there to celebrate Feng Wu’s birthday tonight!”","“What?!!!” Lady Wang couldn’t believe her ears.","How could that be? Since when was Feng Wu so familiar with the two elders? Those two men were the most authoritative figures in the clan!","“I thought that having the support of the two elders was very impressive, but when I got to Fallen Star Yard.","“I found both His Royal Highness and His Majesty there.”","Feng Yanfeng had lost all hope at that moment.","He could understand His Royal Highness being there because the young prince had always favored Feng Wu, but Emperor Wu","The idea of the emperor hanging around a remote corner of the Feng clan’s manor was simply unrealistic.","What was going on.","Hearing what Feng Yanfeng said, Lady Wang couldn’t stop trembling,","Seriously?","This couldn’t be happening","“How? When did His Majesty become Feng Wu’s patron?!” Lady Wang was baffled.","“Twouldn’t have survived this night,” said Feng Yanfeng. Hearing that, Lady Wang turned ghastly pale.."]},{"number":2470,"title":"Chapter 2470 - He’s a Fickle Man","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Tm only standing here now because Feng Wu appealed to His Majesty for mercy on my behalf. I got to keep my life and my position as the head of the clan, but I’ve lost my official job.” Feng Yanfeng sounded crestfallen.","Lady Wang didn’t know what to say.","Feng Yanfeng waved his hand weakly. “Just remember not to offend Feng Wu ever again...”","He fainted after that and had a high fever.","Feng Wu didn’t know what happened in Feng Yanfeng’s family, nor did she care.","Someone stopped her on her way back to Fallen Star Yard.","A figure appeared on top of the pavilion.","In the silver moonlight, she looked like a fairy that was going to fly away in the wind.","Zuo Qingluan looked down at Feng Wu.","It was the first time she had studied Feng Wu so carefully after five years.","Although she hated to admit it, Zuo Qingluan acknowledged the fact that Feng Wu was a very beautiful girl and would only be even more beautiful in the future.","How unpleasant.","Zuo Qingluan stared at Feng Wu.","Even after everything that had happened, Zuo Qingluan was still arrogant.","She believed that Feng Wu wasn’t her equal.","To her, Feng Wu was just an ant.","Tension seemed to gather in the air, and a fight could start at any moment.","Zuo Qingluan spoke first. She sighed and glanced at Feng Wu.","“Inever thought that a pretty face would be so useful. I’ve underestimated your good looks.”","Feng Wu smiled calmly. “So, you’ve concluded that His Royal Highness came to my birthday celebration instead of going to yours because I’m prettier than you.”","Zuo Qingluan frowned. “Am I wrong?”","Feng Wu didn’t answer but asked a question. “Do you regret it?”","For not destroying her face five years ago.","Zuo Qingluan gave it some thought and nodded. “I do.”","Feng Wu smiled a little. “It’s not too late to do it now.”","Zuo Qingluan shook her head. “No, it’s too late.”","Feng Wu asked, “Why?”","Zuo Qingluan said, “He likes your face, so I can’t do anything to you before he gets tired of it. Otherwise, he’ll be angry. I can never make him upset.”","Feng Wu said, “So?”","Zuo Qingluan said, “So after he grows tired of you, you’ll lose your good looks. He’s a fickle man, you know.”","Feng Wu shook her head. “You can’t be any more wrong. His emotions run deep.”","Zuo Qingluan smirked and ignored her comment.","No one would have expected that the two archenemies could have a normal conversation.","After a pause of five minutes, Zuo Qingluan spoke again.","“You have three days.”","Feng Wu asked, “What?”","Zuo Qingluan said, “After three days, you and the other members of Fallen Star Yard should return to Northern Border City and never come back. Do that, and I’ll spare your life.”","Feng Wu said, “What if I won’t leave?”","Zuo Qingluan said, “Then you’ll regret your decision.”","Feng Wu didn’t like Zuo Qingluan’s condescending tone and made a mental note that one day, she would break that mask she wore.","She said, “You wouldn’t threaten me for nothing. Just tell me.. What do you think you have on me?”"]},{"number":2471,"title":"Chapter 2471 - News on Your Beautiful Master","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Zuo Qingluan narrowed her eyes.","Feng Wu knew her as well as she knew Feng Wu.","That was generally what archenemies were like.","“Northern Border City, the ugly girl, and the Immortal Spiritual Fruit,” Zuo Qingluan said as she looked into Feng Wu’s eyes. “If you’re still here three days later, he’ll know what you did.”","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched.","The thing she feared the most had finally happened.","She gritted her teeth.","“Right, you probably don’t know who Bao Er is.” Zuo Qingluan smiled. “She’s the only child of the late princess, who was the crown prince’s aunt and His Majesty’s sister.","“Do you know how the princess died?”","Zuo Qingluan gave Feng Wu a meaningful smile before she left.","Fallen Star Yard.","Seeing how frustrated Feng Wu was, Chaoge was surprised. “Didn’t you go to Wandering Temple as the first worshiper of the year? Why do you look so upset? Did that old swindler trick you again?”","Feng Wu shook her head. She then asked Chaoge, “Do you know who Bao Er i","Chaoge said, “I’ve heard of her before. She’s the only child of the late princess, and the royal family is very protective of her. I’ve never met her, so I don’t know much about her, but I’m sure Feng Xun knows something. He’s so nosy.”","Feng Xun.","Feng Wu recalled what “the ugly girl” had done to Feng Xun back in Northern Border City and wondered how he would react if he discovered who that girl really was.","Just then, she heard a ding in her head.","Feng Wu jolted.","Had she finished the eleventh trial?!","However, when she checked the message, she was disappointed to realize that wasn’t the case.","The fairy was looking at her with an obsequious smile.","“You’ve triggered a hidden mission. What do you think?”","Feng Wu frowned. “A hidden mission? How did that happen? Tell me about it.”","The fairy said, “You need to make Bao Er like you.”","Feng Wu asked, “What if I say no?”","The fairy said, “You can do that, but would you like to hear about the reward?”","Feng Wu said, “No, but I know you’ll tell me no matter what.”","The fairy nodded.","Feng Wu said, “Fine. Go ahead.”","‘The fairy said, “After you finish the twelve trials and get the broken star piece, Master Mu Jiuzhou will wake up. However, there’s a time limit to that.”","Feng Wu nodded.","The fairy said, “The more Bao Er likes you, the longer your master will stay awake.”","Feng Wu was astonished.","The fairy nodded. “Yes. It’s a very generous reward.”","Feng Wu frowned. “How can the 12 Trials of Love affect the time that my master will stay awake? Who designed these trials?”","The fairy shrugged and shook her head. “Will you accept the challenge?”","“Yes! Of course!” Feng Wu grew excited. “How will you evaluate how much Bao Er likes me?”","The fairy said, “It’s on a scale from one to 100, and 100 is the highest score.”","“So, if I get full marks, will my beautiful master stay awake for 100 days after I get the second broken star piece?!”"]},{"number":2472,"title":"Chapter 2472 - The Truth","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The last time her beautiful master came back, he only stayed for seven days before he fell back into his long sleep again.","And Feng Wu only managed to learn three moves of the Fallen Star Swordplay.","The fairy nodded. “Yes.”","Feng Wu immediately headed out.","Chaoge was speechless. Feng Wu had looked so defeated a moment ago, but now, she was in high spirits once again.","‘Where are you going?” Chaoge asked.","“Where’s Bao Er?” Feng Wu asked.","That was a good question.","‘Where on earth was Bao Er?","“Tm sure Feng Xun knows the answer!” Chaoge said loudly.","Meanwhile, in Phoenix Yard.","“Miss Qingluan, do you think Feng Wu will pack up and leave?” Tongque wasn’t so sure.","Zuo Qingluan pondered for a while.","Before, she had never considered Feng Wu a threat.","But now, she had to figure out what Feng Wu would do, which annoyed her greatly.","‘When she put her mind to something, she could be very intimidating.","“What do you think she’ll do?” Zuo Qingluan frowned.","Tongque said, “Miss Qingluan, do you want my honest answer?”","Zuo Qingluan said, “Speak.”","Tongque bit her lip and said, “First of all, it’s a fact that Feng Wu has won His Royal Highness’s heart.”","Zuo Qingluan’s face tured livid. Those words were like daggers stabbing into her chest.","Tongque stole a glance at Zuo Qingluan. Seeing that her young master could still control her temper, she went on, “I saw it at Beyond World Tower the other day. Feng Wu is quite shameless and doesn’t think twice about fawning on His Royal Highness. Pardon me for saying this, but men like girls like","that.”","Zuo Qingluan was so frustrated.","Tongque said, “Miss Qingluan, you’re such a proud young lady. I’m sure if you can change your attitude a little...”","Zuo Qingluan glared at Tongque.","Tongque felt like a needle had just pierced her head.","Fine, no honest answer, then. Tongque sighed inwardly because she genuinely felt that girls like that were more approachable. Even she began to feel that","Of course, she was still on Miss Qingluan’s side! Tongque clenched her fists.","Tongque then said, “Since she’s so shameless, I think she’ll definitely stay. I even think that she’ll do everything she can to keep His Royal Highness happy...”","Having seen what Feng Wu would do to please the crown prince, Tongque knew that she could easily defeat Zuo Qingluan when it came to winning a man’s heart.","Zuo Qingluan would still have a chance if she was prettier than Feng Wu, but","Tongque was suddenly filled with despair.","Hearing what Tongque said, Zuo Qingluan was frustrated. She rose to her feet.","“Miss Qingluan, where are you going?” asked Tongque.","“I’m going to see Feng Xun!”","Meanwhile, in Fallen Star Yard.","“Xiao Wu, where are you going?” Chaoge had been chatting with Feng Wu, when the latter suddenly got to her feet.","“Tm going to see Feng Xun!”","Northern Feng Mansion.","Achoo!","Feng Xun rubbed his nose and had an ominous feeling.","Both Feng Wu and Zuo Qingluan were headed for Northern Feng Mansion, but who would get there first?"]},{"number":2473,"title":"Chapter 2473 - His Majesty Wrote It","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu arrived first.","Feng Xun was in his own courtyard.","Feng Xun pretended that he was asleep when he heard Feng Wu call his name.","He thought that the girl was here to ask about Yu Mingye.","Boss Jun had been very angry about Yu Mingye’s fireworks and had told Feng Xun to look into it.","‘That was what Feng Xun had been doing since he left the Feng family.","Yu Mingye hadn’t come in person.","He was still learning from the Black Dragon King and had sent someone here to set off the fireworks to stake his claim on Feng Wu.","The entire imperial capital had seen it, and the crown prince was very displeased.","Feng Xun cringed when he imagined the price Yu Mingye was going to pay for what he did.","Feng Wu called his name again, but Feng Xun hid under his blanket and acted as if he couldn’t hear her.","But Feng Wu pulled the blanket away as soon as she entered his room.","Feng Xun yelled, “Hey! How can you be so rude?! I’m going to tell my beautiful aunt what you did!”","He knew how the beautiful lady had been trying to turn Feng Wu into a “proper lady.”","Feng Wu crossed her arms and asked grumpily, “What’s going on with Bao Er?”","“Is that what you’re here for? To ask about Bao Er?” Feng Xun was relieved.","Feng Wu raised her eyebrows. “Why? Do you have something else to tell me?”","Feng Xun shook his head. “Of course not. You have a higher clearance level than I do. What more can I tell you? Right, Bao Er.”","He immediately changed the topic.","“Why do you want to know?” he asked curiously.","Feng Wu said, “Someone told me that she’s the person His Royal Highness cares about the most. That’s why I’m curious.”","“Jealous, are we?” Feng Xun teased her.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at him. “Jealousy implies that I care about him, but I don’t, so there’s no jealousy involved.”","Feng Xun wanted to roll his eyes at her.","He said, “It’s been a year since Northern Border City. How long are you going to keep denying it?”","Feng Wu stomped on his foot. “Shut up!”","Feng Xun sucked in his breath in pain. “I’m telling the truth! The two of you... Fine. You can keep saying that you don’t care about Boss Jun, but I’m sure that Boss Jun cares about you.”","Feng Wu said awkwardly, “No, he doesn’t!”","Feng Xun said, “Xiao Wu, be reasonable.”","Feng Wu turned around. “If you don’t want to tell me about Bao Er, I’m leaving now.”","Seeing that Feng Wu still refused to face reality, Feng Xun couldn’t stand it anymore.","He grabbed Feng Wu’s arm and said, “I don’t care if you don’t want to listen to me. You can’t keep running away from it. Can’t you see that Boss Jun has been quite... aggressive lately?”","Feng Wu said, “No, he hasn’t!”","Feng Xun said, “Do you remember the words formed by the fireworks about you and him?”","Feng Wu blurted out, “His Majesty wrote that!”","Feng Xun laughed. “And you believed that.”","Feng Wu said, “Why shouldn’t I? It was His...”","Feng Xun said, “Fine. Keep denying it, then. Boss Jun will force you to face it one day. It’s been a year, and his patience is running out.”","2","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She didn’t feel like hanging around here anymore."]},{"number":2474,"title":"Chapter 2474 - Drive a Wedge Between","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu wanted to slip away.","“Speaking of Bao Er, I do recall something. It’s about the Immortal Spiritual Fruit in Northern Border City...”","Feng Xun wanted to discuss it with Feng Wu, but she took off as soon as he started talking.","But she paused after a few steps.","She couldn’t run away like this.","Zuo Qingluan had somehow found out about the Immortal Spiritual Fruit and was bound to tell Feng Xun. At that thought, she turned around to face Feng Xun.","“You lost a bet to me. Do you remember?” she asked seriously.","Feng Xun lost the bet when he said that no member of the Feng clan would celebrate Feng Wu’s birthday for her.","Of course Feng Xun still remembered it.","He crossed his arms and stared at Feng Wu. “What do you want from me?”","Feng Wu asked, “How have I treated you all this time?”","Feng Xun said, “Okay, I guess...”","Feng Wu asked, “Okay? I’ve been so nice to you! Anyway, I tricked you once before, and I’ll let you out of the bet that you lost. After that, we’re even. Deal?”","Feng Xun was dumbfounded. “Wait. You tricked me. How? When?”","Feng Wu thought, “You’ll soon find out.”","She said, “Anyway, we’re even. Right?”","Feng Xun scratched his head. Somehow, he felt that he had been tricked again.","Feng Wu glared at him. “Right?! Answer me!”","Feng Xun said, “If you say so...”","Feng Wu said, “Then, it’s a deal.”","Feng Xun was still baffled when Feng Wu shook hands with him.","“Hey, you haven’t told me how you’ve tricked me yet.” Feng Wu ran off before Feng Xun could catch her.","Feng Xun was rendered speechless.","Moonlight poured into the courtyard.","Feng Xun scratched his head and searched his memory.","He couldn’t remember how the girl had tricked him. How annoying!","“Young Lord Feng.”","He was still lost in thought when a visitor arrived.","The silver moonlight gave the girl an otherworldly beauty.","“Zuo Qingluan?” Feng Xun was suddenly alarmed.","Five years ago, he used to see Zuo Qingluan as a friend, but now that they had met again, he felt that she was more like an enemy.","How strange. He didn’t think that there was any conflict between them.","“What do you think of Feng Wu?” Zuo Qingluan cut to the chase.","Feng Xun asked, “What do you mean? Of course, she’s my dear sister.”","Zuo Qingluan said, “Your dear sister? Feng Xun, do you know what she thinks of you?”","Feng Xun frowned. “Are you trying to drive a wedge between us?”","Zuo Qingluan said, “Read this, then tell me if I’m trying to drive you away from her.”","‘That was all she was going to say.","She showed Feng Xun what she had discovered.."]},{"number":2475,"title":"Chapter 2475 - Tell Me Who She Is","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun asked, “What’s that?”","He didn’t open the envelope right away.","Zuo Qingluan said, “It’s the evidence that’ll show you, His Royal Highness, and Xuan Yi who Feng Wu really is. She tricked all of you. Just read it.”","Feng Xun smirked and pushed the envelope back to Zuo Qingluan.","“Aren’t you going to open it?” Zuo Qingluan asked coldly.","“Why should I look at something that’s obviously a lie?” asked Feng Xun.","“How do you know it’s a lie?”","Feng Xun said, “You said Xiao Wu tricked us. That’s obviously a lie.”","Zuo Qingluan smirked, “Feng Xun, I can’t believe how dumb you’ve become. You’re defending her now, but do you know what she did? She’s been using you from the very beginning!”","“Impossible!”","“Then read it. You’ll see,” Zuo Qingluan prompted.","Feng Xun shook his head. “No, I won’t!”","Zuo Qingluan was furious. She couldn’t understand why Feng Xun wouldn’t believe her.","But she knew what to do.","Zuo Qingluan said, “Northern Border City, Frozen Forest, the ugly girl.”","Feng Xun gritted his teeth. “Do you know her? Who is she?!”","Because of that girl, Feng Xun felt that he owed Boss Jun.","“Just tell me who that ugly girl is!” Feng Xun bellowed furiously.","“Iwas so nice to her!","“Boss Jun said we should leave her in the forest, but I wouldn’t. I promised them that she wouldn’t cause any trouble.","“And what did she do? She stole the Immortal Spiritual Fruit! We were going to save Bao Er’s life with it!","“We had such a hard time trying to catch her. Even Boss Jun joined in, but guess what?","“She escaped!","“Why was she so hard to catch?! Even Boss Jun couldn’t catch her!”","The smile on Zuo Qingluan’s face grew wider as Feng Xun continued grousing.","It was hard to imagine that the sacred lady could smile so brightly.","“Stop smiling! Tell me who she is! I’m gonna kill her when I find her!”","Feng Xun had forgotten all about what Feng Wu said about them being even. All he could think about was finding the ugly girl and kicking her ass.","“Tl take her to Boss Jun and make her pay for what she did!” Feng Xun bellowed.","That girl was the only person who had ever defeated Boss Jun.","“Who is she?!”","Zuo Qingluan gave him a meaningful smile.","Boom!","Feng Xun felt like he had been struck by lightning.","He stared at Zuo Qingluan.","Zuo Qingluan smiled coldly.","Feng Xun said, “Do you mean...”","Zuo Qingluan looked at the thick envelope.."]},{"number":2476,"title":"Chapter 2476 - That Painting","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","No, it can’t have been Xiao Wu! They don’t even look alike!”","Feng Xun shook his head.","But he gradually calmed down.","Feng Xiaowu and Feng Wu.","They were practically the same name!","No, it must be a coincidence. People can have similar names.”","However, his intuition told him differently because he realized that both girls were equally witty and unpredictable.","“No, they don’t even have the same body type.”","Zuo Qingluan said, “If she can change the way she looks, why can’t she change everything else?”","Feng Xun was rendered speechless.","He wouldn’t believe it!","That couldn’t be the truth!","“What’s written inside can confirm your speculation. You can look for evidence yourself as well.”","Finally, Feng Xun picked up the envelope and read the information.","Afterward.","Zuo Qingluan smiled in satisfaction.","She believed that she had defeated Feng Wu.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu didn’t return to Fallen Star Yard, but went to the crown prince’s residence instead.","It was the last place she wanted to go.","If she had a choice, she would avoid Jun Linyuan, but for her beautiful master, she had to talk to him.","Bao Er had been protected too well. Other than knowing who her mother was, she couldn’t find any other information about her. Therefore, she had to go and see the crown prince.","Luckily, she had a lot of time to finish this task. The deadline was the same as for the twelfth trial.","But where her beautiful master was concerned, Feng Wu wouldn’t delay even a minute.","‘The crown prince’s residence.","Granny Gong was pleasantly surprised to see Feng Wu.","“Miss Wu, are you here to see His Royal Highness? Please follow me,” Granny Gong said loudly, as if she wanted to tell everyone that Feng Wu was here.","Hearing her voice, many rooms immediately lit up.","Feng Wu said, “Ahem... I’m not here to see His Royal Highness. Granny Gong, I’m here to see you.”","Granny Gong was perplexed. “Me?”","Feng Wu nodded. “Yes. I want to ask you something.”","Granny Gong glanced at the crown prince’s courtyard. The light had gone off, but when she announced Feng Wu’s arrival, the window lit up again.","She knew that if she didn’t take Feng Wu there, her master wouldn’t lose his temper immediately, but all the servants would have a hard time later.","Granny Gong knew what to do.","She immediately figured out how to solve the problem.","“Miss Wu, of course, I’ll answer all your questions, but I still have some errands to run. How about I show you to His Royal Highness’s study?","“His Royal Highness doesn’t trust anyone but me with his books.","“Don’t worry. His Royal Highness is cultivating at the moment. He’s not there.” Granny Gong smiled.","Why did she make the suggestion?","Because she knew that her master had drawn a portrait of Feng Wu that very afternoon."]},{"number":2477,"title":"Chapter 2477 - How Vile","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Granny Gong had seen the painting and thought, “There’s no use painting it if you’re not going to let her see it!”","But His Royal Highness would never willingly show it to Feng Wu.","He threw it away right after he finished it.","Granny Gong knew where the painting was. It was crumpled up behind a vase, and she had made sure that it was still there.","She was going to lead Feng Wu there when she visited and let her discover it. It was a very subtle plan.","Knowing nothing about this plan, Feng Wu went to the study with Granny Gong.","Granny Gong chatted with Feng Wu as she cleaned the room.","“Miss Wu, what do you want to ask me?” Granny Gong didn’t move as quickly as usual.","They wouldn’t have any excuse to stay here if she cleaned up the room too fast.","Preoccupied with her beautiful master and Bao Er, Feng Wu didn’t notice anything unusual. Moreover, it would never occur to her that Granny Gong would try to help Jun","Linyuan this way.","Feng Wu began to ask about Bao Er.","“Bao Er?” Granny Gong slowly put away the books and began to wipe everything clean with a piece of cloth.","“Yes. Could you tell me more about her?” Feng Wu joined in, helping Granny Gong to clean the room.","She couldn’t bring herself to watch Granny Gong do everything on her own.","Granny Gong liked Feng Wu even more.","But she still remembered the question. “May I ask why you want to know about Bao Er?”","Feng Wu said, “Someone told me that Bao Er is the person His Royal Highness cares about the most.”","Granny Gong was infuriated.","What a vile suggestion!","She and Feng had been doing all they could to get things going between His Royal Highness and Feng Wu, but someone was trying to sabotage this relationship!","“Before I answer your question, may I ask who told you that?” Granny Gong never forgave her enemies.","Feng Wu had no reason to cover for Zuo Qingluan, so she said, “It was Zuo Qingluan.”","“I knew it!” Granny Gong took a deep breath, took out a notebook, and started writing.","Feng Wu was intrigued. “Granny Gong, what’s that?”","She then saw the title on the front page: My Enemies.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Granny Gong said, “I’m getting old, and my memory isn’t as good as before, so whenever I have an enemy, I write down their name in this notebook. After I take my revenge,","‘Il cross out that name. Convenient, isn’t it? This way, I’ll never leave anyone out. It’s been a while since anyone has dared to offend me, however, so I haven’t been writing","down any names.”","tt sounded like she missed the old days.","Feng Wu felt that she had discovered a new side to Granny Gong.","“Ahem.” Granny Gong put away the notebook and cleared her throat. “Right, Bao Er. Miss Wu, you’ll see why I don’t like Miss Zuo.","“She was trying to mislead you and make you jealous when she said that Bao Er was the person His Royal Highness cares about the most.","“Luckily, you’re the cleverest girl. I’ll tell you all about it.","“Bao Er is only five years old, and her mother was the late sister of His Majesty. After she passed away, the girl was put under His Royal Highness’s care.","“And that Zuo Qingluan was trying to make you feel jealous of a five-year-old girl. That’s just despicable.”."]},{"number":2478,"title":"Chapter 2478 - About Bao Er","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu cleared her throat.","Granny Gong was so bold.","“Granny Gong, she’s the daughter of the Zuo family and the sacred lady of Firmament Palace. Aren’t you afraid of her?”","“Why should I be? It’s not like she’s going to marry His Royal Highness!” Granny Gong said grumpily. “Miss Wu, don’t worry. You’re the only one His Royal Highness is fond","of!”","Abashed, Feng Wu stomped her foot. “Granny Gong, what are you talking about?!”","She was here to talk about Bao Er!","Granny Gong glanced at Feng Wu. The girl was blushing, and she looked like a blossoming flower in the morning sunlight.","In all the years she had served at court, Granny Gong had seen a lot of beautiful women, but none of them could compare with Feng Wu.","She knew that she had said enough about Jun Linyuan’s feelings. Revealing too much would only ruin the moment.","Hence, she changed the subject to Bao Er. “Princess Bao Er is right here in this manor.”","Feng Wu’s eyes widened. “Really? I’ve never heard anyone mention it.”","Granny Gong sighed. “Princess Bao Er has been in poor health since she was born. We’ve used all the rare and precious medicines on her, and they’re the only reason she","has survived, but...","“A year ago, I heard Young Lord Feng talk about an Immortal Spiritual Fruit which can only be found once every one thousand years. If they could find it, maybe Princess","Bao Er could be cured. Therefore, His Royal Highness went to Northern Border City in person.","“But His Royal Highness came back without the fruit. That was probably the first time he had failed a task. His Royal Highness then shut himself in his room for a long time.","“Princess Bao Er wasn’t doing well, and her health was slipping. In the end, His Royal Highness went to see Master Linghu at Wandering Temple.","“Master Linghu hardly ever leaves his temple, but because he and His Royal Highness are good friends, he came here and sealed Princess Bao Er with spiritual essence.”","“Sealed?” Feng Wu grew a little pale.","The Immortal Spiritual Fruit that had enabled her to cultivate again was also the medicine that could save Bao Er. Jun Linyuan found the fruit, but she stole it from him.","If someone tried to steal a medicine that could save her beautiful master, she would probably kill that person.","At that thought, she panicked a little.","Granny Gong didn’t know what was going on in her mind. She sighed and went on, “If he hadn’t done that, Princess Bao Er might have died. After that procedure, however,","she’s been lying in a coma ever since. You can’t even tell that she’s still alive.”","Feng Wu said, “You mean she’s in a vegetative state.”","Granny Gong said, “Yes. She’s been like that for almost a year, and things are getting worse...”","Feng Wu asked, “Did Master Linghu leave any instructions?”","Although he had tricked her a few times, he was still a capable cultivator.","Granny Gong said, “Yes.”","Feng Wu asked, “What did he say?”","Granny Gong said, “Master Linghu said that his treatment would only give Princess Bao Er one more year. That time is almost up...”","Feng Wu clenched her fists!","That was why she hadn’t heard any news about Bao Er in the past year.."]},{"number":2479,"title":"Chapter 2479 - Jun Linyuan’s Painting","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","As it turned out, Bao Er had been in a coma this whole time. Given what Jun Linyuan was like, he definitely wouldn’t want other people to talk about her. That was why Feng","Wu hadn’t heard any news about Bao Er. If Zuo Qingluan hadn’t brought it up...","“Can’t anyone help Bao Er? What about the best physician in the empire?” Feng Wu asked.","Granny Gong said, “Master Linghu is the best physician in the empire.”","Feng Wu looked perplexed.","Granny Gong said, “Firmament Palace is good at training physicians, and the old master has helped Bao Er before. She said she would figure something out, but so far, she","hasn’t sent us anything. I don’t think she knows what to do either.”","Given the chance, everyone would want to do Jun Linyuan a favor.","Feng Wu clenched her fists. “Can I see Bao Er?”","Granny Gong shook her head. “No one is allowed to see her without His Royal Highness’s permission.”","She then added, “The late princess’s death is related to His Royal Highness.”","Feng Wu looked perplexed.","That was why Jun Linyuan cared about Bao Er so much. She wondered what happened back then.","Granny Gong didn’t want to bother Feng Wu with Bao Er’s matter.","Because she was concerned about something else.","The old master of Firmament Palace was Zuo Qingluan’s teacher.","If Zuo Qingluan came to see Bao Er, using her master as an excuse, she might even move into the crown prince’s residence. If that happened, that would be a lot of trouble.","The crown prince and Feng Wu hadn’t acknowledged their relationship yet. Whenever the crown prince made a move, Feng Wu would run away. They couldn’t afford any","intruders.","Granny Gong grew anxious.","“Wait. Why did His Royal Highness throw this here?” Granny Gong picked up a piece of crumpled paper from behind a vase.","She smoothed it out on the desk.","“It’s a painting. Can it be Bao Er?”","Granny Gong knew that if she suggested that it was a portrait of Feng Wu, the girl would run away immediately.","So, she used Bao Er as an excuse.","Bao Er?","Feng Wu was intrigued. She moved closer, only to see herself in the painting.","it really was her!","n the painting, she wore a red dress. Her skin was flawless, and there was a proud look on her face.","Feng recognized it right away. It was one of Jun Linyuan’s paintings!","o one could copy that style.","“Miss Wu, it’s you! It’s so pretty!” Granny Gong chuckled. “Everyone says that anything created by His Royal Highness is worth a small fortune. This painting alone is more","valuable than the street outside.","“Look, there are some written words as well.” Granny Gong pointed to the left of the painting.","“The sovereign descends to the world. The phoenix soars above the land. How nice!” Granny Gong was amazed.","Not those words again!","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Granny Gong said, “Only His Royal Highness can come up with such a wonderful expression.”","On the other side of the wall, Jun Linyuan smiled when he heard this. He was very pleased with himself as well.","Feng Wu said, “What’s so great about that?!”."]},{"number":2480,"title":"Chapter 2480 - Terminally Ill","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Granny Gong was perplexed. “What?”","Feng Wu said, “Plus, His Majesty came up with those words, not His Royal Highness.”","Granny Gong said, “No, I watched His Royal Highness write these words. That was before His Majesty arrived.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Granny Gong said, “Miss Wu, His Royal Highness is...”","Feng Wu said, “I need to see him right now. To be more precise, I need to see Bao Er.”","Granny Gong said, “His Royal Highness is cultivating in the training room!”","Feng Wu said, “Then I’ll go to the training room.”","That was indeed where she found Jun Linyuan.","The crown prince wore a black robe and had his hands behind his back.","Feng Wu told him that she wanted to see Bao Er.","Jun Linyuan studied her.","His eyes were so bright that they made Feng Wu nervous.","She thought he was going to say no, but he snorted and nodded.","Since when was Jun Linyuan so easily persuaded? Feng Wu rubbed her nose and found it hard to believe.","She didn’t expect to meet Bao Er in this manner.","The girl was inside a golden palace.","They carefully cleaned themselves before going in. They had to cover their mouths and noses, wear shoe covers, and put on extra robes.","Bao Er was on a cold white jade bed. She was tiny. Her face was without color, and she was all skin and bones.","She looked lifeless.","Seeing Bao Er like this...","Feng Wu was filled with guilt.","If she hadn’t stolen the fruit, maybe Bao Er wouldn’t be in this state.","Feng Wu wanted to check her pulse, but a person suddenly stepped out and stopped her.","She frowned at the stern old maid.","The look in the old maid’s eyes was as sharp as a dagger.","“Leave us!” Jun Linyuan ordered.","The old maid immediately backed away with her head lowered.","Feng Wu asked quietly, “May I check her pulse? I want to see how she’s doing. If it’s possible, | want to cure her.”","She wanted to do all she could to make it up to Bao Er.","Jun Linyuan gave her a long look and nodded.","Feng Wu wiped her hands clean before she checked Bao Er’s pulse.","She then realized how grave Bao Er’s condition was.","She had never seen someone so ill.","The girl had as many as 20 conditions.","There was a lump in her head, and Feng Wu couldn’t tell yet if it was malignant.","There was something wrong with her nose, as well as her throat.","Her heart was the most severely affected organ.","Bao Er had been born with a heart smaller than usual. Her heartbeat was also slower than a normal person’s.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She tucked Bao Er in and nodded at Jun Linyuan.","She let out a sigh after they left the palace.","“Did you make this golden palace for her?” Feng Wu asked curiously.."]},{"number":2481,"title":"Chapter 2481 - You Knew?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jun Linyuan gave her a long look and nodded. “Before she went into a coma, Bao Er used to want to go out all the time, so I made this golden palace for her. It can be lifted off the ground and carried around.","“But she’s such a kind girl. She said that she didn’t want to trouble other people, so she never actually went out in it.” Jun Linyuan’s voice was still cold, but Feng Wu could tell that he cared about Bao Er.","She had never seen him so frustrated.","Even Jun Linyuan couldn’t have everything he wanted.","It pained Feng Wu to see him like this.","“I’ve examined Bao Er,” Feng Wu said softly. “Her condition is very severe. There are at least 20 things going on, and some are more severe than others. The trouble is that when I treat one of them, it may affect her","other illnesses. It’s very unpredictable.”","“That’s also what Master Linghu said,” Jun Linyuan said calmly.","Feng Wu bit her lower lip.","She had the impulse to tell him the truth.","Maybe he would forgive her.","But he could also kill her for what she had done.","She didn’t know how he would react.","She stole a glance at Jun Linyuan. From this angle, he was irresistibly handsome.","There was no expression on his face.","Guilt overwhelmed Feng Wu when she thought about Bao Er.","She closed her eyes and took a deep breath.","“I’m sorry.” She bowed at the golden palace.","Bao Er, I’m sorry for stealing your Immortal Spiritual Fruit. Because of that, you missed your best chance. You’ve lost a year because of me.","‘m not treating you because I want to make you like me. I owe you a life.","“You’re still so young. You should live to walk out of the golden palace and see the world with your own eyes.","“I promise that I’ll cure you. You’ll grow up as a healthy kid again!”","Jun Linyuan looked at Feng Wu and smiled a little.","“I stole your Immortal Spiritual Fruit.” Feng Wu met his gaze. “I was Feng Xiaowu in Northern Border City.”","She closed her eyes.","She was ready for his rage.","And his powerful strike.","But nothing happened.","Feng Wu opened her eyes and looked at Jun Linyuan in confusion.","Jun Linyuan’s eyes glimmered like stars.","He wasn’t angry.","“You knew?!” Feng Wu’s stomach lurched. “You knew all along, didn’t you? Since when?”","Jun Linyuan didn’t answer. He walked into a pavilion and sat down.","Intrigued, Feng Wu followed and sat down opposite him.."]},{"number":2482,"title":"Chapter 2482 - His Royal Highness Is Serious","paragraphs":["Granny Gong had trained the servants well. A set of teaware was always out in the pavilion, and the stove was always lit, no matter how often or not the crown prince was there.","The tea would still be ready even if Jun Linyuan never went there for a whole year.","Everything in the residence was well-prepared this way.","The crown prince made some tea and poured some into Feng Wu’s cup.","Feng Wu held the cup in her hands and went on asking questions.","Her eyes looked like pools of water in the moonlight.","“When did you find out?","“You cherish Bao Er so much. Don’t you hate me for what I did?","“I lied to you. I thought you would hit me.”","Feng Wu was perplexed.","This wasn’t like the Jun Linyuan she thought she knew.","Jun Linyuan’s eyes twinkled.","They were so close that Feng Wu could count his eyelashes.","How could someone be so good-looking?","Even his hair was nicer than other people’s.","Even girls would envy his face.","How crazy was that?","Feng Wu was infatuated.","Jun Linyuan poked Feng Wu in the forehead.","Feng Wu woke up from her reverie and put on a serious face once more.","Jun Linyuan was speechless.","“It was the bowknot,” said Jun Linyuan. What bowknot? Feng Wu was dumbfounded.","She searched her memory.","She knew what he meant!","It was that time!","During the entrance examination for Imperial College, she had needed to enter a secret land covered by ice and snow. Jun Linyuan was there as well and was injured. She had tied a bowknot when she treated his wounds...","“That was over a year ago. You knew all along, but you’re not mad at me?”","“I was mad at you.”","“Did you want to kill me?”","“Why not?” Feng Wu blurted out, but she realized that she had asked the wrong question.","Jun Linyuan was staring at her now.","His eyes were frighteningly bright, and she thought she would lose herself in them.","Sensing that things were getting out of hand, Feng Wu turned around to run away.","“Tell me, why wouldn’t I?” Jun Linyuan asked behind her.","There was a hint of anxiety in his voice.","Feng Wu felt that his gaze would burn a hole in her back.","How awkward!","She couldn’t run away like this, but she didn’t dare turn around either.","She wasn’t stupid.","Before, Jun Linyuan was too proud to speak frankly, but now, he was beginning to express his feelings.","For instance, he had used fireworks to put those words in the sky.","Feng Wu didn’t want to face him.","She was scared.","Although she was a decisive person when dealing with other things, when it came to her feelings, she was a coward.","“Answer my question,” the crown prince teased her.","Feng Wu mumbled, “How should I know?”."]},{"number":2483,"title":"Chapter 2483 - His Royal Highness Takes the Initiative","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","When Feng Wu looked up again, she saw that the crown prince was standing in front of her.","When he took a step forward, she took a step back.","Thump!","She bumped into a pillar of the pavilion.","Jun Linyuan then raised his hands and trapped her in the tiny space between his arms and the pillar.","She had nowhere to go now.","Gosh...","She wished that he wasn’t so serious. It made her feel rather awkward.","She wanted to push Jun Linyuan away.","But of course, the crown prince wasn’t someone she could easily get rid of.","No matter how hard she tried, he didn’t move an inch.","He decided that he had waited long enough. This girl couldn’t run from him forever.","He lowered his head and moved closer.","Thump!","Feng Wu stomped on his foot.","“Jun Linyuan, stop teasing me! I’m really mad!” Feng Wu glared at him.","Jun Linyuan didn’t know what she wanted.","Everyone had been telling him that Feng Wu was in love with him.","Whenever he left her alone, she would flirt with him.","But when he took the initiative, she couldn’t run away fast enough.","“Feng Wu, what on earth do you want?!” the crown prince snapped.","“I ... I...”? ? Feng Wu didn’t know how to answer that question.","The crown prince moved closer. “Do you have feelings for me or not?”","OMG!","Feng Wu was too shy to answer that question.","“I don’t know what you’re talking about!” Feng Wu shoved him and wanted to run away, but Jun Linyuan caught her by her wrist.","“Speak!” He stared at her, determined to get an answer out of her today.","Feng Wu was so embarrassed that she wanted to dig a hole and hide in it.","She might have experienced many things, but she had never been in a relationship before. That question was too direct. Moreover, she still had a crush on her beautiful master.","She believed that her master was her real Prince Charming.","“Don’t push me!” She glared at Jun Linyuan.","“You don’t get to decide what I want to do. Answer my question,” said the crown prince.","“Do you have feelings for me or not?” He stared at Feng Wu.","An idea struck Feng Wu, and she asked, “Do you have feelings for me, then?”","That rendered the crown prince speechless.","He was still feeling perplexed when Feng Wu pushed him away and ran out of the pavilion. She waved at him, saying, “Aren’t we best friends?”","“Friends?” Jun Linyuan’s face darkened.","Feng Wu said, “So, we’re best buddies?”","The crown prince said, “Say that again, and I’ll —”","Feng Wu said, “Stop right there!”","The crown prince glared at her.","Feng Wujumped onto the wall and said, “I need to go home now! You can figure out the answer and stop pushing me! Bye!”","She successfully escaped again.","Feng and Granny Gong exchanged resigned looks.","They had failed again...","Luckily, their crown prince was a little more motivated than before, although he still had a long way to go before he knew how to express his feelings.","“I guess things are getting a little better?” Feng looked at Granny Gong.","Granny Gong didn’t know what to say.."]},{"number":2484,"title":"Chapter 2484 - Is Her Cover Blown?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Let’s just say that good things take a long time to come. We still have to wait for a while before anything happens, but you’re right about one thing: His Royal Highness is getting better at expressing himself. It’s a good thing.”","Relationships were seldom straightforward.","If neither side would take the first step, the relationship would never go further.","The crown prince had begun to push Feng Wu now.","“But it won’t be easy to make His Royal Highness admit that he has feelings for Miss Feng Wu...” said Granny Gong.","“The beginning is always the hardest. It’ll get easier.”","Granny Gong and Feng smiled wryly at each other.","At the same time.","Feng Xun was rushing toward the crown prince’s residence at top speed.","He had many things to tell the crown prince.","He needed to tell Boss Jun that Feng Wu was the ugly girl.","Feng Wu had stolen their Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","Feng Wu was the only person who had ever defeated him!","How annoying!","Feng Xun was going to rush into the house, when he paused.","“No! I can’t run inside like this!”","An idea struck him.","The Immortal Spiritual Fruit could have saved Bao Er, who was very dear to Boss Jun. If he learned the truth, he might kill Xiao Wu.","Even if he spared Xiao Wu’s life, would he drain her blood and give it to Bao","After all, Xiao Wu’s blood now contained the ingredients of the fruit.","Gosh...","Would Xiao Wu survive that?","Feng Xun grew anxious.","Although he had been very angry when he first heard the news, she was still his younger sister.","He was still angry at her for what she did.","But he didn’t want her to be harmed either.","He stomped his foot, turned around and ran in a different direction.","Fallen Star Yard.","“Little Feng Wu! Get your ass over here!”","Feng Xun jumped over the wall and into the yard, and rushed into the house.","Feng Wu’s formation was designed not to stop Feng Xun, so he wasn’t hindered.","“Xun, you’re here.”","Lady Ling was glad to see him.","She liked Feng Xun for his liveliness; she thought that Jun Linyuan frowned too much.","“Aunt Ling.” Feng Xun immediately slowed down when he saw Lady Ling.","For some reason, Lady Ling gave him the feeling that she was even more distinguished than His Majesty.","He couldn’t explain it. It was instinctual.","When Lady Ling was around, he was very polite.","“Aunt Ling, where is Xiao Wu?” Feng Xun forced a smile.","Lady Ling pointed at the courtyard next door. “She’s cultivating.”","“Aunt Ling, I’ll go talk to her.”","Feng Xun was such a good boy in front of Lady Ling, but when he jumped over the wall and landed in the courtyard of the Fang manor, he looked like he was going to kill someone.","He found Feng Wu in an old tree.","She exhaled when she finished cultivating.","“Little Feng Wu! You’re such a devil! Get down here right now!” Feng Xun pointed at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu felt a little guilty.."]},{"number":2485,"title":"Chapter 2485 - Hes Going to Kill You","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","She wondered if her cover was blown.","But she had to face it sooner or later.","She couldn’t run from it forever.","Feng Wu jumped out of the tree and met Feng Xun’s gaze.","She was ready to embrace the storm.","Feng Xun stared at Feng Wu like there were flames in his eyes.","“Tell me the truth: Are you Feng Xiaowu of Northern Border City?”","Feng Xun said matter-of-factly, “Aye.”","“Aye”? What kind of an answer was that?","Feng Xun wanted to smack her on the head.","“Think very carefully before you answer. Are you really the ugly girl who stole Boss Jun’s Immortal Spiritual Fruit?”","Feng Wu said, “Aye.”","Stop with the “Aye” already!","“You really are her!”","Feng Wu said, “Yes, really.”","Feng Xun said, “Why did you admit it so fast? Aren’t you afraid of me?!”","He suddenly felt that he was even more reluctant to face the truth.","How could that be?","“Feng Wu!” Feng Xun shouted, “Why do you sound so righteous?! Do you remember what you did?!”","Feng Wu listened in silence.","Feng Xun grew angrier as he went on. “I was so nice to you, and I promised Boss Jun that I would take responsibility for everything you did. And what did you do? Is that how you repay my kindness?”","Feng Wu said, “Hm...”","Feng Xun raised his voice. “You stole the Immortal Spiritual Fruit! How could you?! Do you know why we needed that fruit? Bao Er was dying!","“You stole the fruit, and Bao Er has been lying there ever since! I can’t believe it!”","“I’m so sorry,” Feng Wu tugged on his sleeve and said in a pitiful tone.","Feng Xun stared at her. “It’s too late for that!”","Feng Wu wailed a little.","Feng Xun frowned at her.","He was genuinely angry, because his sister had crossed the line. However, when she took his hand with that lost puppy look on her face...","He couldn’t bring himself to shout at her, let alone smack her.","On his way here, Feng Xun had decided that he would teach Feng Wu a lesson.","“Brother Feng...” Feng Wu looked like an abandoned kitten.","Feng Xun took a deep breath and glared at Feng Wu. “Do you know what you’ve done wrong?”","Feng Wu said, “Yes, I do.”","Feng Xun said, “That was fast.”","Feng Wu chuckled.","Feng Xun glared at her. “You shouldn’t be laughing!”","Feng Wu whimpered.","Feng Xun didn’t know what to say.","When he saw her big eyes and adorable face, he couldn’t bring himself to say anything harsh.","He said, “I can live with the fact that you’ve lied to me, but do you know how serious the consequence is?","“The fruit was supposed to be Bao Er’s medicine. If Boss Jun knows that you are the ugly girl, he’ll kill you!”","Feng Wu said, “I... don’t think so.”."]},{"number":2486,"title":"Chapter 2486: Untitled","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun said, “You don’t think so? If he’s angry enough, he’ll kill your entire family!","“Just remember: Don’t let Boss Jun know!”","Feng Wu was touched.","Feng Xun was Jun Linyuan’s most loyal friend, but to protect Feng Wu, he chose to hide the truth from Jun Linyuan.","It was a hard choice for Feng Xun.","Feng Wu said, “He already knows.”","Feng Xun said, “You can’t let him... What did you just say?”","Feng Wu said, “He already knows.”","“Oh my god!” Feng Xun was so shocked that he almost fell over.","His first reaction was to push Feng Wu toward the front gate. “You should leave now! Don’t bother packing! Just run as fast as you can!”","Feng Wu said, “It’s alright. He...”","Feng Xun said, “Of course it’s not alright! He’s going to kill you!”","Feng Wu said, “He didn’t get angry at me.”","Feng Xun stared at her. “Are you sure?”","Feng Wu said, “Moreover, I’ve seen Bao Er in the golden palace.”","Feng Xun looked her up and down, trying to make sure that she wasn’t harmed.","‘You...” He hesitated. “Are you sure he really knows?”","Feng Wu nodded.","Feng Xun said, “And you’re still alright.”","Feng Wu nodded.","Feng Xun asked, “Did he do anything to you?”","“Define ‘anything,” thought Feng Wu. He had pressed her against a pillar, so she hesitated for a moment.","Feng Xun took a deep breath. “Stay put. I’ll go see Boss Jun now.”","He dashed off after that.","A moment later, he paused.","He then smacked his head.","That wasn’t right.","He was here to tell Feng Wu off, but right now, he was protecting her. How incredible!","But —","He decided that his top priority was her safety.","He ran to the crown prince’s residence.","“Boss Jun, Boss Jun, did you know that Xiao WII...” Jun Linyuan was cultivating when Feng Xun rushed into the room.","Jun Linyuan glanced at him and went back to his training.","Feng Xun was worried sick by the time Jun Linyuan finished. Only then did Jun Linyuan put on a robe and walk out of the hot spring.","“Boss Jun, did you really know already?” Feng Xun asked anxiously,","‘Yes,” Jun Linyuan said calmly.","Feng Xun was shocked. “Are you not going to kill her?”","Jun Linyuan found the question idiotic. He lay down on a chair and used his spiritual essence to dry his hair.","“How is that possible? You care about Bao Er so much. If it wasn’t for Xiao Wu, Bao Er wouldn’t have...’","“She’s going to make it up to me.” The crown prince sipped his wine.","“With what?”","“Herself,” said the crown prince confidently.","Hearing that, Feng wanted to shake his head. If only things were that easy.","Of course, as the steward, he would never say that out loud. He didn’t even frown...","#"]},{"number":2487,"title":"Chapter 2487 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Feng Xun stared at Jun Linyuan. “Boss Jun, did she really say that? Did she agree to use herself as compensation if she can’t cure Bao Er?”","The crown prince nodded.","Feng Xun let out a breath of relief. “That’s great. I was so worried that you would kill her!”","Feng found Feng Xun’s worry to be utterly idiotic.","Kill Feng Wu?","His Royal Highness would probably kill himself first.","Just then, someone outside called, “Your Royal Highness, Miss Qingluan is requesting an audience.”","“Zuo Qingluan?” Feng Xun was surprised. “Boss Jun, I didn’t know that you were still talking to her.”","As Jun Linyuan’s future brother-in-law, Feng Xun immediately raised his guard.","Jun Linyuan was about to turn down the request, when the servant said, “Your Royal Highness, here’s a letter from Miss Qingluan.”","Jun Linyuan quickly read it. His face darkened a little when he read one of the lines, and he said, “Bring her in.”","Feng Xun was curious about what had changed Jun Linyuan’s mind.","He grabbed the letter and saw that Zuo Qingluan said that she was here to see Bao Er on behalf of her master.","“Can Zuo Qingluan help Bao Er?” Feng Xun asked suspiciously.","Jun Linyuan said, “I don’t know, but her master did indeed help Bao Er once.”","Feng Xun said, “So, you owe her a favor.” Jun Linyuan nodded.","Feng Xun asked, “Haven’t you returned the favor yet?”","Jun Linyuan snorted. “Do you think she’ll let me off the hook so easily?”","Feng Xun nodded. “You have a point. Of course, she would save it for something more important. What a cunning old hag.”","Zuo Qingluan arrived at that moment.","She held her head high, looking as proud as a peacock.","However, that wouldn’t impress anyone in this residence.","On her way in, she saw that the servants were busy with their own work, and no one even glanced at her.","That displeased Zuo Qingluan.","When she entered the main hall, Jun Linyuan had already changed into his formal attire.","Zuo Qingluan had thought that after everything Jun Linyuan had put her through, she would feel angry when she met him again. However, she couldn’t help but be awed by his handsome face. Her heart pounded.","Jun Linyuan glanced at her. “Are you here to deliver a message for your master?”","“Yes.”","Zuo Qingluan wanted to show him her best side.","Every move she made seemed to be carefully measured, from her tone to her gait.","One couldn’t find a more refined young lady.","She was as graceful as a queen.","She believed that the crown prince would surely be impressed.","Poor Zuo Qingluan. She had no idea that Jun Linyuan would prefer Feng Wu’s pouting face over any of her well-trained demeanor.","Needless to say, Jun Linyuan wasn’t impressed.","Neither was Feng Xun.","He found Zuo Qingluan so pretentious.","“What’s the message, then?” he urged her."]},{"number":2488,"title":"Chapter 2488 - Jun Linyuan vs Zuo Qingluan","paragraphs":["Zuo Qingluan glanced at Feng Xun.","She wondered if Feng Xun had told the crown prince about the ugly girl.","But the crown prince didn’t seem angry, so she assumed that Jun Linyuan still didn’t know.","Zuo Qingluan said, “After my master examined Bao Er, she said that the Immortal Spiritual Fruit could save her. Your Royal Highness, did you find it?”","Hearing that...","Feng Xun knew what she was getting at.","Before, he had found Zuo Qingluan to be a pretty and smart girl. He used to like her because she was such a fast learner. However, after what she did recently, Feng Xun began to dislike her.","And that question...","Of all things, why would she ask about the Immortal Spiritual Fruit?","She was obviously trying to incriminate Feng Wu!","When Zuo Qingluan asked the question, she was looking at Feng Xun out of the corner of her eye.","She thought that she had provided Feng Xun with the best opportunity.","Why wouldn’t he use it?","Zuo Qingluan urged Feng Xun with her eyes.","Feng Xun smirked. He knew that she wanted to use him, and found her plan ridiculous.","Zuo Qingluan frowned.","She didn’t understand it; according to Mu Yaoyao, Feng Wu had put Feng Xun in a miserable state. Wouldn’t he want to take revenge?","It was said that Feng Xun always made his enemy pay.","Zuo Qingluan stared at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun snorted.","Are you trying to use me to defeat Feng Wu? he thought.","Aren’t you supposed to be the sacred lady with no worldly desires? You’re very keen on eliminating your enemy now.","Feng Xun returned her gaze with a mocking smile on his face.","Zuo Qingluan was furious, but she was very good at controlling her emotions.","When she turned to look at Jun Linyuan, there was already an affectionate look in her eyes.","“We’ll have a much better chance to cure Bao Er if we have the Immortal Spiritual Fruit. I was told that Feng Wu seems to have one.” Zuo Qingluan cut to the chase.","Feng Xun wanted to protect Feng Wu, but Zuo Qingluan wouldn’t let him.","Feng Wu had to die!","“I see.” Jun Linyuan picked up his cup.","That was a sign that the meeting was over. Zuo Qingluan flushed. Damn you, Feng Wu! What did you put in His Royal Highness’s head?! With you around, I’ll never win him back!","At that thought, Zuo Qingluan stepped forward and said, “I heard that Your Royal Highness knows Feng Wu well. Why don’t we talk to her and borrow the fruit?”","To her disappointment, the crown prince didn’t react.","Wasn’t he supposed to be very smart?","The crown prince glanced at Zuo Qingluan and asked coldly, “What are you getting at?”","Zuo Qingluan said, “A year ago, Feng Wu stole the Immortal Spiritual Fruit from you.” She then kept her gaze on Jun Linyuan, trying to read his thoughts. But his face remained expressionless.","Zuo Qingluan’s hands grew cold. Why wouldn’t he understand?","“So?” Jun Linyuan asked indifferently.","Feng Xun almost burst out laughing."]},{"number":2489,"title":"Chapter 2489 - Jun Linyuan vs Feng Wu","paragraphs":["Feng Xun couldn’t understand it. Zuo Qingluan was so smart, but why did she behave like an idiot around Boss Jun?","Zuo Qingluan already knew the answer, but she didn’t want to admit it.","Because if she did, it would mean that His Royal Highness cared about Feng Wu more than Bao Er.","Back then, she had barely touched Bao Er, and the crown prince had looked like he was going to kill her. However, now that Feng Wu had taken the Immortal Spiritual Fruit that could save Bao Er, he wasn’t even angry.","She assumed that he didn’t know anything about it.","Zuo Qingluan said, “Although it’s been a year, the effect of the Immortal Spiritual Fruit is still in Feng Wu’s blood. If we use her blood as the base of...”","Before she could finish, she felt a cold gaze on her.","Her chest tightened.","It was as if her heart was being squeezed, and the pain made her suck in her breath.","The temperature seemed to drop, as if it was going to snow.","It was freezing...","Zuo Qingluan glanced at Jun Linyuan.","She saw his brooding eyes, and she almost shivered.","He knew!","Zuo Qingluan realized that she had to admit the truth. Jun Linyuan knew that Feng Wu was the ugly girl, but he wasn’t angry.","This shouldn’t be happening.","Zuo Qingluan wanted to cry.","This had been her best chance. She had thought that by playing this card, she would get rid of Feng Wu forever, but...","Was Feng Wu even human?","His Royal Highness is fond of... No! There’s no way that’s it! I’ll never admit that His Royal Highness is in love with Feng Wu! He’s like this only because she’s pretty!","At that thought, Zuo Qingluan took a deep breath and fought back her anger.","Zuo Qingluan, calm down. Feng Wu is only a small obstacle in your life. You were able to crush her five years ago, you can still crush her now!","When Zuo Qingluan opened her eyes, she was the unapproachable sacred lady once more.","She bade the crown prince farewell and left the residence.","She looked perfectly calm again.","Feng Xun spat on the ground as soon as Zuo Qingluan was gone.","“I thought she was here to treat Bao Er, but she was actually here to accuse my Xiao Wu!”","“My Xiao Wu”? The crown prince glanced at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun immediately came back to his senses. “I mean, your Xiao Wu.”","He didn’t think Boss Jun would respond, but the latter actually nodded.","He nodded!","Feng Xun almost jumped.","He couldn’t believe his eyes.","When Jun Linyuan walked away, Feng Xun didn’t follow him. Instead, he grabbed Feng’s sleeve.","“Feng, did you see that? Boss Jun nodded, right?”","Feng said, “Yes.”","Feng Xun scratched his head. “So, I was right. Boss Jun finally admits that he has feelings for little Feng Wu!”","It was a turning point!"]},{"number":2490,"title":"Chapter 2490 - He Promised to Marry Me","paragraphs":["Zuo Qingluan went back to Phoenix Yard.","Tongque greeted her.","She thought that after the amazing information she had gathered, the sacred lady would be able to defeat Feng Wu.","However, Phoenix Yard was destroyed once? more.","Tongque felt that she had lost count of her master’s tantrums.","After Zuo Qingluan was done venting her rage, Tongque summoned the servants.","In less than an hour, Phoenix Yard was as good as new.","When a maid walked past Tongque, she whispered, “Miss Tongque, we’re running out of new furniture...”","“Get lost!” Tongque said impatiently.","If the sacred lady heard that, she would kill all of them.","The maid bit her lower lip and quickly left.","Tongque took a deep breath and went inside.","“Feng Wu, I’m impressed!” Zuo Qingluan smacked the table, her face twitching. “I didn’t think she would pose any sort of threat when I returned. I wouldn’t have even bothered to glance at her!","“But what a surprise! She has put on quite the show!” Zuo Qingluan suddenly rose to her feet.","Tongque wanted to say something, but hesitated.","She wanted to remind the sacred lady that when she first returned, the rumor she spread was that the crown prince was deeply in love with her. Now, however, she and Feng Wu were competing over the crown prince...","Zuo Qingluan glared at Tongque. “What’s on your mind? Are you laughing at me?!”","She sounded frustrated.","Tongque sighed inwardly, but she feigned a terrified tone and knelt down. “Miss Qingluan, I don’t know anything...”","Zuo Qingluan took a deep breath.","She forced herself to calm down.","She told herself, “Zuo Qingluan, you’re the best! You have the True Phoenix Blood, and you’re the one His Royal Highness is going to marry! Other women can never threaten your position!” The crown prince’s reaction had ruined Zuo Qingluan’s plan.","She had thought that all she needed to do was marry Jun Linyuan, but now, he wouldn’t even look at her.","She glared at Tongque. “I know what you’re thinking.”","Tongque gritted her teeth and hoped that the sacred lady wouldn’t say the unspeakable. Zuo Qingluan only smirked. “Feng Wu has seduced His Royal Highness, but it doesn’t matter. All men like pretty girls, but that will pass. At the end of the day, he’ll still be mine.”","“Of course,” said Tongque. She would never disagree with her master.","Zuo Qingluan seemed to be convincing herself. “I have the True Phoenix Blood!”","Tongque said, “Yes, and all princes want to marry you.”","Zuo Qingluan nodded and said coldly, “But I want to marry His Royal Highness.”","Tongque was speechless.","Even the vendors outside know what you want! she thought.","Zuo Qingluan stressed, “He promised that he would marry me. That’s why I’m doing this.”","Tongque could only keep nodding. Zuo Qingluan was trying to convince Tongque as well as herself."]},{"number":2491,"title":"Chapter 2491 - Empress Dowager","paragraphs":["Zuo Qingluan insisted that Jun Linyuan had made the promise first, and she was only asking him to keep his promise.","She sat down and started thinking.","It would be very difficult to try and change Jun Linyuan’s mind.","Zuo Qingluan then thought about Feng Xun, and wondered if she could work on him.","She had thought about it before. She would befriend Feng Xun and ask him to support her. That way, she would make a good impression on the crown prince...","It was a good idea, but she couldn’t use it.","Because Feng Wu had beaten her to it.","Zuo Qingluan gritted her teeth. “Feng Wu, you keep saying that you’re not in love with His Royal Highness, but you made friends with Feng Xun first and used him to get to His Royal Highness. How cunning!”","Since His Royal Highness’s friend wouldn’t work, she had to work on his family instead.","Bao Er... Zuo Qingluan shook her head. She wasn’t capable enough at the moment to treat Bao Er.","His Royal Highness’s mother had passed away, and he didn’t see eye to eye with His Majesty. That left her with only one candidate.","The empress dowager. The old lady doted on the crown prince, and she was the only person whom Jun Linyuan was patient with.","Zuo Qingluan concluded that Jun Linyuan would definitely listen to the empress dowager. As long as she agreed... Zuo Qingluan smiled a little.","It seemed that she was going to visit the royal palace.","She never did things that she wasn’t confident about. To win over the empress dowager, she made a lot of preparations in advance.","She needed to figure out what the old lady liked and disliked.","The Zuo family would help her with that.","Mrs. Zuo’s eyes lit up when she heard the plan.","Finally, her daughter was going to do something.","She had been so proud, but now, she was asking about the empress dowager’s preferences.","What Mrs. Zuo didn’t know was that this was all part of Zuo Qingluan’s plan. She would never willingly fawn over any person.","Zuo Qingluan had no real respect for the empress dowager.","But her hands were tied, and she had to do things she hated.","For other people, it would be very difficult to meet the empress dowager.","But the Zuo family could visit the empress dowager almost whenever they wanted.","Mrs. Zuo took Zuo Qingluan to Empress Dugu’s palace first.","Empress Dugu was pleased when Zuo Qingluan, the sacred lady of Firmament Palace, came to pay her respects to her. Zuo Qingluan was also her niece. Empress Dugu then took Zuo Qingluan to see the empress dowager. Cining Palace.","“The sacred lady?”","The empress dowager frowned a little.","She remembered Zuo Qingluan. The girl had been very proud since she was little. She behaved more like a princess than Jun Wuxia.","The empress dowager didn’t like girls who were too proud, so she didn’t think much of Zuo Qingluan.","Two elderly maids served the empress dowager.","One was Granny Lan. She was mild-tempered and rather liked Feng Wu.","The other one was Granny Gui, who got along well with Empress Dugu."]},{"number":2492,"title":"Chapter 2492 - Zuo Qingluan Fawns on the Empress Dowager","paragraphs":["Granny Gui said, “Miss Qingluan has the True Phoenix Blood. If His Royal Highness marries her, their children will have both bloodlines. Your Majesty, aren’t you searching for a wife for His Royal Highness? Maybe Miss Qingluan can be a candidate.”","The empress dowager frowned. She only gestured at the servants to bring Empress Dugu and the others in.","Empress Dugu was chuckling when she walked in.","The empress dowager frowned because she didn’t like Empress Dugu.","She wanted to protect Jun Linyuan, but Empress Dugu had never been friendly toward him, so the empress dowager had never liked her daughter-in-law.","Empress Dugu knew that as well, but her family was here, so she had to pretend that she and the empress dowager were very close. Otherwise, it would be so humiliating.","Your Majesty, how was your day?” Empress Dugu greeted her mother-in-law.","The empress dowager glanced at Empress Dugu but soon looked past her.","She was looking at the people behind Empress Dugu — Mrs. Zuo and Zuo Qingluan.","The empress dowager had expected Zuo Qingluan to be as arrogant as she used to be, but she was wrong.","When she looked at Zuo Qingluan, the girl was smiling","A smile? The empress dowager couldn’t believe her eyes.","She looked again.","Zuo Qingluan was smiling sweetly at her.","The empress dowager’s heart almost skipped a beat.","The arrogant girl from five years ago was fawning on the empress dowager. What a bright smile.","The empress dowager hadn’t liked the idea of marrying Zuo Qingluan to Jun Linyuan at first since the boy was already very cold. If his wife was equally cold, what would their life be like?","The empress dowager was looking for a considerate girl with a warm smile.","Right now, Miss Zuo looked like a suitable candidate.","“Are you Zuo Qingluan?” The empress dowager was a little intrigued.","“Yes, Your Majesty.”","Zuo Qingluan slowly walked up to the empress dowager and bowed.","How graceful.","The empress dowager and Granny Gui exchanged looks, and both were pleasantly surprised.","Her movements were so accurate it was like they had been measured with a ruler.","The girl looked like she was born to live in the palace.","“Your Majesty, here’s some Snowy Cream my master made for you.”","Firmament Palace was good at making both medicines and poisons.","Zuo Qingluan knew that all women loved things that made them more beautiful.","Although the empress dowager was an elderly woman, she still spent hours on skincare every day. Zuo Qingluan had chosen the perfect gift for her.","The empress dowager was surprised to see the gift. “Snowy Cream? I use it all the time, but this one smells fresher.”","Zuo Qingluan nodded. “The Snowy Cream sold in Firmament Pavilion has a similar formula, but the ones sold elsewhere are made by ordinary people, so they are not as effective.”"]},{"number":2493,"title":"Chapter 2493 - Preparing to Marry Jun Linyuan","paragraphs":["“Your Majesty, this Snowy Cream was made by my master, and is the same cream that she uses every day. My master said that Your Majesty and her were best friends when you were young. Although the two of you haven’t met each other for many years, she still cares about Your Majesty.”","Zuo Qingluan studied the empress dowager as she spoke.","She didn’t expect that the old lady would like her right away. As long as the empress dowager liked her better than before, she would achieve results.","The empress dowager looked pleased when she heard that the master of Firmament Palace still cared about her.","And the Snowy Cream was a very considerate gift.","Seeing that Zuo Qingluan wasn’t as arrogant as she had expected, the empress dowager wasn’t as indifferent as before.","“Take a seat,” said the empress dowager.","Despite the change in her attitude, the empress dowager wasn’t that easily impressed. It would take more than a few gifts to melt her heart.","“Wait. Is Zuo Qingluan here?” Jun Wuxia was there as well, and was surprised to see Zuo Qingluan.","Zuo Qingluan nodded at her. “That’s the deluxe version of the Snowy Cream. Zuo Qingluan, did you give it to Grandma?” Jun Wuxia asked curiously.","Zuo Qingluan nodded. She didn’t like Jun Wuxia because the princess was too proud for her liking. While other people called her Miss Qingluan, Jun Wuxia kept addressing her by her full name.","Jun Wuxia stared at Zuo Qingluan. “Hey, why isn’t there something for me?” “Wuxia!” Empress Dugu chided her.","Jun Wuxia snorted. “I see. She’s sucking up to Grandma.”","Zuo Qingluan bit her lower lip and disliked Jun Wuxia even more.","The empress dowager looked from Zuo Qingluan to Jun Wuxia. She didn’t say anything, but there was a pointed look in her eyes.","Zuo Qingluan had always considered herself the respectable sacred lady of Firmament Palace. Now, however, a mere princess was talking to her that way. Zuo Qingluan was furious.","However...","She couldn’t lose her temper now.","To marry Jun Linyuan, she had to win these women’s hearts first.","At that thought, she took a deep breath and fought back her rage. She then smiled at Jun Wuxia.","“I still have a bottle in Firmament Pavilion. I thought I would keep it for Her Majesty for future use. Would you like me to fetch it for you?” she asked Jun Wuxia.","Jun Wuxia snorted. “If you don’t want to give it to me, just say so. Are you trying to say that I’m taking Her Majesty’s face cream? Zuo Qingluan, you’re such a schemer!”","Zuo Qingluan glared at Jun Wuxia and took a deep breath. She didn’t know what to do with this rude princess.","She couldn’t control her temper for much longer.","Empress Dugu wanted to cover her daughter’s mouth and stop her from attacking one of their own.","She smiled awkwardly and said, “The two of you are cousins. Why are you quarreling? Wuxia, didn’t you say that Qingluan is your best friend? You went to her birthday party just the other day.”"]},{"number":2494,"title":"Chapter 2494 - Untitled","paragraphs":["That only made Jun Wuxia even more frustrated","She felt that she should never have gone to Zuo Qingluan’s birthday party.","Jun Wuxia had only been there because Feng Wu was her enemy. Since Feng Wu was protected by the crown prince, Jun Wuxia had to condescend to hang out with Zuo Qingluan. If Zuo Qingluan won back the crown prince’s heart, Jun Wuxia felt that she could then take care of Feng Wu.","But things didn’t turn out that way.","“Don’t even mention that birthday party,” Jun Wuxia snapped. “I thought my brother was going to be there, but he wasn’t!”","Zuo Qingluan’s face immediately darkened.","She had never been humiliated like this before.","Jun Wuxia was a spoiled child and had always gotten her way, so she just blurted out whatever was on her mind.","She saw Zuo Qingluan’s dark face and smirked. “I thought you would win my brother back from Feng Wu, but look what happened.”","Emperor Wu arrived at that moment to see his mother. Hearing the conversation, he told the eunuch not to announce his arrival. He hid behind a curtain and listened.","Jun Wuxia glared at Zuo Qingluan. “As it turned out, my brother went to the Feng clan!” “How do you know that?” The empress dowager stared at Jun Wuxia.","Jun Wuxia said, “Dugu Menghai was given the order to arrest Feng Wu, but his cultivation ability was destroyed as a result. My mom is from the Dugu family, which is why I know.”","The empress dowager frowned at Empress Dugu. “Is that true?”","Empress Dugu nodded with a pale face.","What happened to Dugu Menghai was a hard blow to the Dugu family, and Zuo Qingluan was the main reason behind it...","After what happened to Dugu Menghai, Zuo Qingluan became their only hope.","The empress dowager was infuriated.","Junjun and Feng Wu...","Jun Wuxia said, “And that’s not all. My brother gave out gift envelopes to everyone in the imperial capital. He spent a fortune for Feng Wu’s birthday!”","WHAT?!","The empress dowager smacked the table.","Zuo Qingluan turned pale.","The crown prince was supposed to be angry at Feng Wu, which would make Zuo Qingluan happy. However, the more Jun Linyuan cared about Feng Wu, the more humiliated Zuo Qingluan felt. She clenched her fists in her sleeves.","She wanted to scream.","She was supposed to be respected by everyone and not treated like this!","Zuo Qingluan rose to her feet.","Empress Dugu suddenly said, “Qingluan is very blessed.”","Where did that come from?","Everyone looked at her.","Empress Dugu chuckled. “Master Linghu himself said that Qingluan is very fortunate and blessed.”","Master Linghu said so?","The empress dowager immediately remembered something.","She had wanted to be the first precant of the year, but Master Linghu had said that he was going to give that opportunity to a very blessed child.","The empress dowager had been wondering who that child was.","“Did Master Linghu call you a blessed child?” The empress dowager stared at Zuo Qingluan."]},{"number":2495,"title":"Chapter 2495 - Why Did I Hear...","paragraphs":["Empress Dugu kept giving Zuo Qingluan warning looks, trying to remind her that she should grab this great opportunity. “Did Master Linghu call you a blessed child?” the empress dowager asked Zuo Qingluan. Given how smart Zuo Qingluan was, she obviously knew that the empress dowager didn’t like Feng Wu. Now was the best time to win the old lady’s heart.","As for being a blessed child... She was the sacred lady of Firmament Palace and the daughter of the Zuo family who was born with the True Phoenix Blood. Of course she was blessed!","Therefore, she nodded.","She nodded!","The empress dowager was shocked.","“You were the first precant of the year! Master Linghu chose you!” She stared at Zuo Qingluan.","Zuo Qingluan was baffled. What first precant?","Before she could ask, Empress Dugu answered the question for her.","“That’s right. Master Linghu called Qingluan a blessed child. She was also the first precant of the year. Your Majesty, what do you think of her?”","The empress dowager was speechless.","It was Zuo Qingluan. She hadn’t expected that.","She didn’t answer the question.","However, Emperor Wu, who had been standing behind the door curtain, was astonished.","How could Zuo Qingluan be so vain?!","The little monk of Wandering Temple had gone to Fallen Star Yard, and Feng Wu had been the one whom Master Linghu had chosen. How did Zuo Qingluan have anything to do with that?","He cleared his throat.","“My son is here.” The empress dowager was glad to see Emperor Wu.","Emperor Wu greeted the empress dowager and smiled. “I heard your cheerful conversation from miles away. What’s the occasion?”","The empress dowager said happily, “I found the lucky child who was chosen to be the first precant of the year.” Emperor Wu asked, “Who was it?” Empress Dugu gestured at Zuo Qingluan. “Your Majesty, it was Qingluan. Look. Isn’t she pretty? She’ll make the perfect wife for His Royal Highness. Master Linghu has acknowledged her great quality.”","Emperor Wu thought that Feng Wu was better looking","As for becoming Jun Linyuan’s wife, that wasn’t going to happen. She was vain enough to claim an honor that wasn’t hers, so what kind of quality could she have?","Of course, Emperor Wu wouldn’t be so straightforward. He only glanced at Zuo Qingluan and said, “So, you were Wandering Temple’s first precant of this year.”","Zuo Qingluan didn’t know what to say.","She knew what becoming the first precant meant, but...","The chance of pleasing the empress dowager was too tempting.","So, she had let Empress Dugu mislead the empress dowager. Now that Emperor Wu had asked the question specifically, Zuo Qingluan took a deep breath and nodded. “Yes, it was me.”","No, it wasn’t!","Emperor Wu wanted to shout at Zuo Qingluan. If Master Linghu knew what she was doing, he would probably slap her.","The girl had spread the rumor first, making everyone believe that Jun Linyuan was in love with her. Now, she was laying claim to something that she didn’t do. That was despicable!","Emperor Wu didn’t lose his temper. Instead, he asked, “Why did I hear that the first precant of Wandering Temple was Feng Wu?”"]},{"number":2496,"title":"Chapter 2496 - The Best Way","paragraphs":["WHAT?!","Everyone was astonished when they heard Emperor Wu’s words. Feng Wu?!","How did Feng Wu have anything to do with it?","The empress dowager stared at Emperor Wu. “You shouldn’t joke about such things! Feng Wu would never deserve such an honor!”","Emperor Wu was displeased.","That girl had saved the empress dowager many times; without her, the old lady wouldn’t be chatting here now.","However, being a loving son, Emperor Wu couldn’t say that to his mother’s face. Otherwise, she would cry her eyes out.","Empress Dugu and Zuo Qingluan gave each other astonished looks.","Feng Wu? How could it be her?!","Was it possible that His Royal Highness had helped Feng Wu to grab that chance?","In that case...","Zuo Qingluan would be so humiliated!","Just then, Concubine Oriole walked toward Emperor Wu with her hands on her bulging belly. “Your Majesty, that’s not possible. Feng Wu can’t be...”","She suddenly slipped and lost her balance.","“Ah!”","She fell to the floor.","She was eight months pregnant, and her belly was as round as a ball. It just so happened that she fell face first. “Ahhh —”","Concubine Oriole screamed in pain.","“Oriole!” Emperor Wu ran to her side. “How do you feel? Are you alright? Get the physician!” Concubine Oriole had the voice of a singing oriole, and Emperor Wu quite liked her. It had been a while since one of his women had a baby, and he was rather looking forward to this one.","But that fall...","Emperor Wu felt his blood run cold.","He looked at Zuo Qingluan. She was too far away to touch Concubine Oriole, and it wouldn’t be reasonable to suspect her.","But Emperor Wu still glanced at Gao.","Gao nodded, indicating that he would look into","it.","Master Bai soon arrived.","He said that Concubine Oriole shouldn’t be moved around, and it was better to treat her right on the spot.","For the baby’s safety, the empress dowager gave permission to have Concubine Oriole treated in Cining Palace.","“Master Bai, how’s the baby?” Emperor Wu asked.","Master Bai shook his head. “The pregnancy is quite advanced, and things can be tricky. Your Majesty, we need to prepare for the worst.”","Master Chu also arrived. After examining the patient, he reported to Emperor Wu.","Emperor Wu trusted him. He asked, “How is she? Is the baby safe?” Master Chu took a deep breath. “Your Majesty, in the worst case scenario, who will be the priority? The mother or the baby?”","Emperor Wu asked, “Is it that serious?”","Master Chu nodded. “Which will it be, then?”","Before Emperor Wu could reply, the empress dowager said coldly, “Concubine Oriole was so careless, and put the baby’s life in danger. If something happens to the little prince, she’ll pay with her own life! You shouldn’t be asking that question!”","“But...” Emperor Wu still had feelings for his concubine.","Zuo Qingluan was intrigued.","She thought about the question Emperor Wu had asked her, and wondered if he knew something","The best way to stop him from asking the question was..."]},{"number":2497,"title":"Chapter 2497 - Ahhh!","paragraphs":["The best way to do that was to do the emperor a favor!","Zuo Qingluan knew that if she could save Concubine Oriole and the baby, Emperor Wu would be grateful for what she did and would stop questioning her.","She was indeed the culprit who had tripped Concubine Oriole.","“I can help her,” Zuo Qingluan said calmly. “Firmament Palace is known for its medical skills. I’m the sacred lady, and I specialize in medicine.”","She turned to Emperor Wu. “If Your Majesty wants to keep both the lady and the baby alive, I’m the only one who can help them.”","Emperor Wu studied her. The truth was that he didn’t trust her, hence...","“Gao, go get Miss Feng Wu!” That order felt like a slap to Zuo Qingluan’s face.","Why was this even happening?! Why would Emperor Wu trust Feng Wu but not her?!","“Your Majesty!” Zuo Qingluan revered Emperor Wu, but her desire for Jun Linyuan prevailed. She said, “I’m a semi-Supreme Level physician and will soon be at the Supreme Level. Why would Feng Wu...”","“Semi?” Emperor Wu smirked. “Feng Wu passed that level a long time ago.” What was that supposed to mean? Zuo Qingluan was dumbfounded at first. Then, the empress dowager said, “That’s right. Go get Feng Wu. She’s the best candidate for the job.” WHAT?!","Zuo Qingluan’s cheeks flushed with fury.","She remembered the information Tongque had given her. It mentioned that Feng Wu had treated the empress dowager a few times with the assistance of Master Chu, and now, Master Chu was here.","Zuo Qingluan stared at Emperor Wu, and her eyes glinted.","She had been humiliated, and she would have her revenge.","She quickly hatched a plan.","Empress Dugu was also embarrassed. She led Zuo Qingluan to the side and whispered, “Feng Wu is indeed a capable physician. Don’t take the risk.”","Zuo Qingluan smirked. So what if Feng Wu was already a Supreme Level physician?","Other than medical skills, Firmament Palace was also great at something else: assassination. Their undead insects could kill a person without leaving a trace.","“Sure,” Zuo Qingluan replied.","She was so good at controlling her emotions that even Empress Dugu couldn’t see how furious she actually was.","Master Chu and Master Bai were doing their best to help Concubine Oriole.","Zuo Qingluan lowered her gaze.","She had done more than just trip Concubine Oriole.","Without her intervention, both mother and baby would die today!","In the end, the emperor would still have to ask for her help.","That thought greatly satisfied Zuo Qingluan.","Inside, the midwife was doing all she could to get the baby out.","But Concubine Oriole couldn’t go into labor, and the pain was excruciating.","She screamed at the top of her lungs.","Gradually, her voice became weaker.","Master Chu came out with his face covered in sweat. “Your Majesty, the lady is in critical condition, and I really need a hand!”","Emperor Wu gritted his teeth. “Feng Wu isn’t here yet.”","The empress dowager said, “It’s been almost five minutes! Where is she?!”"]},{"number":2498,"title":"Chapter 2498 - Princess Feng Wu Is Here","paragraphs":["Five minutes.","Granny Lan was speechless.","Gao probably hadn’t arrived at the Feng clan yet. Of course Miss Feng Wu couldn’t be here so soon. She didn’t have wings.","Master Chu turned to Emperor Wu. “Your Majesty, if someone doesn’t give me a hand now, we’ll lose both the mother and the baby.”","Emperor Wu was shocked. “Didn’t you say that you can save one of them?!”","Master Chu shook his head. “That was before. Things have become much worse now.” Zuo Qingluan smiled a little.","She was waiting for the emperor to beg her for help.","She was the only one who could save the lady and her baby.","She smirked for a split second, and Emperor Wu just happened to look at her at that moment.","Zuo Qingluan!","When Feng Wu interrogated Zuo He, the emperor heard Zuo He admit that Zuo Qingluan was the criminal mastermind behind the scheme against Feng Wu.","Emperor Wu hadn’t believed it at first.","Zuo Qingluan had only been a little girl back then; how bad could she be? She couldn’t be so cruel. But now, he believed it.","However, he still cared about his concubine and the baby. Even though he was the emperor, he still had to...","He didn’t like the idea of asking Zuo Qingluan for help at all!","Zuo Qingluan was so sure that Emperor Wu would ask her for help, when –","“Princess Feng Wu is here!”","Gao’s voice rang out. The next moment, Feng Wu rushed into the room.","“Your Majesty —”","She was about to greet Emperor Wu, when he grabbed her wrist and pushed her into the bedchamber.","“There’s no time for that! Help them!”","“Yes.”","It took Feng Wu less than three seconds from walking into the room to disappearing behind the door curtain of the bedchamber.","Zuo Qingluan couldn’t believe it.","How had Feng Wu arrived so soon?","Emperor Wu was so excited to see Feng Wu.","She was right on time!","He then glanced at Zuo Qingluan.","How dare you try to blackmail me?!","He had never been a magnanimous man, and now, he held a grudge against Zuo Qingluan. But Zuo Qingluan didn’t notice the look in his eyes.","She only cared about the woman in labor.","She had put an undead insect in Concubine Oriole. That was why the baby wouldn’t come out.","She believed that Feng Wu would never find out.","At that thought, Zuo Qingluan smirked again.","It was good news for her that Feng Wu had arrived so soon.","This way, she could prove to the world that despite being a Supreme Level physician, Feng Wu couldn’t save Concubine Oriole and her baby.","Seeing that things were getting messy, Mrs. Zuo gave Zuo Qingluan a warning glance, telling her to leave.","But Zuo Qingluan shook her head.","Mrs. Zuo was so anxious.","They had only been here for minutes, and so many things had happened. She began to panic.","But Zuo Qingluan was very confident."]},{"number":2499,"title":"Chapter 2499 - I Won’t Let Her","paragraphs":["Feng Wu was bound to fail, so Zuo Qingluan wasn’t worried.","As expected, Concubine Oriole’s voice grew weaker and weaker until she sounded like a cat meowing","Master Chu was assisting Feng Wu. At first, Feng Wu didn’t find out what was wrong.","She examined everything and checked the concubine’s pulse a few times but still found nothing.","Master Chu was worried. “Miss Wu, do you know what’s going on?”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at him.","Master Chu smiled bitterly. “His Majesty cares about the lady and her baby very much. If something goes wrong, we’re going to...”","Just then, Concubine Oriole grabbed Master Chu’s hand.","“Master Chu, help me!”","Master Chu drew back his hand and told Concubine Oriole, “Miss Feng Wu is a much better physician. I’m only assisting her. You should be asking for her help.”","“No...” Concubine Oriole shook her head. “She’s a bad person. She’ll kill me... Master Chu, please help me...”","Master Chu was shocked.","Why would she say such things in a moment like this?","He immediately said to Feng Wu, “Miss Wu, Concubine Oriole is only...”","Feng Wu said grumpily, “Let’s just save her life first.”","Concubine Oriole screamed, “I don’t need your help! You’re evil!”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at the woman. She couldn’t take it anymore.","She wasn’t obligated to save this woman.","She turned to leave.","When she walked out of the room, Emperor Wu immediately took her hands. “Kiddo, is Oriole alright?” Zuo Qingluan smirked.","Alright? She knew better than anyone else how Concubine Oriole was doing. The undead insect was still in her womb and stopping the baby from coming out.","Of course, she wouldn’t tell anyone what was going on.","Ever since Zuo Qingluan came back, she had been living in Feng Wu’s shadow. Now that she heard Concubine Oriole’s desperate cries, she felt so satisfied.","She had always known that she liked to see other people suffer.","Whenever someone else was in pain, she would find it cathartic.","Feng Wu glanced at Emperor Wu and gestured at the bedchamber.","“I won’t let her treat me! She’s evil! She’s going to kill me! You Majesty, please let Miss Zuo help me!”","Concubine Oriole shouted at the top of her lungs. Emperor Wu was furious.","But Zuo Qingluan looked pleased.","After hearing that, Emperor Wu had to let her treat the lady.","The empress dowager’s face darkened.","Concubine Oriole’s shouting was giving her a headache.","“Your Majesty, if Oriole is insisting that Zuo Qingluan treat her, I’m sure that something went wrong when Feng Wu was there. How about we let Zuo Qingluan treat her first? If the baby still won’t come out, we can then send Feng Wu in.”","The empress dowager had never considered the possibility that Feng Wu wouldn’t treat Oriole."]},{"number":2500,"title":"Chapter 2500 - She Left","paragraphs":["In the empress dowager’s eyes, Feng Wu should feel honored to be given the chance to treat a member of the royal family.","Emperor Wu said apologetically, “Xiao Wu, sorry about this. Concubine Oriole doesn’t know what she’s talking about. After the baby is born, I’ll make her apologize to you.”","Feng Wu waved him off. “There’s no need. If I’m not needed here, I’ll go back home.”","She promptly left after that.","Everyone was astonished. She left. Just like that?","How could she?","How could she act so arrogantly in front of the royal family? The empress dowager was furious.","“Let her go! We’ll be just fine without her! Concubine Oriole will be fine!” The empress dowager smirked. “How can a girl of her age have such a temper?!”","Jun Wuxia said, “My brother likes her just fine.”","The empress dowager wanted to smack Jun Wuxia on the head.","“Let Zuo Qingluan treat Oriole!” said the empress dowager. She then turned to Emperor Wu. “You may not trust the skills of Firmament Palace, but I do! Zuo Qingluan is a much better physician than Feng Wu!","“Go inside! If the prince is born safely, I’ll give you a big reward!” the empress dowager told Zuo Qingluan.","Zuo Qingluan bowed politely before going into the room.","The empress dowager was pleased. “That’s a perfect bow. She must have worked very hard on it.”","Granny Gui immediately said, “That’s so true. Her knees were bent at the perfect angle. It was so beautiful.”","Apart from Granny Gui, the empress dowager also had Granny Lan as her maid. Compared with Granny Gui, Granny Lan was a much more decent person.","She thought, Does she know how urgent the situation is? Nobody cares about a perfect bow! Of course, she wouldn’t dare say that out loud.","The empress dowager glared at Emperor Wu. “You’ve indulged that Feng Wu too much! How could she walk out on us like that? She needs to be tamed!”","Emperor Wu took a deep breath as he listened to his mother’s ranting.","Concubine Oriole was very frustrating, but Xiao Wu had left so quickly, too...","“I’ll talk to her later. She’s as stubborn as Jun Linyuan. I’ll make sure that she’s disciplined.”","“Disciplined?!”","The empress dowager couldn’t believe her ears. “If anything happens to Concubine Oriole and the baby, I’ll kill her!”","Emperor Wu said, “I’m sure that isn’t her fault.”","The empress dowager wanted to kick Emperor","Wu.","What happened to her docile son?!","The empress dowager smirked. “If Zuo Qingluan wasn’t here, Concubine Oriole and the baby would have been left to die! i’ll never forget what Feng Wu did!”"]}]);
